return <<<'SQL'
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Smeštaj na Zlatiboru za svako godišnje doba: apartmani u centru kod jezera, vile i brvnare u mirnijim naseljima, sobe u domaćinstvima i planinske kuće za veće društvo. Leti se ovde dolazi zbog šetnji i čistog vazduha, zimi zbog skijanja na Torniku, do kog iz centra vozi panoramska gondola.

Pre rezervacije pitajte koliko je smeštaj udaljen od jezera i pijace, jer se naselja prostiru daleko od centra, a zimi uzbrdice umeju da budu zaleđene. Proverite da li cena obuhvata parking, grejanje i boravišnu taksu i koliko se plaća unapred. Za Novu godinu, raspust i prvomajske praznike traži se rezervacija mesecima ranije. U okolini vredi obići Stopića pećinu, vodopad u Gostilju i etno selo Sirogojno. Ako razmišljate o svom apartmanu, pogledajte [prodaju stanova na Zlatiboru](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/zlatibor), a za drugačiji odmor [smeštaj na Tari](/oglasi/odmor/planine/tara) ili [u Vrnjačkoj Banji](/oglasi/odmor/banje/vrnjacka-banja).', text_en = 'Accommodation on Zlatibor for every season: apartments in the centre by the lake, villas and log cabins in quieter settlements, rooms in private homes and mountain houses for bigger groups. In summer people come for walks and clean air, in winter for skiing on Tornik, which is reached from the centre by a panoramic gondola.

Before booking, ask how far the place is from the lake and the market, because the settlements stretch far from the centre, and in winter the uphill roads can be icy. Check whether the price includes parking, heating and the tourist tax and how much is paid in advance. For New Year, the school holidays and the May Day break, bookings are needed months ahead. Nearby, Stopića Cave, the waterfall in Gostilje and the ethno village of Sirogojno are worth a visit. If you are thinking about an apartment of your own, see [flats for sale on Zlatibor](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/zlatibor), and for a different kind of break, [accommodation on Tara](/oglasi/odmor/planine/tara) or [in Vrnjačka Banja](/oglasi/odmor/banje/vrnjacka-banja).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'mountains') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Zlatibor') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja stanova na Zlatiboru odnosi se uglavnom na apartmane za odmor i izdavanje: studija i jednosobne apartmane u novim zgradama, veće porodične stanove i dupleks apartmane u potkrovlju. Gradi se mnogo, pa je izbor veliki, ali i razlike u kvalitetu.

Kod novogradnje tražite građevinsku dozvolu i proverite da li zgrada ima upotrebnu dozvolu, jer se bez nje stan ne može uknjižiti. Pitajte kako se zgrada greje i koliki su mesečni troškovi održavanja, i onda kada u apartmanu niko ne boravi. Ako kupujete radi izdavanja, raspitajte se ko će brinuti o gostima i čišćenju i koliku proviziju uzima. Udaljenost od jezera i pogled najviše utiču na cenu i na popunjenost. Parking mesto ili garaža zimi vrede mnogo. Uporedite ponudu sa stranicama [prodaja kuća na Zlatiboru](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/zlatibor) i [vikendice na Zlatiboru](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice/prodaja/zlatibor), a pre odluke provedite nekoliko dana u iznajmljenom [smeštaju](/oglasi/odmor/planine/zlatibor).', text_en = 'Flats for sale on Zlatibor are mostly apartments for holidays and letting: studios and one-bedroom apartments in new buildings, bigger family flats and duplex apartments in the attic. A great deal is being built, so the choice is wide, but so are the differences in quality.

With a new development, ask for the building permit and check whether the building has an occupancy permit, because without it the flat cannot be registered. Ask how the building is heated and what the monthly maintenance costs are, including when nobody is staying in the apartment. If you are buying to let, find out who will look after guests and cleaning and what commission they take. The distance from the lake and the view affect the price and the occupancy most. A parking space or garage is worth a lot in winter. Compare the offer with the pages [houses for sale on Zlatibor](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/zlatibor) and [cottages on Zlatibor](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice/prodaja/zlatibor), and before deciding spend a few days in rented [accommodation](/oglasi/odmor/planine/zlatibor).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Zlatibor') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Izdavanje stanova na Zlatiboru na duži period traže oni koji na planini rade ili žele da na njoj provedu celu sezonu: zaposleni u hotelima i restoranima, radnici na gradilištima, porodice koje se sele zbog vazduha i ljudi koji rade od kuće.

Većina apartmana se izdaje turistima na dan, pa stan na godinu dana treba tražiti van špica sezone, u proleće ili jesen, kada su vlasnici spremniji na dogovor. Pitajte da li cena važi tokom cele godine ili se menja zimi i leti. Grejanje je najveći trošak, zato proverite da li je na struju, pelet ili centralno i ko ga plaća. Dogovorite i čišćenje snega, parking i internet, koji je važan ako radite na daljinu. Posao na planini potražite među oglasima za [posao u ugostiteljstvu](/oglasi/posao/ugostiteljstvo), kraći boravak na stranici [smeštaj na Zlatiboru](/oglasi/odmor/planine/zlatibor), a kupovinu na stranici [prodaja stanova na Zlatiboru](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/zlatibor).', text_en = 'Flats to rent on Zlatibor for the longer term are sought by those who work on the mountain or want to spend a whole season there: staff of hotels and restaurants, workers on building sites, families moving for the air and people who work from home.

Most apartments are let to tourists by the day, so a flat for a year is best sought outside the peak season, in spring or autumn, when owners are more open to a deal. Ask whether the price holds all year round or changes in winter and summer. Heating is the biggest cost, so check whether it is electric, pellet or central and who pays for it. Agree on snow clearing, parking and the internet too, which matters if you work remotely. Look for work on the mountain among the ads for [hospitality jobs](/oglasi/posao/ugostiteljstvo), a shorter stay on the page [accommodation on Zlatibor](/oglasi/odmor/planine/zlatibor), and a purchase on the page [flats for sale on Zlatibor](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/zlatibor).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'rent' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Zlatibor') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja kuća na Zlatiboru: porodične kuće u Čajetini i okolnim selima, planinske vile sa više apartmana, brvnare na placu sa borovima i kuće u naseljima nadomak centra. Kuća sa nekoliko odvojenih jedinica često se kupuje da bi vlasnik u jednoj boravio, a ostale izdavao.

Na planini se kuća proverava drugačije nego u gradu. Krov mora da nosi sneg, pa pogledajte nagib, pokrivač i tavansku konstrukciju. Pitajte odakle stiže voda, da li je kuća priključena na kanalizaciju i kako se prilazni put održava zimi. Proverite da li je objekat uknjižen sa svim dogradnjama i da li plac ima uredan izlaz na put. Izolacija i način grejanja odlučuju o tome koliko će vas koštati zima. Manje i jeftinije objekte nudi stranica [vikendice na Zlatiboru](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice/prodaja/zlatibor), parcele za gradnju stranica [placevi na Zlatiboru](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/zlatibor), a celu ponudu stranica [nekretnine na Zlatiboru](/oglasi/nekretnine/zlatibor).', text_en = 'Houses for sale on Zlatibor: family houses in Čajetina and the surrounding villages, mountain villas with several apartments, log cabins on a plot with pine trees and houses in settlements close to the centre. A house with several separate units is often bought so that the owner stays in one and lets the others.

On the mountain a house is checked differently than in a city. The roof has to carry snow, so look at the pitch, the covering and the roof structure. Ask where the water comes from, whether the house is connected to the sewer and how the access road is kept clear in winter. Check that the building is registered with all its extensions and that the plot has proper access to the road. The insulation and the type of heating decide how much the winter will cost you. Smaller and cheaper buildings are on the page [cottages on Zlatibor](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice/prodaja/zlatibor), parcels for building on the page [plots on Zlatibor](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/zlatibor), and the whole offer on the page [real estate on Zlatibor](/oglasi/nekretnine/zlatibor).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'houses') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Zlatibor') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja vikendica na Zlatiboru: drvene brvnare, male zidane kuće, montažne planinske kućice i stariji vikend objekti na većim placevima, u naseljima i selima oko centra. Traže ih porodice koje žele svoje mesto za vikende, bez obaveza koje nosi velika kuća.

Stare vikendice često imaju veći i lepši plac od novih, ali traže ulaganje: proverite temelj, krov, drvenariju i instalacije pre nego što se dogovorite o ceni. Drvo pregledajte pri zemlji i oko prozora, gde ga najpre načne vlaga. Pitajte da li vikendica ima stalan priključak struje i vode ili se voda zimi zatvara. Raspitajte se da li plan dozvoljava dogradnju, ako planirate proširenje. Sneg i led otežavaju prilaz, pa mesto pogledajte i zimi. Veće objekte nudi stranica [prodaja kuća na Zlatiboru](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/zlatibor), apartmane u zgradama stranica [prodaja stanova na Zlatiboru](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/zlatibor), a mirniju planinu stranica [vikendice na Tari](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice/prodaja/tara).', text_en = 'Cottages for sale on Zlatibor: wooden log cabins, small brick houses, prefabricated mountain cabins and older weekend buildings on bigger plots, in the settlements and villages around the centre. They are sought by families who want a place of their own for weekends without the duties a big house brings.

Old cottages often have a bigger and nicer plot than new ones, but they need investment: check the foundations, the roof, the woodwork and the installations before you agree a price. Inspect timber near the ground and around the windows, where damp attacks it first. Ask whether the cottage has a permanent electricity and water connection or the water is shut off in winter. Find out whether the plan allows an extension, if you intend to enlarge it. Snow and ice make access harder, so see the place in winter too. Bigger buildings are on the page [houses for sale on Zlatibor](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/zlatibor), apartments in blocks on the page [flats for sale on Zlatibor](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/zlatibor), and a quieter mountain on the page [cottages on Tara](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice/prodaja/tara).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'cottages') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Zlatibor') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja placeva i zemljišta na Zlatiboru: građevinske parcele u naseljima oko centra, placevi sa pogledom na obroncima, livade i pašnjaci u okolnim selima i veće parcele za turističke objekte. Zemljište je ovde skuplje nego na većini drugih planina, a cena pada sa udaljenošću od centra.

Najvažnije je šta plan dozvoljava: u opštini Čajetina zatražite informaciju o lokaciji i proverite spratnost, zauzetost parcele i namenu. Livada koja se prodaje kao plac ne mora biti građevinsko zemljište. Proverite da li do parcele vodi put upisan u katastar i koliko su udaljeni struja, voda i kanalizacija, jer dovođenje priključaka na planini košta mnogo. Na nagnutom terenu računajte na skuplje temelje i potporne zidove. Gotove objekte nude stranice [prodaja kuća na Zlatiboru](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/zlatibor) i [vikendice na Zlatiboru](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice/prodaja/zlatibor), a zemljište u nacionalnom parku stranica [placevi na Tari](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/tara).', text_en = 'Plots and land for sale on Zlatibor: building parcels in the settlements around the centre, plots with a view on the slopes, meadows and pastures in the surrounding villages and bigger parcels for tourist buildings. Land here is more expensive than on most other mountains, and the price falls with distance from the centre.

What the plan allows matters most: ask the municipality of Čajetina for the location information and check the number of storeys, the plot coverage and the designated use. A meadow sold as a plot does not have to be building land. Check that a road entered in the land registry leads to the parcel and how far away electricity, water and sewerage are, because bringing connections up a mountain costs a lot. On sloping ground, allow for more expensive foundations and retaining walls. Finished buildings are on the pages [houses for sale on Zlatibor](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/zlatibor) and [cottages on Zlatibor](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice/prodaja/zlatibor), and land in a national park on the page [plots on Tara](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/tara).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'land') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Zlatibor') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Nekretnine na Zlatiboru na jednom mestu: apartmani i stanovi u novogradnji, kuće i vile, vikendice i brvnare, placevi za gradnju, lokali i poslovni prostor u centru. Tržište je živo tokom cele godine, jer se ovde kupuje i za odmor i kao ulaganje.

Pre nego što krenete u obilazak, odlučite čemu nekretnina služi. Za sopstveni odmor važniji su mir, pogled i dvorište, a za izdavanje blizina centra, parking i lako održavanje. Računajte i troškove koji se ne vide u oglasu: porez, održavanje zgrade, grejanje u praznom stanu i upravljanje izdavanjem. Filter „Oglašava“ odvaja ponude vlasnika od ponuda agencija i investitora. Ponudu možete podeliti na [prodaju stanova](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/zlatibor), [prodaju kuća](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/zlatibor) i [placeve](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/zlatibor), a iznajmljeni [smeštaj na Zlatiboru](/oglasi/odmor/planine/zlatibor) dobar je način da upoznate naselja pre kupovine.', text_en = 'Real estate on Zlatibor in one place: apartments and flats in new developments, houses and villas, cottages and log cabins, building plots, shops and commercial space in the centre. The market is lively all year round, because people buy here both for holidays and as an investment.

Before you start viewing, decide what the property is for. For your own holidays, peace, a view and a garden matter more; for letting, closeness to the centre, parking and easy upkeep. Count the costs that do not show in an ad too: tax, building maintenance, heating an empty flat and letting management. The "Advertiser" filter separates owners'' offers from those of agencies and developers. You can split the offer into [flats for sale](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/zlatibor), [houses for sale](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/zlatibor) and [plots](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/zlatibor), and rented [accommodation on Zlatibor](/oglasi/odmor/planine/zlatibor) is a good way to get to know the settlements before buying.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'real-estate') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Zlatibor') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Smeštaj na Tari bira onaj ko traži šumu i tišinu: brvnare i planinske kuće na Kaluđerskim Barama i Mitrovcu, vikendice oko jezera Zaovine, sobe i apartmani u Bajinoj Bašti i kuće uz Drinu i jezero Perućac. Cela planina je nacionalni park, sa uređenim stazama i vidikovcima, od kojih je najpoznatiji Banjska stena.

Naselja su međusobno udaljena, pa pre rezervacije pogledajte na mapi koliko ima do prodavnice, restorana i vidikovaca koje želite da obiđete. Zimi pitajte da li se put do kuće čisti i da li je potreban automobil sa lancima. Signal mobilne mreže i internet nisu svuda dobri, što je nekome mana, a nekome razlog dolaska. Za letnje kupanje birajte smeštaj bliže Perućcu. Vlasnici neka u oglasu navedu čime se kuća greje i koliko osoba prima. Življu planinu nudi [smeštaj na Zlatiboru](/oglasi/odmor/planine/zlatibor), a sopstveni kutak stranica [vikendice na Tari](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice/prodaja/tara).', text_en = 'Accommodation on Tara is chosen by those looking for forest and silence: log cabins and mountain houses at Kaluđerske Bare and Mitrovac, cottages around Lake Zaovine, rooms and apartments in Bajina Bašta and houses along the Drina and Lake Perućac. The whole mountain is a national park, with marked trails and viewpoints, the best known of which is Banjska Stena.

The settlements are far apart, so before booking look on the map at how far it is to a shop, a restaurant and the viewpoints you want to visit. In winter, ask whether the road to the house is cleared and whether you need a car with snow chains. Mobile signal and internet are not good everywhere, which is a drawback for some and the reason for coming for others. For summer swimming, choose a place closer to Perućac. Owners should say in the ad how the house is heated and how many people it sleeps. [Accommodation on Zlatibor](/oglasi/odmor/planine/zlatibor) offers a livelier mountain, and the page [cottages on Tara](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice/prodaja/tara) a corner of your own.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'mountains') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Tara') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja vikendica na Tari: brvnare i planinske kuće na Kaluđerskim Barama, vikendice u Zaovinama sa pogledom na jezero, kuće u selima iznad Bajine Bašte i objekti uz Drinu. Ponuda je manja nego na drugim planinama, pa dobre lokacije brzo nalaze kupca.

Tara je nacionalni park i pravila gradnje su stroga: pre kupovine proverite da li je vikendica legalna, u kojoj je zoni zaštite i da li je dozvoljena bilo kakva dogradnja. Pitajte kako se rešavaju voda i otpadne vode, jer javne mreže nema svuda. Do nekih naselja zimi se stiže samo terenskim vozilom. Struju proverite na licu mesta, uključujući jačinu priključka ako planirate grejanje na struju. Drveni objekat pregledajte zbog vlage i insekata. Ako želite da gradite sami, pogledajte [placeve na Tari](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/tara). Pre odluke iznajmite [smeštaj na Tari](/oglasi/odmor/planine/tara) u više godišnjih doba, a pristupačniju ponudu sa više sadržaja daju [vikendice na Zlatiboru](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice/prodaja/zlatibor).', text_en = 'Cottages for sale on Tara: log cabins and mountain houses at Kaluđerske Bare, cottages in Zaovine with a view of the lake, houses in the villages above Bajina Bašta and buildings along the Drina. The offer is smaller than on other mountains, so good locations find a buyer fast.

Tara is a national park and the building rules are strict: before buying, check that the cottage is legal, which protection zone it is in and whether any extension is allowed at all. Ask how water and waste water are dealt with, because there is no public network everywhere. Some settlements can be reached in winter only by an off-road vehicle. Check the electricity on the spot, including the strength of the connection if you plan electric heating. Inspect a wooden building for damp and insects. If you want to build yourself, see [plots on Tara](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/tara). Before deciding, rent [accommodation on Tara](/oglasi/odmor/planine/tara) in several seasons, and [cottages on Zlatibor](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice/prodaja/zlatibor) give a more accessible offer with more amenities.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'cottages') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Tara') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja placeva i zemljišta na Tari: parcele na Kaluđerskim Barama i u Zaovinama, livade i šume u selima oko Bajine Bašte, placevi uz Drinu i imanja sa starim kućama. Kupuju se najčešće za vikendicu, etno domaćinstvo ili manji turistički objekat.

Pošto je planina nacionalni park, prvo pitanje nije cena nego da li se na parceli uopšte sme graditi. Proverite stepen zaštite i plan, a o uslovima se raspitajte u opštini i kod upravljača parka. Šumsko zemljište se ne može slobodno krčiti. Proverite da li parcela ima pravni pristup sa javnog puta i koliko su daleko struja i voda. Na strmim parcelama deo površine nije upotrebljiv, pa plac obiđite peške, sa skicom iz katastra u ruci. Gotove objekte nudi stranica [vikendice na Tari](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice/prodaja/tara), parcele bliže uređenoj infrastrukturi stranica [placevi na Zlatiboru](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/zlatibor), a savete o gradnji stranica [građevinski placevi](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/gradjevinski-placevi).', text_en = 'Plots and land for sale on Tara: parcels at Kaluđerske Bare and in Zaovine, meadows and forests in the villages around Bajina Bašta, plots along the Drina and holdings with old houses. They are mostly bought for a cottage, an ethno household or a small tourist facility.

As the mountain is a national park, the first question is not the price but whether building on the parcel is allowed at all. Check the level of protection and the plan, and ask about the conditions at the municipality and with the park management. Forest land cannot be cleared freely. Check that the parcel has legal access from a public road and how far away electricity and water are. On steep parcels part of the area is unusable, so walk the plot with the cadastral sketch in your hand. Finished buildings are on the page [cottages on Tara](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice/prodaja/tara), parcels closer to developed infrastructure on the page [plots on Zlatibor](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/zlatibor), and advice on building on the page [building plots](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/gradjevinski-placevi).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'land') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Tara') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Smeštaj na Kopaoniku traži se najviše zimi, jer je ovo najveći ski centar u Srbiji: apartmani u vikend naselju i centru, hoteli, vile sa više jedinica i povoljniji smeštaj u Brzeću i okolnim selima. Leti je planina mirnija i jeftinija, sa stazama za pešačenje i bicikl.

Kod zimske rezervacije najvažnije je koliko ste daleko od žičare: smeštaj uz stazu štedi nošenje opreme i vožnju, ali se plaća više. Ako ste dalje, pitajte da li postoji prevoz do skijališta i gde se ostavlja oprema. Proverite da li je parking uključen, jer je u centru ograničen. Zimi su obavezne zimske gume, a korisno je imati i lance. Termini oko Nove godine i školskog raspusta popune se mesecima unapred. Opremu potražite na stranici [skije i pancerice](/oglasi/sport/zimski-sportovi/skije-i-pancerice), sezonski posao na stranici [oglasi za posao na Kopaoniku](/oglasi/posao/kopaonik), a mirnije skijalište nudi [smeštaj na Staroj planini](/oglasi/odmor/planine/stara-planina).', text_en = 'Accommodation on Kopaonik is most in demand in winter, as this is the biggest ski resort in Serbia: apartments in the weekend settlement and the centre, hotels, villas with several units and cheaper places in Brzeće and the surrounding villages. In summer the mountain is quieter and cheaper, with trails for hiking and cycling.

With a winter booking, what matters most is how far you are from the lift: a place by the piste saves carrying kit and driving, but costs more. If you are further away, ask whether there is transport to the slopes and where the equipment is left. Check whether parking is included, because it is limited in the centre. Winter tyres are mandatory in winter, and snow chains are useful too. Dates around New Year and the school holidays fill up months in advance. Look for equipment on the page [skis and ski boots](/oglasi/sport/zimski-sportovi/skije-i-pancerice), seasonal work on the page [jobs on Kopaonik](/oglasi/posao/kopaonik), and [accommodation on Stara Planina](/oglasi/odmor/planine/stara-planina) offers a quieter ski area.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'mountains') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Kopaonik') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja stanova na Kopaoniku znači pre svega apartmane za skijaše: male studio apartmane, jednosobne apartmane sa galerijom i veće jedinice u vilama i apart-hotelima, u vikend naselju, centru i Brzeću. Kupuju se za sopstveni odmor i za izdavanje tokom sezone.

Kopaonik je nacionalni park i na njemu je bilo mnogo gradnje sa nerešenim papirima, zato je provera dokumentacije ovde važnija nego igde. Tražite list nepokretnosti i proverite da li je apartman uknjižen kao posebna jedinica. Raspitajte se o godišnjim troškovima zgrade, grejanju i čišćenju snega. Ako apartman vodi upravljač, pročitajte ugovor: koliko dana godišnje ga koristite vi i kako se deli prihod. Blizina žičare najviše diže cenu i popunjenost. Kako se apartmani izdaju, vidi se na stranici [smeštaj na Kopaoniku](/oglasi/odmor/planine/kopaonik). Planinu sa dužom letnjom sezonom nudi [prodaja stanova na Zlatiboru](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/zlatibor), a savete za kupce stranica [prodaja stanova](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja).', text_en = 'Flats for sale on Kopaonik means above all apartments for skiers: small studios, one-bedroom apartments with a gallery and bigger units in villas and apart-hotels, in the weekend settlement, the centre and Brzeće. They are bought for one''s own holidays and for letting during the season.

Kopaonik is a national park and a lot was built there with unresolved papers, so checking the documents matters more here than anywhere. Ask for the land registry extract and check that the apartment is registered as a separate unit. Ask about the yearly costs of the building, the heating and snow clearing. If the apartment is run by a management company, read the contract: how many days a year you use it yourself and how the income is shared. Closeness to the lift raises the price and the occupancy most. How apartments are let can be seen on the page [accommodation on Kopaonik](/oglasi/odmor/planine/kopaonik). [Flats for sale on Zlatibor](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/zlatibor) offer a mountain with a longer summer season, and the page [flats for sale](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja) has advice for buyers.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Kopaonik') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Oglasi za posao na Kopaoniku prate ritam sezone: pred zimu se traže konobari, kuvari, pomoćni radnici u kuhinji, sobarice, recepcioneri, radnici u ski servisima i iznajmljivanju opreme, instruktori skijanja, vozači i radnici na održavanju. Manji deo poslova postoji i leti.

Sezonski posao na planini obično podrazumeva smeštaj i hranu, pa pitajte šta je od toga uključeno i u kakvim uslovima se stanuje. Dogovorite platu, radno vreme, slobodne dane i trajanje angažmana pre polaska, i tražite da budete prijavljeni. Proverite poslodavca: ozbiljan oglas navodi naziv hotela ili restorana i ne traži nikakvu uplatu. Instruktorima je potrebna licenca, a konobarima i kuvarima iskustvo sa većim brojem gostiju. Prijave počinju već u jesen. Slične poslove u drugim mestima nudi stranica [posao u ugostiteljstvu](/oglasi/posao/ugostiteljstvo), sve ostale stranica [oglasi za posao](/oglasi/posao), a kako izgleda planina u sezoni, pokazuje stranica [smeštaj na Kopaoniku](/oglasi/odmor/planine/kopaonik).', text_en = 'Job ads on Kopaonik follow the rhythm of the season: before winter there is demand for waiters, cooks, kitchen assistants, chambermaids, receptionists, staff for ski service and equipment hire, ski instructors, drivers and maintenance workers. A smaller share of the jobs exists in summer too.

Seasonal work on the mountain usually comes with accommodation and food, so ask what is included and what the living conditions are. Agree the pay, the working hours, the days off and the length of the engagement before you set off, and ask to be registered. Check the employer: a serious ad names the hotel or restaurant and asks for no payment of any kind. Instructors need a licence, and waiters and cooks need experience with large numbers of guests. Applications start as early as autumn. Similar jobs elsewhere are on the page [hospitality jobs](/oglasi/posao/ugostiteljstvo), all the others on the page [job ads](/oglasi/posao), and the page [accommodation on Kopaonik](/oglasi/odmor/planine/kopaonik) shows what the mountain is like in season.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'jobs') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Kopaonik') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Smeštaj u Vrnjačkoj Banji, najposećenijoj banji u Srbiji: apartmani i sobe uz promenadu, vile iz starog banjskog jezgra, privatne kuće sa dvorištem i moderni apartmani sa bazenom i sadržajima za opuštanje. Gosti dolaze zbog mineralnih izvora, parka i dugih šetnji, a leti i zbog festivala i akva parka.

Banja je na padini, pa pitajte koliko je smeštaj udaljen od promenade i koliko je uspona do njega, što je važno starijim gostima. Ako dolazite na terapije, birajte smeštaj blizu izvora ili specijalne bolnice. U julu i avgustu centar je bučan do kasno, pa porodice sa malom decom često biraju mirnije ulice. Proverite parking, jer je u centru naplata po zonama. Izdavaoci neka navedu da li primaju goste na jedno noćenje. Izlet na planinu Goč je na dohvat ruke. Sličan odmor nudi [smeštaj u Sokobanji](/oglasi/odmor/banje/sokobanja), a ko želi svoj apartman, neka pogleda [prodaju stanova u Vrnjačkoj Banji](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/vrnjacka-banja).', text_en = 'Accommodation in Vrnjačka Banja, the most visited spa in Serbia: apartments and rooms along the promenade, villas from the old spa core, private houses with a garden and modern apartments with a pool and relaxation facilities. Guests come for the mineral springs, the park and long walks, and in summer for the festivals and the water park too.

The spa lies on a slope, so ask how far the place is from the promenade and how much of a climb there is to it, which matters to older guests. If you are coming for treatments, choose a place near the springs or the special hospital. In July and August the centre is noisy until late, so families with small children often choose quieter streets. Check the parking, because the centre is charged by zones. Hosts should say whether they take guests for a single night. A trip to Mount Goč is within easy reach. [Accommodation in Sokobanja](/oglasi/odmor/banje/sokobanja) offers a similar break, and anyone who wants an apartment of their own should see [flats for sale in Vrnjačka Banja](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/vrnjacka-banja).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'spas') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Vrnjačka Banja') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja stanova u Vrnjačkoj Banji: apartmani u novim zgradama nadomak promenade, stanovi u starijim zgradama u centru, veći porodični stanovi u mirnijim delovima i jedinice u kompleksima sa bazenom. Kupuju ih i ljudi koji se u banju sele u penziji i oni koji računaju na izdavanje gostima.

Banja ima dugu sezonu, ali zarada od izdavanja zavisi od lokacije: gosti najviše traže ravan prilaz promenadi i parking. Kod novogradnje proverite investitora, dozvole i rok završetka, a kod starijih zgrada stanje instalacija i krova. Pitajte kako se zgrada greje, jer nema svaka centralno grejanje. Za stalno stanovanje važni su blizina doma zdravlja, pijace i autobuske stanice. Ako stan kupujete na kredit, proverite da li je uknjižen. Kuće sa dvorištem nudi stranica [prodaja kuća u Vrnjačkoj Banji](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/vrnjacka-banja), tržište izdavanja pokazuje stranica [smeštaj u Vrnjačkoj Banji](/oglasi/odmor/banje/vrnjacka-banja), a banju pod Ozrenom stranica [prodaja stanova u Sokobanji](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/sokobanja).', text_en = 'Flats for sale in Vrnjačka Banja: apartments in new buildings close to the promenade, flats in older buildings in the centre, bigger family flats in quieter parts and units in complexes with a pool. They are bought both by people moving to the spa in retirement and by those counting on letting to guests.

The spa has a long season, but income from letting depends on the location: guests look most for level access to the promenade and parking. With a new development, check the developer, the permits and the completion date; with older buildings, the state of the installations and the roof. Ask how the building is heated, because not every one has central heating. For living there all year, closeness to the health centre, the market and the bus station matters. If you are buying with a loan, check that the flat is registered. Houses with a garden are on the page [houses for sale in Vrnjačka Banja](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/vrnjacka-banja), the letting market shows on the page [accommodation in Vrnjačka Banja](/oglasi/odmor/banje/vrnjacka-banja), and the spa below Ozren on the page [flats for sale in Sokobanja](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/sokobanja).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Vrnjačka Banja') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja kuća u Vrnjačkoj Banji: porodične kuće sa baštom u mirnim ulicama, stare banjske vile koje čekaju obnovu, kuće sa više apartmana za izdavanje i imanja u okolnim selima sa pogledom na dolinu Zapadne Morave.

Kuća sa odvojenim ulazima i kupatilima za goste donosi prihod veći deo godine, ali traži kategorizaciju smeštaja i stalnu brigu, pa procenite koliko vremena možete da posvetite izdavanju. Stare vile su lepe, ali mogu biti pod zaštitom kao deo banjskog jezgra, što ograničava prepravke: raspitajte se pre kupovine. Na padinama proverite odvodnjavanje dvorišta i stanje potpornih zidova. Pogledajte krov, stolariju i grejanje i pitajte koliki su zimi računi. Proverite da li su svi objekti na placu ucrtani i uknjiženi. Manje obaveza nosi [stan u Vrnjačkoj Banji](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/vrnjacka-banja), opšte savete daje stranica [prodaja kuća](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja), a majstore za obnovu rubrika [majstori i građevinske usluge](/oglasi/usluge/majstori).', text_en = 'Houses for sale in Vrnjačka Banja: family houses with a garden in quiet streets, old spa villas waiting to be restored, houses with several apartments for letting and holdings in the surrounding villages with a view of the West Morava valley.

A house with separate entrances and bathrooms for guests brings income for most of the year, but it needs an accommodation rating and constant care, so judge how much time you can give to letting. The old villas are beautiful, but they may be protected as part of the spa core, which limits alterations: ask before buying. On slopes, check the drainage of the garden and the state of the retaining walls. Look at the roof, the joinery and the heating and ask how high the bills are in winter. Check that all the buildings on the plot are drawn in and registered. A [flat in Vrnjačka Banja](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/vrnjacka-banja) brings fewer duties, general advice is on the page [houses for sale](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja), and builders for a restoration are in [tradesmen and building services](/oglasi/usluge/majstori).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'houses') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Vrnjačka Banja') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Smeštaj u Sokobanji, banji između planina Ozren i Rtanj: apartmani i sobe u centru, kuće sa dvorištem, vile sa bazenom i domaćinstva u okolnim selima. Banja je poznata po čistom vazduhu i dolaze i gosti sa disajnim tegobama, a stara izreka kaže da se ovde dođe star, a ode mlad.

U centru je sve na nekoliko minuta hoda: šetalište, park i staro tursko kupatilo. Ko želi mir, bira smeštaj bliže izletištima Lepterija i Ozren, ali tada dobro dođe automobil. Leti je najveća gužva, pa rezervišite ranije i pitajte da li smeštaj ima klimu i dvorište. Proverite da li se plaća akontacija i pod kojim uslovima se vraća. U blizini su Bovansko jezero za kupanje, tvrđava Sokograd i vrelo Moravice. Uspon na Rtanj traži dobru obuću i ceo dan. Veću banju sa više sadržaja nudi [smeštaj u Vrnjačkoj Banji](/oglasi/odmor/banje/vrnjacka-banja), a za trajni boravak pogledajte [prodaju stanova u Sokobanji](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/sokobanja).', text_en = 'Accommodation in Sokobanja, the spa between the mountains Ozren and Rtanj: apartments and rooms in the centre, houses with a garden, villas with a pool and households in the surrounding villages. The spa is known for clean air and also draws guests with breathing problems, and an old saying has it that you arrive here old and leave young.

In the centre everything is a few minutes'' walk away: the promenade, the park and the old Turkish bath. Those who want peace choose a place closer to the picnic areas of Lepterija and Ozren, but then a car comes in handy. Summer is the busiest time, so book earlier and ask whether the place has air conditioning and a garden. Check whether an advance payment is required and on what terms it is refunded. Nearby are Lake Bovan for swimming, the Sokograd fortress and the Moravica spring. The climb up Rtanj takes good footwear and a whole day. [Accommodation in Vrnjačka Banja](/oglasi/odmor/banje/vrnjacka-banja) offers a bigger spa with more to do, and for a permanent stay see [flats for sale in Sokobanja](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/sokobanja).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'spas') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Sokobanja') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja stanova u Sokobanji: apartmani u novim manjim zgradama, stanovi u centru blizu šetališta i parka, stanovi sa pogledom na Ozren i jedinice u vilama. Poslednjih godina se gradi više nego ranije, pa se uz stare stanove nudi i dosta novogradnje.

Sokobanja je manja i mirnija od većih banja, što kupci cene, ali to znači i kraću glavnu sezonu za izdavanje: računicu pravite oprezno. Pitajte koliko dana godišnje se sličan apartman zaista izda. Proverite dozvole i uknjiženost, a kod apartmana u potkrovlju visinu prostorija i izolaciju krova. Grejanje je najčešće na struju ili klima uređajima, pa pogledajte energetski razred zgrade i stolariju. Ko se seli za stalno, treba da proveri kako su zimi organizovani prevoz i zdravstvena služba. Kako gosti biraju, vidi se na stranici [smeštaj u Sokobanji](/oglasi/odmor/banje/sokobanja). Veće tržište nudi [prodaja stanova u Vrnjačkoj Banji](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/vrnjacka-banja), a opšte savete stranica [prodaja stanova](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja).', text_en = 'Flats for sale in Sokobanja: apartments in small new buildings, flats in the centre near the promenade and the park, flats with a view of Ozren and units in villas. More has been built in recent years than before, so alongside old flats there is a good deal of new development.

Sokobanja is smaller and quieter than the bigger spas, which buyers value, but that also means a shorter main season for letting: do your sums carefully. Ask how many days a year a similar apartment is really let. Check the permits and the registration, and with attic apartments the ceiling height and the roof insulation. Heating is mostly electric or by air conditioners, so look at the energy class of the building and the joinery. Anyone moving for good should check how transport and health care are organised in winter. How guests choose can be seen on the page [accommodation in Sokobanja](/oglasi/odmor/banje/sokobanja). [Flats for sale in Vrnjačka Banja](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/vrnjacka-banja) offer a bigger market, and the page [flats for sale](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja) general advice.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Sokobanja') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Smeštaj na Srebrnom jezeru, rukavcu Dunava kod Velikog Gradišta koji zovu i srpsko more: apartmani i vile uz obalu, kuće sa dvorištem u vikend naselju, sobe u Velikom Gradištu i mesta u kampu. Sezona kupanja traje od juna do septembra, a plaže, akva park i šetalište tada su puni.

Pre rezervacije proverite koliko je smeštaj udaljen od plaže i da li ima parking, jer se vikendom teško nalazi mesto. Porodice sa decom traže blizinu akva parka i plićaka, a ribolovci mirniji deo obale i mesto za čamac. Pitajte za komarnike i klimu, koji su uz vodu važni. Za avgust rezervišite znatno ranije. Odavde je lak izlet do Golubačke tvrđave i ulaza u Đerdapsku klisuru. Ako vam se mesto dopadne, postoje i [vikendice na prodaju na Srebrnom jezeru](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice/prodaja/srebrno-jezero). Jezero na severu zemlje nudi [smeštaj na Paliću](/oglasi/odmor/jezera-i-reke/palic), a opremu za vodu rubrika [SUP daske i kajaci](/oglasi/sport/vodeni-sportovi).', text_en = 'Accommodation at Srebrno Jezero, the arm of the Danube near Veliko Gradište also called the Serbian sea: apartments and villas by the shore, houses with a garden in the weekend settlement, rooms in Veliko Gradište and pitches at the campsite. The swimming season lasts from June to September, when the beaches, the water park and the promenade are full.

Before booking, check how far the place is from the beach and whether it has parking, because a space is hard to find at weekends. Families with children look for somewhere near the water park and the shallows, and anglers for a quieter part of the shore and a place for a boat. Ask about insect screens and air conditioning, which matter by the water. For August, book well ahead. From here it is an easy trip to Golubac Fortress and the entrance to the Đerdap Gorge. If you take to the place, there are [cottages for sale at Srebrno Jezero](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice/prodaja/srebrno-jezero) too. [Accommodation at Palić](/oglasi/odmor/jezera-i-reke/palic) offers a lake in the north of the country, and gear for the water is in [SUP boards and kayaks](/oglasi/sport/vodeni-sportovi).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'lakes-rivers') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Srebrno jezero') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja vikendica na Srebrnom jezeru: kuće u vikend naseljima uz jezero, vile sa bazenom, manje vikendice sa dvorištem i objekti sa apartmanima za izdavanje. Kupci su najčešće porodice koje ovde letuju godinama, kao i oni koji leti izdaju turistima.

Blizina vode nosi i obaveze. Pitajte da li je plac bio plavljen pri visokom vodostaju Dunava i kako je rešena odbrana od poplava. Proverite vlagu u zidovima prizemlja i stanje fasade. Objekat mora biti legalan i uknjižen, a posebno proverite pomoćne objekte, bazen i pristup obali, ako se prodaju kao deo imanja. Sezona izdavanja je kratka i jaka, pa prihod procenjujte prema letnjim mesecima. Van sezone naselje je tiho, što nekome odgovara, a nekome ne. Pogledajte kako izgleda ponuda na stranici [smeštaj na Srebrnom jezeru](/oglasi/odmor/jezera-i-reke/srebrno-jezero). Vikendice na planini nudi stranica [vikendice na Fruškoj gori](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice/prodaja/fruska-gora), a čamac za jezero rubrika [čamci i plovila](/oglasi/vozila/camci).', text_en = 'Cottages for sale at Srebrno Jezero: houses in the weekend settlements by the lake, villas with a pool, smaller cottages with a garden and buildings with apartments for letting. The buyers are mostly families who have spent their summers here for years, and those who let to tourists in summer.

Being close to water brings duties too. Ask whether the plot was flooded when the Danube was high and how flood defence is handled. Check for damp in the ground-floor walls and the state of the facade. The building must be legal and registered, and check outbuildings, the pool and the access to the shore in particular if they are sold as part of the property. The letting season is short and strong, so estimate the income by the summer months. Out of season the settlement is quiet, which suits some people and not others. See what the offer looks like on the page [accommodation at Srebrno Jezero](/oglasi/odmor/jezera-i-reke/srebrno-jezero). Cottages in the hills are on the page [cottages on Fruška Gora](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice/prodaja/fruska-gora), and a boat for the lake in [boats](/oglasi/vozila/camci).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'cottages') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Srebrno jezero') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja vikendica na Fruškoj gori: kuće u vikend naseljima na Popovici, u Bukovcu, Ledincima i Rakovcu, vikendice iznad Dunava u Čortanovcima i Banstolu, kuće sa vinogradom i voćnjakom i objekti oko Vrdnika. Blizina Novog Sada i Beograda čini ih traženim za odmor preko vikenda.

Mnogi sada u vikendicama žive cele godine, pa proverite ono što je za to potrebno: asfalt do kuće, gradsku vodu ili bunar, kanalizaciju ili septičku jamu i jačinu priključka struje. Fruška gora je nacionalni park, a na njenim padinama ima klizišta: pitajte komšije i pogledajte ima li pukotina na kući i potpornim zidovima. Proverite da li je objekat legalizovan i kako se vodi zemljište. Zimi obiđite prilaz, jer strme ulice ume da okuje led. Parcele bez objekta nudi stranica [placevi na Fruškoj gori](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/fruska-gora), ponudu bliže gradu stranica [vikendice kod Novog Sada](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice/prodaja/novi-sad), a kuće u baroknom gradiću stranica [kuće u Sremskim Karlovcima](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/sremski-karlovci).', text_en = 'Cottages for sale on Fruška Gora: houses in the weekend settlements at Popovica, in Bukovac, Ledinci and Rakovac, cottages above the Danube in Čortanovci and Banstol, houses with a vineyard and an orchard and buildings around Vrdnik. Closeness to Novi Sad and Belgrade makes them sought after for weekend breaks.

Many people now live in their cottages all year round, so check what that requires: tarmac to the house, mains water or a well, sewerage or a septic tank and the strength of the electricity connection. Fruška Gora is a national park, and there are landslides on its slopes: ask the neighbours and look for cracks in the house and the retaining walls. Check that the building is legalised and how the land is registered. Visit the approach in winter, because ice can grip the steep streets. Parcels without a building are on the page [plots on Fruška Gora](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/fruska-gora), an offer closer to the city on the page [cottages near Novi Sad](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice/prodaja/novi-sad), and houses in the baroque town on the page [houses in Sremski Karlovci](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/sremski-karlovci).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'cottages') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Fruška gora') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja placeva i zemljišta na Fruškoj gori: parcele u vikend zonama, vinogradi i voćnjaci na sunčanim padinama, njive u podnožju, placevi sa pogledom na Dunav i imanja pogodna za vinariju ili seoski turizam. Vinogradarska tradicija ovog kraja duga je vekovima.

Pre kupovine utvrdite da li je parcela u vikend zoni, na poljoprivrednom zemljištu ili u granicama nacionalnog parka, jer od toga zavisi da li i šta smete da gradite. Kod poljoprivrednog zemljišta računajte i na naknadu za promenu namene. Na padinama su klizišta česta, pa se za gradnju traži ispitivanje tla. Proverite širinu i status prilaznog puta i gde su najbliži priključci. Kod vinograda i voćnjaka pitajte za starost zasada, sorte i stanje naslona. Ko ne želi da gradi, može da pogleda gotove [vikendice na Fruškoj gori](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice/prodaja/fruska-gora). Parcele u ravnici nudi stranica [placevi u Novom Sadu](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/novi-sad), a sadni materijal stranica [voćne sadnice](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/sadnice/vocne-sadnice).', text_en = 'Plots and land for sale on Fruška Gora: parcels in the weekend zones, vineyards and orchards on sunny slopes, fields at the foot of the hills, plots with a view of the Danube and holdings suitable for a winery or rural tourism. The wine-growing tradition of this area goes back centuries.

Before buying, establish whether the parcel is in a weekend zone, on farmland or within the boundaries of the national park, because that decides whether and what you may build. With farmland, allow for the fee for a change of use as well. Landslides are common on the slopes, so a soil survey is required for building. Check the width and status of the access road and where the nearest connections are. With vineyards and orchards, ask about the age of the planting, the varieties and the state of the trellis. Those who do not want to build can look at finished [cottages on Fruška Gora](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice/prodaja/fruska-gora). Parcels on the plain are on the page [plots in Novi Sad](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/novi-sad), and planting material on the page [fruit trees](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/sadnice/vocne-sadnice).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'land') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Fruška gora') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Smeštaj na Divčibarama, visoravni na planini Maljen iznad Valjeva: vikendice i brvnare među borovima i brezama, apartmani u novim objektima, sobe u vilama i planinske kuće za veća društva. Zbog blage klime i čistog vazduha ovde se odavno dolazi na oporavak, a deca na rekreativnu nastavu.

Mesto je razuđeno i bez pravog gradskog centra, pa pitajte koliko je smeštaj udaljen od prodavnica, pijace i ski staze. Zimi radi manje skijalište pogodno za početnike i decu, a leti se šeta do vidikovaca i izvora. Proverite da li se do kuće stiže asfaltom i da li se put zimi čisti. Kamin ili peć na drva čest su deo ponude: pitajte da li su drva uključena u cenu. Vikendom iz Beograda dolazi mnogo gostiju, pa je preko nedelje mirnije i povoljnije. Veću planinu sa više sadržaja nudi [smeštaj na Zlatiboru](/oglasi/odmor/planine/zlatibor), divljiju prirodu [smeštaj na Tari](/oglasi/odmor/planine/tara), a opremu za sneg stranica [sanke i klizaljke](/oglasi/sport/zimski-sportovi/sanke-i-klizaljke).', text_en = 'Accommodation at Divčibare, the plateau on Mount Maljen above Valjevo: cottages and log cabins among pines and birches, apartments in new buildings, rooms in villas and mountain houses for bigger groups. Because of the mild climate and clean air, people have long come here to recuperate, and children for school trips.

The place is spread out and has no real town centre, so ask how far the accommodation is from the shops, the market and the ski slope. In winter a small ski area suitable for beginners and children operates, and in summer people walk to the viewpoints and springs. Check that the house is reached by tarmac and that the road is cleared in winter. A fireplace or a wood stove is often part of the offer: ask whether firewood is included in the price. Many guests come from Belgrade at weekends, so it is quieter and cheaper during the week. [Accommodation on Zlatibor](/oglasi/odmor/planine/zlatibor) offers a bigger mountain with more to do, [accommodation on Tara](/oglasi/odmor/planine/tara) wilder nature, and gear for the snow is on the page [sledges and ice skates](/oglasi/sport/zimski-sportovi/sanke-i-klizaljke).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'mountains') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Divčibare') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Smeštaj na Staroj planini, na istoku Srbije: apartmani i hoteli uz ski centar Babin zub, planinarski domovi, seoska domaćinstva u selima oko Knjaževca i Pirota i brvnare za one koji traže potpuni mir. Planina je najmanje izgrađena od velikih skijališta, pa je priroda ovde glavni razlog dolaska.

Zimi birajte smeštaj prema udaljenosti od žičara, a ako ste u selu, pitajte kakav je put do staza i da li su potrebni lanci. Leti se dolazi zbog pešačenja do Midžora, vodopada i Zavojskog jezera: raspitajte se kod domaćina o stazama i vodičima. Prodavnica i benzinskih pumpi ima malo, pa namirnice i gorivo ponesite iz grada. U seoskim domaćinstvima često je u ponudi domaća hrana, što vredi dogovoriti unapred. Proverite signal i grejanje. Veće skijalište sa više sadržaja nudi [smeštaj na Kopaoniku](/oglasi/odmor/planine/kopaonik), odmor na selu rubrika [seoski turizam](/oglasi/odmor/seoski-turizam), a opremu za pešačenje rubrika [šatori i kamp oprema](/oglasi/sport/kampovanje).', text_en = 'Accommodation on Stara Planina, in the east of Serbia: apartments and hotels by the Babin Zub ski resort, mountain huts, rural households in the villages around Knjaževac and Pirot and log cabins for those seeking complete peace. The mountain is the least built-up of the big ski areas, so nature is the main reason for coming here.

In winter, choose a place by its distance from the lifts, and if you are in a village ask what the road to the slopes is like and whether chains are needed. In summer people come for hikes to Midžor, the waterfalls and Lake Zavoj: ask your hosts about trails and guides. There are few shops and petrol stations, so bring groceries and fuel from town. Rural households often offer home-cooked food, which is worth arranging in advance. Check the signal and the heating. [Accommodation on Kopaonik](/oglasi/odmor/planine/kopaonik) offers a bigger ski area with more facilities, a holiday in the country is in [rural tourism](/oglasi/odmor/seoski-turizam), and hiking gear in [tents and camping equipment](/oglasi/sport/kampovanje).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'mountains') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Stara planina') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Smeštaj na Paliću, jezeru kod Subotice na samom severu Srbije: vile iz vremena secesije, apartmani i sobe u mirnim ulicama, hoteli uz park i salaši u okolini. Palić je mesto za lagan odmor: šetnja Velikim parkom, vožnja biciklom oko jezera, zoološki vrt i večera uz tamburaše.

Smeštaj uz obalu i park najtraženiji je leti i tokom filmskog festivala, pa tada rezervišite ranije. Pitajte da li domaćin iznajmljuje bicikle, jer su staze oko jezera ravne i uređene. Kupanje je organizovano na bazenima i u akva parku, pa se raspitajte koliko su udaljeni. Porodice sa decom traže blizinu zoološkog vrta, a parovi vinarije i salaše sa domaćom kuhinjom. Subotica, sa svojom gradskom kućom i sinagogom, udaljena je nekoliko kilometara i do nje vozi gradski autobus. Kupanje u rukavcu Dunava nudi [smeštaj na Srebrnom jezeru](/oglasi/odmor/jezera-i-reke/srebrno-jezero), stan u obližnjem gradu stranica [stan na dan u Subotici](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/na-dan/subotica), a bicikle za vožnju rubrika [bicikli](/oglasi/sport/bicikli).', text_en = 'Accommodation at Palić, the lake near Subotica in the very north of Serbia: villas from the Art Nouveau period, apartments and rooms in quiet streets, hotels by the park and farmsteads in the surroundings. Palić is a place for an easy break: a walk in the Great Park, a bike ride around the lake, the zoo and dinner with tamburica players.

Places by the shore and the park are most in demand in summer and during the film festival, so book earlier then. Ask whether the host hires out bikes, because the paths around the lake are flat and well kept. Swimming is organised at the pools and the water park, so ask how far away they are. Families with children look for somewhere near the zoo, and couples for wineries and farmsteads with home cooking. Subotica, with its city hall and synagogue, is a few kilometres away and a city bus runs there. [Accommodation at Srebrno Jezero](/oglasi/odmor/jezera-i-reke/srebrno-jezero) offers swimming in an arm of the Danube, a flat in the nearby town is on the page [flats by the day in Subotica](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/na-dan/subotica), and bikes for riding in [bikes](/oglasi/sport/bicikli).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'lakes-rivers') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Palić') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Oglasi iz Beograda na jednom mestu: stanovi i kuće, poslovi, automobili, nameštaj, tehnika, usluge majstora i sve ono što Beograđani prodaju, kupuju i traže svakog dana. U gradu ove veličine gotovo za svaku stvar postoji i ponuda i kupac, često u istom kraju.

Najbrže ćete stići do cilja ako odmah izaberete kategoriju, a zatim deo grada, jer vožnja sa jednog kraja Beograda na drugi ume da potraje. Kod skupljih kupovina nalazite se na javnom mestu i robu pregledajte pre plaćanja. Sačuvajte pretragu da vam nove ponude stižu e-poštom. Ako prodajete, u oglasu navedite opštinu ili naselje: kupci prvo gledaju ono što im je blizu. Najtraženije stranice su [nekretnine u Beogradu](/oglasi/nekretnine/beograd), [oglasi za posao u Beogradu](/oglasi/posao/beograd) i [polovni automobili u Beogradu](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/beograd), a ko traži krov nad glavom, neka krene od stranice [izdavanje stanova u Beogradu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd).', text_en = 'Ads from Belgrade in one place: flats and houses, jobs, cars, furniture, electronics, tradesmen''s services and everything the people of Belgrade sell, buy and look for every day. In a city of this size almost every item has both an offer and a buyer, often in the same neighbourhood.

You will get to your goal fastest if you choose a category straight away and then a part of the city, because a drive from one end of Belgrade to the other can take a while. With more expensive purchases, meet in a public place and inspect the goods before paying. Save your search so that new offers reach you by email. If you are selling, state the municipality or neighbourhood in the ad: buyers look first at what is near them. The most visited pages are [real estate in Belgrade](/oglasi/nekretnine/beograd), [jobs in Belgrade](/oglasi/posao/beograd) and [used cars in Belgrade](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/beograd), and anyone looking for a roof over their head should start with [flats to rent in Belgrade](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd).' WHERE category_id IS NULL AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Nekretnine u Beogradu: stanovi u centru i na Novom Beogradu, kuće u Zemunu i prigradskim naseljima, placevi na obodu grada, lokali, kancelarije, garaže i sobe za studente. Ovo je najveće tržište nekretnina u zemlji, sa velikim razlikama u ceni od opštine do opštine.

Sava i Dunav dele grad na celine koje se razlikuju i po gradnji i po prevozu: staro jezgro sa zgradama od pre rata, novobeogradski blokovi sa širokim bulevarima, Zemun sa starim jezgrom uz Dunav i naselja na levoj obali. Pre odluke obiđite kraj u špicu i uveče, da vidite gužve, parking i buku. Proverite koliko vam treba do posla i škole gradskim prevozom, a ne samo automobilom. Ponudu suzite na [prodaju stanova](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd), [izdavanje stanova](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd), [prodaju kuća](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/beograd) ili [placeve](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/beograd), a najtraženiju opštinu izdvaja stranica [nekretnine na Novom Beogradu](/oglasi/nekretnine/beograd/novi-beograd).', text_en = 'Real estate in Belgrade: flats in the centre and in New Belgrade, houses in Zemun and the suburbs, plots on the edge of the city, shops, offices, garages and rooms for students. This is the biggest property market in the country, with large differences in price from one municipality to another.

The Sava and the Danube divide the city into parts that differ in both construction and transport: the old core with pre-war buildings, the blocks of New Belgrade with their wide boulevards, Zemun with its old centre on the Danube and the settlements on the left bank. Before deciding, visit the area at rush hour and in the evening to see the traffic, the parking and the noise. Check how long it takes to get to work and school by public transport, not just by car. Narrow the offer to [flats for sale](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd), [flats to rent](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd), [houses for sale](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/beograd) or [plots](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/beograd), and the most sought-after municipality has its own page, [real estate in New Belgrade](/oglasi/nekretnine/beograd/novi-beograd).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'real-estate') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja stanova u Beogradu: garsonjere i jednosobni stanovi koje kupuju investitori i roditelji studenata, dvosobni i trosobni porodični stanovi, salonski stanovi u starom jezgru i stanovi u novim kompleksima. Izaberite deo grada u filteru i uporedite cene po kvadratu u istom kraju.

U starim zgradama u centru pitajte za stanje krova, fasade i vertikala i da li je lift obnovljen, jer se veliki radovi dele na sve vlasnike. U blokovima iz doba socijalizma stanovi su dobro raspoređeni, ali proverite stolariju i izolaciju. Kod novogradnje uporedite cenu sa PDV-om i bez njega i pitajte šta je sa garažnim mestom. Stan obiđite i po kiši, a ako je u potkrovlju, i u vreme vrućina. Najviše oglasa imaju [stanovi na Novom Beogradu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/novi-beograd), [u Zemunu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/zemun), [u Mirijevu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/mirijevo) i [na Vračaru](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/vracar), a ko želi dvorište, neka pogleda [prodaju kuća u Beogradu](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/beograd).', text_en = 'Flats for sale in Belgrade: studios and one-bedroom flats bought by investors and by students'' parents, two- and three-bedroom family flats, grand old flats in the historic core and flats in new complexes. Choose a part of the city in the filter and compare prices per square metre within the same area.

In old buildings in the centre, ask about the state of the roof, the facade and the risers and whether the lift has been renewed, because major works are shared by all the owners. In blocks from the socialist era the flats are well laid out, but check the joinery and the insulation. With a new development, compare the price with and without VAT and ask what the position is with a garage space. View the flat in the rain too, and if it is in the attic, during hot weather as well. Most ads are for [flats in New Belgrade](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/novi-beograd), [in Zemun](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/zemun), [in Mirijevo](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/mirijevo) and [in Vračar](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/vracar), and anyone who wants a garden should see [houses for sale in Belgrade](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/beograd).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Izdavanje stanova u Beogradu: garsonjere i jednosobni stanovi za studente i mlade zaposlene, dvosobni i veći stanovi za porodice, namešteni stanovi za strance i prazni stanovi za duži zakup. Potražnja je najveća krajem leta, pred početak školske i akademske godine.

Dobri stanovi po razumnoj ceni izdaju se za dan ili dva, pa sačuvajte pretragu sa obaveštenjima i budite spremni za brz obilazak. Nikada ne plaćajte rezervaciju stana koji niste videli, ma koliko fotografije bile lepe. U zgradama sa daljinskim grejanjem račun stiže tokom cele godine, pa pitajte koliki je i da li ulazi u kiriju. Proverite pritisak vode na višim spratovima, lift i gde ćete parkirati. Blizina tramvaja ili voza često vredi više od blizine centra. Po delovima grada ponudu dele stranice [stanovi na Novom Beogradu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/novi-beograd), [u Zemunu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/zemun), [na Voždovcu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/vozdovac) i [u Mirijevu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/mirijevo), a najjeftinije rešenje je [izdavanje soba u Beogradu](/oglasi/nekretnine/sobe/izdavanje/beograd).', text_en = 'Flats to rent in Belgrade: studios and one-bedroom flats for students and young professionals, two-bedroom and bigger flats for families, furnished flats for foreigners and unfurnished flats for a longer lease. Demand is highest at the end of summer, before the school and academic year begins.

Good flats at a reasonable price are let within a day or two, so save your search with alerts and be ready for a quick viewing. Never pay to reserve a flat you have not seen, however nice the photos. In buildings with district heating the bill comes all year round, so ask how much it is and whether it is included in the rent. Check the water pressure on the higher floors, the lift and where you will park. Being near a tram or a train is often worth more than being near the centre. By part of the city, the offer is split across the pages [flats in New Belgrade](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/novi-beograd), [in Zemun](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/zemun), [in Voždovac](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/vozdovac) and [in Mirijevo](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/mirijevo), and the cheapest solution is [rooms to rent in Belgrade](/oglasi/nekretnine/sobe/izdavanje/beograd).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'rent' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Stan na dan u Beogradu za turiste, poslovne ljude i sve koji dolaze na kratko: apartmani u centru nadomak Knez Mihailove i Kalemegdana, stanovi na Novom Beogradu blizu kongresnog centra i arene, apartmani kod kliničkog centra i stanovi blizu sajma.

Lokaciju birajte prema razlogu dolaska, jer gužve u saobraćaju lako pojedu sat vremena. Za izlaske i razgledanje najbolji je centar, za koncerte i poslovne skupove Novi Beograd, a za lekarske preglede okolina bolnica. Pitajte za parking: u centru važe zone sa ograničenim vremenom, pa je garažno mesto velika prednost. Dogovorite vreme dolaska, jer mnogi domaćini predaju ključ lično. Proverite da li stan ima lift ako nosite prtljag ili putujete sa starijima. Za boravak duži od nekoliko nedelja povoljnije je [izdavanje stanova u Beogradu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd). Ponudu preko reke daju stranice [stan na dan na Novom Beogradu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/na-dan/beograd/novi-beograd) i [u Zemunu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/na-dan/beograd/zemun), a prevoz po gradu rubrika [rent a car](/oglasi/usluge/rent-a-car).', text_en = 'A flat by the day in Belgrade for tourists, business people and everyone coming for a short time: apartments in the centre close to Knez Mihailova Street and Kalemegdan, flats in New Belgrade near the congress centre and the arena, apartments by the clinical centre and flats near the fairground.

Choose the location by your reason for coming, because traffic jams easily eat up an hour. The centre is best for going out and sightseeing, New Belgrade for concerts and business events, and the area around the hospitals for medical appointments. Ask about parking: time-limited zones apply in the centre, so a garage space is a big advantage. Agree your arrival time, because many hosts hand over the key in person. Check whether the flat has a lift if you have luggage or are travelling with older people. For a stay longer than a few weeks, [flats to rent in Belgrade](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd) work out cheaper. The offer across the river is on the pages [flats by the day in New Belgrade](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/na-dan/beograd/novi-beograd) and [in Zemun](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/na-dan/beograd/zemun), and transport around the city in [car rental](/oglasi/usluge/rent-a-car).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'daily' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja kuća u Beogradu: vile na Dedinju i Senjaku, porodične kuće u Zemunu i na Banovom brdu, kuće sa dvorištem u Borči, Batajnici i Sremčici i seoska domaćinstva u prigradskim opštinama Grocka, Barajevo, Mladenovac i Obrenovac.

Kuća u gradu i kuća na obodu grada dve su različite kupovine. U gradskom tkivu plaćate lokaciju, a plac je mali i često vredniji od same kuće, pa proverite šta plan dozvoljava da se na njemu gradi. U prigradskim naseljima dobijate dvorište i mir, ali proverite kanalizaciju, asfalt i koliko traje put do grada u jutarnjem špicu. Mnoge kuće su dograđivane bez dozvole: uporedite stvarno stanje sa onim što je uknjiženo. Pitajte i za grejanje, jer gas nije stigao u sva naselja. Po krajevima pogledajte [kuće u Zemunu](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/beograd/zemun), [na Dedinju](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/beograd/dedinje) i [u Borči](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/beograd/borca), parcele za gradnju na stranici [placevi u Beogradu](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/beograd), a manje brige nosi [stan u Beogradu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd).', text_en = 'Houses for sale in Belgrade: villas in Dedinje and Senjak, family houses in Zemun and Banovo Brdo, houses with a garden in Borča, Batajnica and Sremčica and village homesteads in the suburban municipalities of Grocka, Barajevo, Mladenovac and Obrenovac.

A house in the city and a house on its edge are two different purchases. In the urban fabric you pay for the location, and the plot is small and often worth more than the house itself, so check what the plan allows to be built on it. In the suburbs you get a garden and peace, but check the sewerage, the tarmac and how long the trip to the city takes in the morning rush. Many houses were extended without a permit: compare the actual state with what is registered. Ask about heating too, because gas has not reached every settlement. By area, see [houses in Zemun](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/beograd/zemun), [in Dedinje](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/beograd/dedinje) and [in Borča](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/beograd/borca), parcels for building on the page [plots in Belgrade](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/beograd), and a [flat in Belgrade](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd) brings fewer worries.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'houses') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja vikendica u okolini Beograda: kuće na obroncima Avale i Kosmaja, vikendice uz Dunav kod Grocke i Vinče, objekti uz Savu kod Umke i Obrenovca i vikend naselja u Barajevu i Sopotu. Do većine se iz grada stiže za manje od sat vremena, pa služe i za popodnevni beg.

Kod vikendica uz reku pitajte da li se plac plavi i koliko je obala stabilna, jer na padinama iznad Dunava i Save ima klizišta. Na Avali i Kosmaju proverite da li je zemljište šumsko ili poljoprivredno i da li je objekat legalizovan. Sve više ljudi ovakve kuće koristi za stalno stanovanje, pa proverite vodu, struju, grejanje i da li zimi čiste put. Autobus i voz ne stižu do svih naselja. Plac sa voćnjakom vredi više ako je ograđen i uredno održavan. Veće objekte nude stranice [kuće u Grockoj](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/grocka) i [kuće u Barajevu](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/barajevo), neizgrađene parcele stranica [placevi u Beogradu](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/beograd), a planinski vazduh blizu grada [vikendice na Fruškoj gori](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice/prodaja/fruska-gora).', text_en = 'Weekend cottages for sale around Belgrade: houses on the slopes of Avala and Kosmaj, cottages by the Danube near Grocka and Vinča, buildings by the Sava near Umka and Obrenovac and weekend settlements in Barajevo and Sopot. Most are less than an hour from the city, so they also serve for an afternoon escape.

With cottages by the river, ask whether the plot floods and how stable the bank is, because there are landslides on the slopes above the Danube and the Sava. On Avala and Kosmaj, check whether the land is forest or farmland and whether the building is legalised. More and more people use such houses as a permanent home, so check the water, the electricity, the heating and whether the road is cleared in winter. Buses and trains do not reach every settlement. A plot with an orchard is worth more if it is fenced and well kept. Bigger buildings are on the pages [houses in Grocka](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/grocka) and [houses in Barajevo](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/barajevo), undeveloped parcels on the page [plots in Belgrade](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/beograd), and hill air close to the city comes with [cottages on Fruška Gora](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice/prodaja/fruska-gora).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'cottages') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja placeva i zemljišta u Beogradu: građevinske parcele u Zemunu, Surčinu i na obodu Novog Beograda, placevi za kuću u Grockoj, Barajevu i Sopotu, zemljište za hale uz autoput i obilaznicu, njive i voćnjaci u prigradskim selima.

Na teritoriji grada namenu zemljišta određuju planovi, a oni se razlikuju od ulice do ulice. Pre razgovora o ceni pribavite informaciju o lokaciji: ona pokazuje da li je parcela građevinska, koliko sme da se izgradi i da li je predviđena za javnu namenu, na primer za put. Proverite da li je izvršena konverzija prava korišćenja u svojinu, jer bez toga nema građevinske dozvole. Za poslovne objekte važan je pristup kamionima i blizina petlje. Kod parcela bez priključaka tražite pisane uslove komunalnih preduzeća. Parcele na severu grada izdvaja stranica [placevi u Batajnici](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/beograd/batajnica), savete za gradnju stranica [građevinski placevi](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/gradjevinski-placevi), a gotove objekte stranice [kuće u Beogradu](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/beograd) i [vikendice kod Beograda](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice/prodaja/beograd).', text_en = 'Plots and land for sale in Belgrade: building parcels in Zemun, Surčin and on the edge of New Belgrade, plots for a house in Grocka, Barajevo and Sopot, land for warehouses along the motorway and the bypass, fields and orchards in the suburban villages.

Within the city, land use is set by plans, and they differ from street to street. Before talking about the price, obtain the location information: it shows whether the parcel is building land, how much may be built and whether it is earmarked for public use, for example for a road. Check whether the right of use has been converted into ownership, because without that there is no building permit. For commercial buildings, lorry access and closeness to a junction matter. With parcels without connections, ask for the written conditions of the utility companies. Parcels in the north of the city are on the page [plots in Batajnica](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/beograd/batajnica), advice on building on the page [building plots](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/gradjevinski-placevi), and finished buildings on the pages [houses in Belgrade](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/beograd) and [cottages near Belgrade](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice/prodaja/beograd).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'land') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Izdavanje soba u Beogradu traže pre svega studenti i mladi koji tek počinju da rade: sobe u stanovima sa cimerima, sobe kod gazdarice, ležajevi u dvokrevetnim sobama i sobe sa sopstvenim kupatilom. Soba je često jedini način da se živi blizu fakulteta ili posla.

Najtraženije su sobe kod Vukovog spomenika i na Zvezdari, zbog tehničkih fakulteta, na Voždovcu, na Novom Beogradu u blizini Studentskog grada i u centru. Uračunajte i cenu mesečne karte i vreme putovanja: jeftinija soba na obodu grada ume da izađe skuplje. Pitajte koliko ljudi deli kupatilo i kuhinju i da li su računi i internet u ceni. Cimere upoznajte pre nego što platite depozit. Dogovorite pravila o gostima i tišini u ispitnom roku. Oglasa je najviše u avgustu i septembru. Kad budžet dozvoli, tu je [izdavanje stanova u Beogradu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd), džeparac donose [studentski poslovi u Beogradu](/oglasi/posao/studentski-poslovi/beograd), a savete za stanare stranica [izdavanje soba](/oglasi/nekretnine/sobe/izdavanje).', text_en = 'Rooms to rent in Belgrade are sought above all by students and young people just starting work: rooms in shared flats, rooms with a landlady, beds in twin rooms and rooms with their own bathroom. A room is often the only way to live near the faculty or the job.

The most wanted rooms are near Vukov Spomenik and in Zvezdara, because of the technical faculties, in Voždovac, in New Belgrade near the Student City and in the centre. Count the price of a monthly travel pass and the journey time too: a cheaper room on the edge of the city can work out dearer. Ask how many people share the bathroom and kitchen and whether bills and internet are included. Meet the flatmates before you pay a deposit. Agree rules on guests and on quiet during exams. There are most ads in August and September. When the budget allows, there are [flats to rent in Belgrade](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd), pocket money comes from [student jobs in Belgrade](/oglasi/posao/studentski-poslovi/beograd), and advice for tenants is on the page [rooms to rent](/oglasi/nekretnine/sobe/izdavanje).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'rooms') AND deal = 'rent' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Polovni automobili u Beogradu: najveća ponuda u zemlji, od malih gradskih automobila do terenaca i dostavnih vozila. Oglašavaju se vlasnici, auto-placevi i uvoznici, pa filter „Oglašava“ pomaže da odvojite jedne od drugih.

Velika ponuda znači da ne morate da žurite: pogledajte nekoliko primeraka istog modela i uporedite stanje i cenu. Gradski automobil pređe malo kilometara, ali mnogo vremena provede u koloni, pa kvačilo, kočnice i trap mogu biti istrošeniji nego što kilometraža govori. Pregled dogovorite u nezavisnom servisu ili na tehničkom pregledu, a istoriju vozila proverite po broju šasije. Kod uvezenih automobila tražite carinsku dokumentaciju. Prenos vlasništva obavite kod javnog beležnika, a novac predajte tek kada je ugovor overen. Po markama ponudu dele stranice kao što su [Volkswagen](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/volkswagen) i [Škoda](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/skoda), majstore nudi rubrika [auto servisi](/oglasi/usluge/auto-servisi), a ponudu iz drugog velikog grada stranica [automobili u Novom Sadu](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/novi-sad).', text_en = 'Used cars in Belgrade: the biggest offer in the country, from small city cars to off-roaders and delivery vehicles. Owners, dealers and importers all advertise, so the "Advertiser" filter helps you tell them apart.

A big offer means you do not have to hurry: look at several examples of the same model and compare condition and price. A city car covers few kilometres but spends a lot of time in queues, so the clutch, brakes and suspension may be more worn than the mileage suggests. Arrange an inspection at an independent workshop or a test centre, and check the car''s history by its chassis number. With imported cars, ask for the customs documents. Transfer ownership at a notary public, and hand over the money only once the contract is certified. By make, the offer is split across pages such as [Volkswagen](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/volkswagen) and [Škoda](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/skoda), mechanics are in [car servicing](/oglasi/usluge/auto-servisi), and the offer from another big city on the page [cars in Novi Sad](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/novi-sad).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'cars') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Oglasi za posao u Beogradu pokrivaju sve struke: trgovinu, ugostiteljstvo, građevinu, prevoz i dostavu, proizvodnju, administraciju, IT, zdravstvo i negu, kao i honorarne i sezonske poslove. U glavnom gradu je najviše poslodavaca, ali i najviše kandidata.

Ozbiljan oglas navodi naziv poslodavca, opis posla, radno vreme i lokaciju. Budite oprezni kada se nudi visoka zarada bez ikakvih uslova ili se traži uplata za obuku, opremu ili „rezervaciju mesta“: pravi poslodavac ne naplaćuje zapošljavanje. Pre razgovora izračunajte koliko traje put do posla, jer sat i po u svakom smeru menja računicu. Pitajte da li je plata navedena u neto iznosu i da li ste prijavljeni od prvog dana. Poslodavci mogu besplatno da postave oglas i primaju prijave porukama. Po vrsti posla pogledajte [posao vozača i dostavljača](/oglasi/posao/vozaci-i-dostava/beograd), [posao u ugostiteljstvu](/oglasi/posao/ugostiteljstvo/beograd), [posao u građevini](/oglasi/posao/gradjevina-i-zanati/beograd), [IT i administraciju](/oglasi/posao/it-i-administracija/beograd) i [studentske poslove](/oglasi/posao/studentski-poslovi/beograd).', text_en = 'Job ads in Belgrade cover every trade: retail, hospitality, construction, transport and delivery, manufacturing, administration, IT, health and care, plus part-time and seasonal work. The capital has the most employers, but also the most candidates.

A serious ad states the employer''s name, the job description, the working hours and the location. Be careful when high pay is offered with no requirements at all, or when payment is asked for training, equipment or "reserving a place": a real employer does not charge for hiring. Before an interview, work out how long the commute takes, because an hour and a half each way changes the sums. Ask whether the pay is stated net and whether you are registered from day one. Employers can post an ad for free and receive applications by message. By type of work, see [driver and courier jobs](/oglasi/posao/vozaci-i-dostava/beograd), [hospitality jobs](/oglasi/posao/ugostiteljstvo/beograd), [construction jobs](/oglasi/posao/gradjevina-i-zanati/beograd), [IT and administration](/oglasi/posao/it-i-administracija/beograd) and [student jobs](/oglasi/posao/studentski-poslovi/beograd).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'jobs') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Posao vozača i dostavljača u Beogradu: dostava hrane i paketa biciklom, skuterom ili automobilom, kuriri, vozači kombija u distribuciji, taksisti, vozači kamiona u domaćem i međunarodnom transportu i vozači autobusa u gradskom prevozu.

Kod dostave proverite kako se računa zarada: po satu, po dostavi ili kombinovano, i ko plaća gorivo, održavanje vozila i opremu. Ako radite preko posrednika, pitajte kolika je njegova provizija i da li ste prijavljeni. Za kamione i autobuse potrebne su odgovarajuće kategorije i kvalifikaciona kartica vozača, a poslodavci često traže i iskustvo. Dogovorite radno vreme, jer su vikendi i večeri u dostavi najtraženiji termini. Za taksi je potrebna i taksi dozvola grada. Dostava po centru najbrža je na dva točka, pa pogledajte [električne bicikle](/oglasi/sport/bicikli/elektricni-bicikli), a vozilo za rad potražite među oglasima [polovni automobili u Beogradu](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/beograd). Ostale ponude daju stranice [posao vozača i dostavljača](/oglasi/posao/vozaci-i-dostava) i [oglasi za posao u Beogradu](/oglasi/posao/beograd).', text_en = 'Driver and courier jobs in Belgrade: delivery of food and parcels by bike, scooter or car, couriers, van drivers in distribution, taxi drivers, lorry drivers in domestic and international transport and bus drivers in public transport.

With delivery work, check how the pay is calculated: per hour, per delivery or a combination, and who pays for fuel, vehicle maintenance and equipment. If you work through an intermediary, ask what their commission is and whether you are registered. Lorries and buses require the right licence categories and a driver qualification card, and employers often ask for experience too. Agree the working hours, because weekends and evenings are the busiest slots in delivery. A taxi also requires a city taxi permit. Delivery around the centre is fastest on two wheels, so see [electric bikes](/oglasi/sport/bicikli/elektricni-bicikli), and look for a vehicle for work among the ads for [used cars in Belgrade](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/beograd). Other offers are on the pages [driver and courier jobs](/oglasi/posao/vozaci-i-dostava) and [jobs in Belgrade](/oglasi/posao/beograd).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'drivers-delivery') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Posao u ugostiteljstvu u Beogradu: konobari, šankeri, kuvari, pomoćni kuvari, pica majstori, roštilj majstori, poslastičari, perači posuđa, sobarice i recepcioneri. Traže ih restorani i kafane, kafići, hoteli, hosteli, splavovi i ketering službe.

Grad živi do kasno, pa se dobar deo poslova radi uveče, noću i vikendom: pre nego što prihvatite, pitajte kako izgleda raspored smena i kako se plaća noćni rad. Raščistite i da li je bakšiš vaš ili se deli. Probni rad treba da bude vremenski ograničen i plaćen. Za rad sa hranom potrebna je sanitarna knjižica, a u hotelima i znanje stranog jezika. Leti raste potražnja zbog bašti i splavova, pa je proleće pravo vreme za prijavu. Početnici najlakše ulaze kao pomoćno osoblje. Poslove bez iskustva nudi i stranica [studentski i honorarni poslovi u Beogradu](/oglasi/posao/studentski-poslovi/beograd), ponudu iz cele zemlje stranica [posao u ugostiteljstvu](/oglasi/posao/ugostiteljstvo), a ostale struke stranica [oglasi za posao u Beogradu](/oglasi/posao/beograd).', text_en = 'Hospitality jobs in Belgrade: waiters, bartenders, cooks, assistant cooks, pizza chefs, grill chefs, pastry cooks, dishwashers, chambermaids and receptionists. They are sought by restaurants and traditional taverns, cafés, hotels, hostels, river clubs and catering services.

The city stays up late, so a good share of the work is done in the evening, at night and at weekends: before you accept, ask what the shift pattern looks like and how night work is paid. Clear up whether tips are yours or shared as well. A trial shift should be limited in time and paid. Work with food requires a health booklet, and hotels also ask for a foreign language. In summer demand rises because of terraces and river clubs, so spring is the right time to apply. Beginners get in most easily as support staff. Jobs without experience are also on the page [student and part-time jobs in Belgrade](/oglasi/posao/studentski-poslovi/beograd), the offer from the whole country on the page [hospitality jobs](/oglasi/posao/ugostiteljstvo), and other trades on the page [jobs in Belgrade](/oglasi/posao/beograd).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'hospitality') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Posao u građevini u Beogradu: zidari, tesari, armirači, moleri i gipsari, keramičari, fasaderi, vodoinstalateri, električari, rukovaoci mašinama i pomoćni radnici. Grad je veliko gradilište, od stambenih kompleksa do poslovnih zgrada i saobraćajnica, pa posla ima tokom cele godine.

Dogovorite kako se plaća: po danu, po satu ili po kvadratu, i kada je isplata. Tražite da budete prijavljeni, jer rad na crno znači da niste osigurani u slučaju povrede, a gradilište je mesto gde se povrede dešavaju. Poslodavac je dužan da obezbedi zaštitnu opremu i obuku za bezbedan rad. Radnicima iz unutrašnjosti često se nudi smeštaj, pa pitajte kakav je i da li se odbija od zarade. Majstori sa sopstvenim alatom i ekipom mogu da ponude i usluge direktno u rubrici [majstori i građevinske usluge](/oglasi/usluge/majstori). Ponudu iz cele Srbije daje stranica [posao u građevini](/oglasi/posao/gradjevina-i-zanati), radnu odeću i obuću rubrika [radna odeća i cipele](/oglasi/moda/radna-odeca), a ostale poslove stranica [oglasi za posao u Beogradu](/oglasi/posao/beograd).', text_en = 'Construction jobs in Belgrade: bricklayers, formwork carpenters, steel fixers, painters and plasterers, tilers, facade workers, plumbers, electricians, machine operators and labourers. The city is one big building site, from residential complexes to office buildings and roads, so there is work all year round.

Agree how you are paid: by the day, by the hour or by the square metre, and when the money is paid out. Ask to be registered, because undeclared work means you are not insured in case of injury, and a building site is where injuries happen. The employer is obliged to provide protective equipment and safety training. Workers from outside the city are often offered accommodation, so ask what it is like and whether it is deducted from the pay. Tradesmen with their own tools and crew can also offer services directly in [tradesmen and building services](/oglasi/usluge/majstori). The offer from all of Serbia is on the page [construction jobs](/oglasi/posao/gradjevina-i-zanati), work clothes and footwear in [workwear and safety shoes](/oglasi/moda/radna-odeca), and other jobs on the page [jobs in Belgrade](/oglasi/posao/beograd).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'construction-jobs') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Posao u IT-u i administraciji u Beogradu: programeri, testeri softvera, sistem administratori, tehnička podrška, administrativni radnici, sekretarice, knjigovođe, operateri u kontakt centrima, referenti nabavke i prodaje i asistenti u kadrovskim službama.

Veliki broj kancelarija nalazi se na Novom Beogradu i u centru, a sve više poslodavaca nudi kombinovan rad od kuće i iz kancelarije: pitajte koliko dana nedeljno se dolazi. Kod IT pozicija raspitajte se o tehnologijama, veličini tima i načinu angažovanja, jer se rad po ugovoru i rad preko agencije razlikuju od stalnog zaposlenja po pravima i porezima. Za kontakt centre presudni su jezici i smenski rad. U prijavi navedite konkretne programe i alate koje znate, a ne samo opšte veštine. Poslove koji se u celosti rade na daljinu izdvaja stranica [posao od kuće u Beogradu](/oglasi/posao/rad-od-kuce/beograd), ponudu iz cele zemlje stranica [posao u IT-u i administraciji](/oglasi/posao/it-i-administracija), a računar za rad rubrika [laptopovi](/oglasi/elektronika/laptopovi).', text_en = 'IT and administration jobs in Belgrade: developers, software testers, system administrators, technical support, administrative staff, secretaries, bookkeepers, contact-centre operators, purchasing and sales officers and human-resources assistants.

A large number of offices are in New Belgrade and in the centre, and more and more employers offer a mix of working from home and from the office: ask how many days a week you come in. With IT positions, ask about the technologies, the size of the team and the type of engagement, because contract work and agency work differ from permanent employment in rights and taxes. For contact centres, languages and shift work are decisive. In your application, name the specific programs and tools you know, not just general skills. Jobs done entirely remotely are on the page [work from home in Belgrade](/oglasi/posao/rad-od-kuce/beograd), the offer from the whole country on the page [IT and administration jobs](/oglasi/posao/it-i-administracija), and a computer for work in [laptops](/oglasi/elektronika/laptopovi).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'office-jobs') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Posao od kuće u Beogradu: korisnička podrška i rad u onlajn prodaji, unos i obrada podataka, prevođenje i lektura, pisanje tekstova, vođenje društvenih mreža, grafički dizajn, programiranje, knjigovodstvo i onlajn časovi. Poslodavac je u gradu, a radno mesto u vašem stanu.

Ova vrsta oglasa privlači i prevarante. Ne plaćajte „startni paket“, obuku ni registraciju, ne šaljite fotografije ličnih dokumenata nepoznatima i ne primajte tuđ novac na svoj račun. Pravi posao od kuće ima ugovor, jasan opis zadataka i dogovoren način isplate. Pitajte ko obezbeđuje računar i internet, kako se meri radno vreme i da li se povremeno dolazi u kancelariju. Ako radite kao preduzetnik, raspitajte se o porezima pre nego što ugovorite cenu. Potreban vam je miran kutak i pouzdana veza. Slične poslove iz kancelarije nudi stranica [IT i administracija u Beogradu](/oglasi/posao/it-i-administracija/beograd), ponudu bez obzira na grad stranica [posao od kuće](/oglasi/posao/rad-od-kuce), a svoje znanje možete ponuditi i u rubrici [privatni časovi i kursevi](/oglasi/usluge/casovi-i-kursevi).', text_en = 'Work from home in Belgrade: customer support and online sales, data entry and processing, translation and proofreading, copywriting, social media management, graphic design, programming, bookkeeping and online lessons. The employer is in the city, and the workplace is your flat.

This kind of ad attracts fraudsters too. Do not pay for a "starter pack", training or registration, do not send photos of personal documents to strangers and do not receive other people''s money into your account. Real work from home has a contract, a clear description of the tasks and an agreed method of payment. Ask who provides the computer and internet, how working time is measured and whether you come into the office from time to time. If you work as a sole trader, find out about taxes before you agree a price. You need a quiet corner and a reliable connection. Similar office-based jobs are on the page [IT and administration in Belgrade](/oglasi/posao/it-i-administracija/beograd), the offer regardless of city on the page [work from home](/oglasi/posao/rad-od-kuce), and you can also offer your knowledge in [private lessons and courses](/oglasi/usluge/casovi-i-kursevi).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'remote-jobs') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Posao u proizvodnji i obezbeđenju u Beogradu: radnici na proizvodnim linijama, pakeri, magacioneri, viljuškaristi, komisionari u distributivnim centrima, radnici u pekarama i prehrambenoj industriji, portiri i službenici obezbeđenja.

Fabrike i magacini smešteni su uglavnom na obodu grada, u industrijskim zonama Zemuna, Krnjače, Dobanovaca i duž autoputa, pa je prvo pitanje kako ćete stizati na posao: mnogi poslodavci organizuju prevoz. Rad je najčešće u smenama, uključujući noćne, a zarada zavisi od dodataka za noćni rad, prekovremene sate i praznike. Za viljuškar je potrebno uverenje o osposobljenosti, a za posao u obezbeđenju licenca i lekarsko uverenje. Pitajte da li se zapošljava direktno ili preko agencije i na koliko dugo je ugovor. Proverite i da li su topli obrok i regres u plati ili se isplaćuju posebno. Slične ponude daje stranica [posao u proizvodnji i obezbeđenju](/oglasi/posao/proizvodnja-i-magacin), poslove za volanom stranica [vozači i dostavljači u Beogradu](/oglasi/posao/vozaci-i-dostava/beograd), a sve ostalo stranica [oglasi za posao u Beogradu](/oglasi/posao/beograd).', text_en = 'Production and security jobs in Belgrade: production-line workers, packers, warehouse staff, forklift drivers, order pickers in distribution centres, workers in bakeries and the food industry, gatekeepers and security officers.

Factories and warehouses are mostly on the edge of the city, in the industrial zones of Zemun, Krnjača and Dobanovci and along the motorway, so the first question is how you will get to work: many employers organise transport. Work is usually in shifts, including nights, and the pay depends on supplements for night work, overtime and public holidays. A forklift requires a certificate of competence, and a security job a licence and a medical certificate. Ask whether you are hired directly or through an agency and how long the contract is. Check too whether the meal allowance and holiday pay are included in the wage or paid separately. Similar offers are on the page [production and security jobs](/oglasi/posao/proizvodnja-i-magacin), jobs behind the wheel on the page [drivers and couriers in Belgrade](/oglasi/posao/vozaci-i-dostava/beograd), and everything else on the page [jobs in Belgrade](/oglasi/posao/beograd).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'production-jobs') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Posao u zdravstvu i nezi u Beogradu: medicinske sestre i tehničari, negovateljice, gerontodomaćice, fizioterapeuti, farmaceutski tehničari, stomatološke sestre, laboranti i dadilje. Traže ih privatne klinike i ordinacije, apoteke, domovi za stare i porodice kojima je potrebna pomoć u kući.

Za rad u zdravstvenoj ustanovi potrebni su odgovarajuća diploma, položen stručni ispit i licenca komore, pa ih navedite u prijavi. Kod nege u kući dogovorite tačan opis posla: da li se radi samo o nezi ili i o kuvanju i spremanju, koliko sati dnevno i da li se stanuje kod porodice. Tražite ugovor i prijavu, jer je to zaštita i za vas i za porodicu. Porodicama savetujemo da traže preporuke i provere prethodno iskustvo. Dežurstva, noćni rad i rad praznikom treba da budu posebno plaćeni. Ponudu iz cele zemlje daje stranica [posao u zdravstvu i nezi](/oglasi/posao/zdravstvo-i-nega), pomagala za negu rubrika [ortopedska pomagala i medicinski aparati](/oglasi/lepota-i-zdravlje/medicinska-pomagala), a ostale struke stranica [oglasi za posao u Beogradu](/oglasi/posao/beograd).', text_en = 'Health and care jobs in Belgrade: nurses and medical technicians, carers, home helps for the elderly, physiotherapists, pharmacy technicians, dental nurses, laboratory technicians and nannies. They are sought by private clinics and surgeries, pharmacies, homes for the elderly and families who need help at home.

Work in a health institution requires the appropriate diploma, a passed professional exam and a chamber licence, so state them in your application. With care at home, agree the exact job description: whether it is care only or cooking and cleaning as well, how many hours a day and whether you live with the family. Ask for a contract and registration, because that protects both you and the family. We advise families to ask for references and check previous experience. On-call duty, night work and work on public holidays should be paid separately. The offer from the whole country is on the page [health and care jobs](/oglasi/posao/zdravstvo-i-nega), care aids in [orthopaedic aids and medical devices](/oglasi/lepota-i-zdravlje/medicinska-pomagala), and other trades on the page [jobs in Belgrade](/oglasi/posao/beograd).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'care-jobs') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Posao prodavca u Beogradu: prodavci i kasiri u marketima, trgovci u buticima i tržnim centrima, prodavci u pekarama i na pijacama, komercijalisti na terenu, promoteri i prodavci tehnike i nameštaja. Trgovina je među najvećim poslodavcima u gradu, pa su oglasi stalni.

Rad u trgovini znači smene, rad subotom i često nedeljom i praznikom, zato pitajte kako se pravi raspored i koliko slobodnih vikenda imate mesečno. Proverite da li zarada ima fiksni deo i procenat od prodaje i koliko je taj procenat realno dostižan. Za rad sa hranom potrebna je sanitarna knjižica. Kod terenske prodaje pitajte ko obezbeđuje automobil, gorivo i telefon. Kasiri odgovaraju za pazar, pa se raspitajte kako se rešava manjak. Radno mesto u svom kraju štedi vreme i novac za prevoz. Kraće angažmane nudi stranica [studentski i honorarni poslovi u Beogradu](/oglasi/posao/studentski-poslovi/beograd), ponudu iz cele Srbije stranica [posao prodavca](/oglasi/posao/trgovina-i-prodaja), a sve struke stranica [oglasi za posao u Beogradu](/oglasi/posao/beograd).', text_en = 'Sales jobs in Belgrade: shop assistants and cashiers in supermarkets, sales staff in boutiques and shopping centres, sellers in bakeries and at markets, field sales representatives, promoters and sellers of electronics and furniture. Retail is among the biggest employers in the city, so the ads never stop.

Working in retail means shifts, Saturdays and often Sundays and public holidays, so ask how the rota is made and how many free weekends you get a month. Check whether the pay has a fixed part and a percentage of sales, and how achievable that percentage really is. Work with food requires a health booklet. With field sales, ask who provides the car, the fuel and the phone. Cashiers are responsible for the takings, so find out how a shortfall is handled. A workplace in your own neighbourhood saves time and money on transport. Shorter engagements are on the page [student and part-time jobs in Belgrade](/oglasi/posao/studentski-poslovi/beograd), the offer from all of Serbia on the page [sales jobs](/oglasi/posao/trgovina-i-prodaja), and all trades on the page [jobs in Belgrade](/oglasi/posao/beograd).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'sales-jobs') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Studentski i honorarni poslovi u Beogradu: promocije i podela flajera, hostese na sajmovima i događajima, anketari, rad u magacinu i na popisu robe, pomoć u kuhinji i sali, dostava, čuvanje dece, davanje časova i sezonski poslovi tokom leta i praznika.

Većina ovih poslova ide preko omladinske ili studentske zadruge, koja obračunava zaradu i plaća doprinose: pitajte koliki je neto iznos po satu i kada je isplata. Birajte poslove čije se smene mogu uskladiti sa predavanjima i ispitnim rokovima, i to dogovorite unapred. Ne pristajte na „probni dan“ bez naknade koji traje celu smenu. Za posao sa hranom tražiće vam sanitarnu knjižicu. Posao blizu fakulteta ili doma štedi sate provedene u prevozu. Najviše oglasa pojavljuje se pred praznike i leto. Stalniju zaradu nudi [posao u ugostiteljstvu u Beogradu](/oglasi/posao/ugostiteljstvo/beograd), smeštaj stranica [izdavanje soba u Beogradu](/oglasi/nekretnine/sobe/izdavanje/beograd), a ponudu iz drugih gradova stranica [studentski i honorarni poslovi](/oglasi/posao/studentski-poslovi).', text_en = 'Student and part-time jobs in Belgrade: promotions and leafleting, hostesses at fairs and events, survey interviewers, warehouse work and stocktaking, help in the kitchen and on the floor, delivery, babysitting, giving lessons and seasonal jobs in summer and around the holidays.

Most of these jobs go through a youth or student cooperative, which calculates the pay and settles the contributions: ask what the net amount per hour is and when it is paid. Choose jobs whose shifts can be fitted around lectures and exam periods, and agree that in advance. Do not accept an unpaid "trial day" that lasts a whole shift. For work with food you will be asked for a health booklet. A job near the faculty or the hall of residence saves hours spent on public transport. Most ads appear before the holidays and summer. [Hospitality jobs in Belgrade](/oglasi/posao/ugostiteljstvo/beograd) offer steadier earnings, accommodation is on the page [rooms to rent in Belgrade](/oglasi/nekretnine/sobe/izdavanje/beograd), and the offer from other cities on the page [student and part-time jobs](/oglasi/posao/studentski-poslovi).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'student-jobs') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Oglasi iz Novog Sada: stanovi i kuće, poslovi, automobili, nameštaj, tehnika, bicikli, usluge i sve što se u gradu na Dunavu nudi i traži. Univerzitetski grad stalno dobija nove stanovnike, pa se ovde mnogo toga kupuje polovno, a prodaje brzo.

Grad je ravan i kompaktan, pa se većina kupovina završava istog dana: dogovorite susret u svom delu grada i robu pogledajte uživo. Studenti na jesen opremaju stanove, a pred leto ih prazne, i tada je ponuda nameštaja i tehnike najveća. U oglasu navedite naselje, na primer Liman, Detelinaru ili Novo naselje, jer kupci tako pretražuju. Sačuvana pretraga javlja nove oglase e-poštom. Najposećenije su stranice [nekretnine u Novom Sadu](/oglasi/nekretnine/novi-sad), [oglasi za posao u Novom Sadu](/oglasi/posao/novi-sad), [polovni automobili u Novom Sadu](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/novi-sad) i [polovni nameštaj u Novom Sadu](/oglasi/namestaj/novi-sad).', text_en = 'Ads from Novi Sad: flats and houses, jobs, cars, furniture, electronics, bikes, services and everything on offer and in demand in the city on the Danube. A university city keeps gaining new residents, so a lot is bought second-hand here and sold quickly.

The city is flat and compact, so most purchases are completed the same day: arrange to meet in your part of town and see the goods in person. Students furnish their flats in autumn and empty them before summer, which is when the offer of furniture and electronics is biggest. State the neighbourhood in your ad, for example Liman, Detelinara or Novo Naselje, because that is how buyers search. A saved search reports new ads by email. The most visited pages are [real estate in Novi Sad](/oglasi/nekretnine/novi-sad), [jobs in Novi Sad](/oglasi/posao/novi-sad), [used cars in Novi Sad](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/novi-sad) and [used furniture in Novi Sad](/oglasi/namestaj/novi-sad).' WHERE category_id IS NULL AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Novi Sad') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Nekretnine u Novom Sadu: stanovi u centru, na Limanu, Grbavici i Novom naselju, kuće na Telepu i u Petrovaradinu, vikendice na obroncima Fruške gore, placevi u Veterniku i Futogu, lokali, garaže i sobe za studente. Posle Beograda, ovo je najtraženije tržište u zemlji.

Dunav deli grad na ravničarski, bački deo, gde je većina stanova, i sremsku stranu sa Petrovaradinom i Sremskom Kamenicom, gde preovlađuju kuće i pogled na reku. Na sremskoj strani računajte na mostove u špicu, a na bačkoj na parking oko centra i fakulteta. Mnogo se gradi, pa uporedite novogradnju sa starijim stanovima iste površine, uključujući troškove održavanja. Ponudu suzite na [prodaju stanova](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/novi-sad), [izdavanje stanova](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/novi-sad), [prodaju kuća](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/novi-sad) ili [placeve](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/novi-sad), a odmor nadomak grada nude [vikendice kod Novog Sada](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice/prodaja/novi-sad).', text_en = 'Real estate in Novi Sad: flats in the centre, in Liman, Grbavica and Novo Naselje, houses in Telep and Petrovaradin, cottages on the slopes of Fruška Gora, plots in Veternik and Futog, shops, garages and rooms for students. After Belgrade, this is the most sought-after market in the country.

The Danube divides the city into the flat Bačka side, where most of the flats are, and the Srem side with Petrovaradin and Sremska Kamenica, where houses and river views prevail. On the Srem side, allow for the bridges at rush hour, and on the Bačka side for parking around the centre and the faculties. A lot is being built, so compare new developments with older flats of the same size, including maintenance costs. Narrow the offer to [flats for sale](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/novi-sad), [flats to rent](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/novi-sad), [houses for sale](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/novi-sad) or [plots](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/novi-sad), and [cottages near Novi Sad](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice/prodaja/novi-sad) offer a break close to the city.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'real-estate') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Novi Sad') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja stanova u Novom Sadu: garsonjere i jednosobni stanovi blizu fakulteta, porodični stanovi na Limanu i Novom naselju, stanovi u starim zgradama u centru i mnogo novogradnje na Grbavici, Telepu i duž Bulevara Evrope.

Mali stanovi blizu univerziteta najlakše se izdaju, pa su i najskuplji po kvadratu. Kod novih zgrada pogledajte koliko je gusto građeno: razmak između zgrada, parking i zelenilo razlikuju dobar projekat od lošeg. Pitajte da li garažno mesto ulazi u cenu ili se kupuje posebno. Stariji limanski stanovi imaju dobar raspored i daljinsko grejanje, ali proverite stolariju i liftove. U prizemljima i suterenima raspitajte se o podzemnim vodama, jer je grad u ravnici uz reku. Po naseljima ponudu dele stranice [stanovi na Limanu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/novi-sad/liman), [na Grbavici](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/novi-sad/grbavica), [na Detelinari](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/novi-sad/detelinara), [na Novom naselju](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/novi-sad/novo-naselje) i [na Telepu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/novi-sad/telep).', text_en = 'Flats for sale in Novi Sad: studios and one-bedroom flats near the faculties, family flats in Liman and Novo Naselje, flats in old buildings in the centre and a lot of new development in Grbavica, Telep and along Bulevar Evrope.

Small flats near the university are the easiest to let, so they are also the dearest per square metre. With new buildings, look at how densely they are built: the spacing between buildings, the parking and the greenery distinguish a good project from a bad one. Ask whether a garage space is included in the price or bought separately. The older Liman flats have a good layout and district heating, but check the joinery and the lifts. On ground floors and in basements, ask about groundwater, because the city lies on a plain by the river. By neighbourhood, the offer is split across the pages [flats in Liman](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/novi-sad/liman), [in Grbavica](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/novi-sad/grbavica), [in Detelinara](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/novi-sad/detelinara), [in Novo Naselje](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/novi-sad/novo-naselje) and [in Telep](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/novi-sad/telep).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Novi Sad') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Izdavanje stanova u Novom Sadu: garsonjere i jednosobni stanovi za studente, dvosobni stanovi za cimere i mlade parove, porodični stanovi i namešteni stanovi za zaposlene u IT firmama. Univerzitetski kampus je na Limanu, pa su stanovi u njegovoj blizini prvi na udaru.

Sezona traženja počinje čim se objave rezultati upisa, a vrhunac je u septembru: ko može, neka stan traži već početkom leta. Vlasnici često traže ugovor na godinu dana, pa pitajte šta se dešava ako odete ranije. Proverite da li u cenu ulaze troškovi zgrade i grejanje i kako se plaćaju struja i internet. U gradu se mnogo vozi bicikl, pa su ostava ili mesto za bicikl lepa prednost. Dogovorite popis stvari i fotografišite stan pri useljenju. Po naseljima pogledajte [stanove na Limanu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/novi-sad/liman), [na Detelinari](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/novi-sad/detelinara) i [na Novom naselju](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/novi-sad/novo-naselje), a jeftinije rešenje je [izdavanje soba u Novom Sadu](/oglasi/nekretnine/sobe/izdavanje/novi-sad).', text_en = 'Flats to rent in Novi Sad: studios and one-bedroom flats for students, two-bedroom flats for flatmates and young couples, family flats and furnished flats for people working in IT companies. The university campus is in Liman, so flats near it go first.

The search season starts as soon as the enrolment results are published and peaks in September: those who can should look for a flat at the start of summer. Owners often ask for a one-year contract, so ask what happens if you leave earlier. Check whether building charges and heating are included in the price and how electricity and internet are paid. Cycling is very common in the city, so a storeroom or a place for a bike is a nice advantage. Agree an inventory and photograph the flat when you move in. By neighbourhood, see [flats in Liman](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/novi-sad/liman), [in Detelinara](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/novi-sad/detelinara) and [in Novo Naselje](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/novi-sad/novo-naselje), and a cheaper solution is [rooms to rent in Novi Sad](/oglasi/nekretnine/sobe/izdavanje/novi-sad).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'rent' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Novi Sad') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Stan na dan u Novom Sadu za vikend u gradu, poslovni put ili festival: apartmani u centru kod Trga slobode i Dunavske ulice, stanovi blizu sajma, apartmani na Limanu nadomak Štranda i smeštaj u Petrovaradinu ispod tvrđave.

Tokom velikih događaja, kao što su muzički festival na tvrđavi i poljoprivredni sajam, grad je pun i cene rastu, pa tada rezervišite znatno ranije i potvrdu tražite pisanim putem. Centar je pešačka zona, pa pitajte gde se ostavlja automobil i da li stan ima svoje parking mesto. Za festival je praktičan smeštaj na sremskoj strani, a za poslovne sastanke okolina sajma i bulevara. Proverite da li stan ima klimu, jer su leta u ravnici vrela. Dogovorite kasniju odjavu ako putujete uveče. Smeštaj u prestonici nudi stranica [stan na dan u Beogradu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/na-dan/beograd), vozilo za izlet na Frušku goru stranica [rent a car u Novom Sadu](/oglasi/usluge/rent-a-car/novi-sad), a duži boravak [izdavanje stanova u Novom Sadu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/novi-sad).', text_en = 'A flat by the day in Novi Sad for a weekend in the city, a business trip or a festival: apartments in the centre by Liberty Square and Dunavska Street, flats near the fairground, apartments in Liman close to the Štrand beach and accommodation in Petrovaradin below the fortress.

During big events, such as the music festival at the fortress and the agricultural fair, the city is full and prices rise, so book well ahead then and ask for confirmation in writing. The centre is a pedestrian zone, so ask where the car is left and whether the flat has its own parking space. For the festival, a place on the Srem side is practical, and for business meetings the area around the fairground and the boulevards. Check that the flat has air conditioning, because summers on the plain are scorching. Agree a later check-out if you are travelling in the evening. Accommodation in the capital is on the page [flats by the day in Belgrade](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/na-dan/beograd), a vehicle for a trip to Fruška Gora on the page [car rental in Novi Sad](/oglasi/usluge/rent-a-car/novi-sad), and a longer stay under [flats to rent in Novi Sad](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/novi-sad).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'daily' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Novi Sad') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja kuća u Novom Sadu: prizemne kuće sa dvorištem na Telepu, Adicama i Salajci, novije porodične kuće u Veterniku i Futogu, kuće sa pogledom u Petrovaradinu i Sremskoj Kamenici i stare gradske kuće na Podbari i oko centra.

Na bačkoj strani tlo je ravno, a podzemne vode visoke: pitajte da li podrum vlaži i kako se kuća ponašala tokom visokog vodostaja Dunava. Na sremskoj strani kuće su na padini, pa proverite stabilnost terena i potporne zidove. Stare kuće od naboja traže drugačije održavanje od zidanih, zato utvrdite od čega je kuća građena. Proverite kanalizaciju, jer je u prigradskim naseljima nema svuda, i gas, koji je u ovom kraju uobičajen način grejanja. U širem centru plac često vredi više od kuće. Po naseljima pogledajte [kuće u Veterniku](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/novi-sad/veternik), [u Petrovaradinu](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/novi-sad/petrovaradin), [u Sremskoj Kamenici](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/novi-sad/sremska-kamenica) i [u Futogu](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/novi-sad/futog), a parcele na stranici [placevi u Novom Sadu](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/novi-sad).', text_en = 'Houses for sale in Novi Sad: single-storey houses with a garden in Telep, Adice and Salajka, newer family houses in Veternik and Futog, houses with a view in Petrovaradin and Sremska Kamenica and old town houses in Podbara and around the centre.

On the Bačka side the ground is flat and the groundwater high: ask whether the cellar gets damp and how the house fared when the Danube was high. On the Srem side the houses are on a slope, so check the stability of the ground and the retaining walls. Old houses of rammed earth need different maintenance from brick ones, so establish what the house is built of. Check the sewerage, because it is not everywhere in the suburbs, and gas, which is the usual way of heating in this area. Near the centre the plot is often worth more than the house. By neighbourhood, see [houses in Veternik](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/novi-sad/veternik), [in Petrovaradin](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/novi-sad/petrovaradin), [in Sremska Kamenica](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/novi-sad/sremska-kamenica) and [in Futog](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/novi-sad/futog), and parcels on the page [plots in Novi Sad](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/novi-sad).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'houses') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Novi Sad') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja vikendica kod Novog Sada: kuće na Popovici i u Bukovcu, vikendice u Ledincima i Rakovcu, objekti uz Dunav u vikend naselju Kamenjar i na Ribarskom ostrvu i kuće sa baštom u okolnim selima. Od centra su udaljene četvrt sata do pola sata vožnje.

Zbog blizine grada mnoge su pretvorene u stalne domove, pa se cene približavaju cenama kuća. Proverite da li je objekat legalizovan kao stambeni ili kao vikend objekat i šta to znači za priključke i kredit. Uz Dunav pitajte dokle je dolazila voda u godinama velikih poplava. Na fruškogorskoj strani pregledajte teren zbog klizišta i pitajte kako se zimi održavaju strme ulice. Gradska voda i kanalizacija ne stižu do svih vikend zona. Dobro je porazgovarati sa prvim komšijama pre nego što date kaparu. Širi izbor u brdima daje stranica [vikendice na Fruškoj gori](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice/prodaja/fruska-gora), prazne parcele stranica [placevi u Novom Sadu](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/novi-sad), a kuće u naselju iznad reke stranica [kuće u Sremskoj Kamenici](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/novi-sad/sremska-kamenica).', text_en = 'Weekend cottages for sale near Novi Sad: houses at Popovica and in Bukovac, cottages in Ledinci and Rakovac, buildings by the Danube in the Kamenjar weekend settlement and on Ribarsko Ostrvo, and houses with a garden in the surrounding villages. They are a quarter to half an hour''s drive from the centre.

Being close to the city, many have been turned into permanent homes, so prices are approaching those of houses. Check whether the building is legalised as residential or as a weekend building and what that means for connections and a loan. By the Danube, ask how far the water came in the years of the big floods. On the Fruška Gora side, inspect the ground for landslides and ask how the steep streets are kept passable in winter. Mains water and sewerage do not reach every weekend zone. It is a good idea to talk to the nearest neighbours before you pay a deposit. A wider choice in the hills is on the page [cottages on Fruška Gora](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice/prodaja/fruska-gora), empty parcels on the page [plots in Novi Sad](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/novi-sad), and houses in the settlement above the river on the page [houses in Sremska Kamenica](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/novi-sad/sremska-kamenica).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'cottages') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Novi Sad') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja placeva i zemljišta u Novom Sadu: građevinske parcele u Veterniku, Futogu, Kaću i Rumenki, placevi na sremskoj strani u Sremskoj Kamenici, Bukovcu i Petrovaradinu, zemljište za hale u radnim zonama i njive oko grada.

Grad se širi ka zapadu i severu, pa se u oglasima često nude njive „uz građevinsku zonu“: proverite u planu da li je parcela zaista građevinska ili se promena tek očekuje. Kod poljoprivrednog zemljišta računajte na troškove promene namene. Ravnica olakšava gradnju, ali proverite nivo podzemnih voda i da li je teren nasipan. Na sremskoj strani nagib i klizišta traže ispitivanje tla. Pitajte koliko su daleko gas, voda i kanalizacija i ko plaća priključke. Širina parcele je važna koliko i površina, jer uzak plac ograničava projekat. Parcele u najtraženijem prigradskom naselju izdvaja stranica [placevi u Veterniku](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/novi-sad/veternik), vinograde i voćnjake stranica [placevi na Fruškoj gori](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/fruska-gora), a gotove objekte stranica [kuće u Novom Sadu](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/novi-sad).', text_en = 'Plots and land for sale in Novi Sad: building parcels in Veternik, Futog, Kać and Rumenka, plots on the Srem side in Sremska Kamenica, Bukovac and Petrovaradin, land for warehouses in the business zones and fields around the city.

The city is spreading west and north, so ads often offer fields "next to the building zone": check in the plan whether the parcel really is building land or the change is only expected. With farmland, allow for the cost of a change of use. The plain makes building easier, but check the groundwater level and whether the ground has been filled. On the Srem side, the slope and landslides call for a soil survey. Ask how far away gas, water and sewerage are and who pays for the connections. The width of a parcel matters as much as its area, because a narrow plot limits the design. Parcels in the most sought-after suburb are on the page [plots in Veternik](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/novi-sad/veternik), vineyards and orchards on the page [plots on Fruška Gora](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/fruska-gora), and finished buildings on the page [houses in Novi Sad](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/novi-sad).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'land') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Novi Sad') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Garaže i parking mesta u Novom Sadu: garažna mesta u podzemnim garažama novih zgrada, zidane garaže u nizu u starijim naseljima, parking mesta u dvorištima i garaže za izdavanje. U centru, na Grbavici i Limanu parkiranje je stalni problem, pa je sopstveno mesto ozbiljna prednost.

Garažno mesto u novogradnji prodaje se odvojeno od stana, pa proverite da li je uknjiženo kao posebna jedinica ili se stiče samo pravo korišćenja. Izmerite ga: stubovi i uski prolazi umeju da ga učine tesnim za veći automobil. Probajte da uđete i izađete svojim vozilom, pogledajte nagib rampe i da li garaža ima daljinsko otvaranje. Kod zidanih garaža proverite krov, vrata i čije je zemljište ispod. Pitajte da li ima struje, ako planirate punjač ili alat. Kod zakupa dogovorite otkazni rok. Ponudu iz cele zemlje daje rubrika [garaže i parking mesta](/oglasi/nekretnine/garaze), stanove sa garažom stranica [prodaja stanova u Novom Sadu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/novi-sad), a vozila stranica [polovni automobili u Novom Sadu](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/novi-sad).', text_en = 'Garages and parking spaces in Novi Sad: spaces in the underground garages of new buildings, rows of brick garages in the older neighbourhoods, parking spaces in courtyards and garages to rent. In the centre, in Grbavica and in Liman parking is a constant problem, so a space of your own is a serious advantage.

A garage space in a new development is sold separately from the flat, so check whether it is registered as a separate unit or only a right of use is acquired. Measure it: pillars and narrow lanes can make it tight for a bigger car. Try driving in and out in your own vehicle, look at the gradient of the ramp and whether the garage has remote opening. With brick garages, check the roof, the door and who owns the land underneath. Ask whether there is electricity if you plan a charger or tools. With a lease, agree the notice period. The offer from the whole country is in [garages and parking spaces](/oglasi/nekretnine/garaze), flats with a garage on the page [flats for sale in Novi Sad](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/novi-sad), and vehicles on the page [used cars in Novi Sad](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/novi-sad).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'garages') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Novi Sad') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Izdavanje soba u Novom Sadu najviše traže studenti: sobe u stanovima sa cimerima na Limanu i Grbavici, sobe kod stanodavaca na Detelinari i Novom naselju, dvokrevetne sobe i sobe u kućama na Telepu. Kampus je uz Dunav, pa se do njega iz većeg dela grada stiže biciklom ili peške.

Mesta u studentskim domovima nema za sve, pa se sobe traže odmah posle upisa. Pre nego što platite, pogledajte sobu i upoznajte ljude sa kojima ćete deliti stan. Pitajte da li je cena po sobi ili po krevetu, šta je sa računima i da li gazda živi u istom stanu. Proverite grejanje, jer se u starijim kućama greje na gas ili struju, što zimi diže troškove. Mesto za bicikl i dobra veza sa autobusom štede vreme. Dogovorite da li ostajete i preko leta. Veći prostor nudi [izdavanje stanova u Novom Sadu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/novi-sad), zaradu uz studije [studentski poslovi u Novom Sadu](/oglasi/posao/studentski-poslovi/novi-sad), a ponudu u prestonici [izdavanje soba u Beogradu](/oglasi/nekretnine/sobe/izdavanje/beograd).', text_en = 'Rooms to rent in Novi Sad are sought mostly by students: rooms in shared flats in Liman and Grbavica, rooms with landlords in Detelinara and Novo Naselje, twin rooms and rooms in houses in Telep. The campus is by the Danube, so it can be reached from most of the city by bike or on foot.

There are not enough places in the halls of residence for everyone, so rooms are sought right after enrolment. Before you pay, see the room and meet the people you will share the flat with. Ask whether the price is per room or per bed, what happens with the bills and whether the landlord lives in the same flat. Check the heating, because older houses are heated by gas or electricity, which raises costs in winter. A place for a bike and a good bus connection save time. Agree whether you are staying over the summer too. [Flats to rent in Novi Sad](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/novi-sad) offer more space, [student jobs in Novi Sad](/oglasi/posao/studentski-poslovi/novi-sad) earnings alongside your studies, and [rooms to rent in Belgrade](/oglasi/nekretnine/sobe/izdavanje/beograd) the offer in the capital.' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'rooms') AND deal = 'rent' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Novi Sad') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Polovni automobili u Novom Sadu: gradski automobili, karavani, dizelaši za duže relacije, dostavna vozila i sve više hibrida. Ponuda je druga po veličini u zemlji, a oglašavaju se i vlasnici iz okolnih vojvođanskih mesta.

Automobili iz ravnice imaju jednu prednost: manje se troše kočnice i kvačilo nego u brdovitim krajevima. S druge strane, zimi se putevi posipaju solju, pa pogledajte pragove, pod i lukove blatobrana. Probnu vožnju napravite i po gradu i na otvorenom putu, na primer obilaznicom ili auto-putem. Tražite servisnu knjižicu i proverite kilometražu po broju šasije. Ako prodavac nudi vozilo na stranim tablicama, proverite da li je ocarinjeno i ko snosi troškove. Ugovor overite kod javnog beležnika. Zimske i letnje komplete nudi rubrika [gume i felne](/oglasi/vozila/gume-i-felne), delove rubrika [auto delovi](/oglasi/vozila/auto-delovi), veću ponudu stranica [automobili u Beogradu](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/beograd), a vozilo na nekoliko dana stranica [rent a car u Novom Sadu](/oglasi/usluge/rent-a-car/novi-sad).', text_en = 'Used cars in Novi Sad: city cars, estates, diesels for longer distances, delivery vehicles and more and more hybrids. The offer is the second biggest in the country, and owners from the surrounding towns of Vojvodina advertise too.

Cars from the plain have one advantage: brakes and clutch wear less than in hilly areas. On the other hand, roads are salted in winter, so look at the sills, the floor and the wheel arches. Take a test drive both in the city and on an open road, for example on the bypass or the motorway. Ask for the service book and check the mileage by the chassis number. If the seller offers a car on foreign plates, check whether customs duty has been paid and who bears the costs. Have the contract certified by a notary public. Winter and summer sets are in [tyres and wheels](/oglasi/vozila/gume-i-felne), parts in [car parts](/oglasi/vozila/auto-delovi), a bigger offer on the page [cars in Belgrade](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/beograd), and a vehicle for a few days on the page [car rental in Novi Sad](/oglasi/usluge/rent-a-car/novi-sad).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'cars') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Novi Sad') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Rent a car u Novom Sadu za poslovni put, izlet ili zamenu dok je vaš automobil u servisu: mali gradski automobili, limuzine, karavani, kombi vozila za veće grupe i dostavna vozila za selidbu. Agencije nude preuzimanje u gradu, a neke i dostavu na adresu ili na beogradski aerodrom.

Pre potpisivanja pročitajte šta pokriva osiguranje i koliko je učešće u šteti, jer se osnovno i puno kasko znatno razlikuju. Pitajte koliki je depozit, da li je kilometraža ograničena i kako se vraća gorivo. Za put u inostranstvo potrebni su dozvola agencije i zeleni karton. Vozilo pregledajte pri preuzimanju i fotografišite postojeća oštećenja. Tokom festivala i praznika rezervišite ranije. Proverite najmanju starost vozača i potreban vozački staž. Agencije mogu besplatno da objave ponudu sa cenama po danu. Ponudu u drugim gradovima daju stranice [rent a car](/oglasi/usluge/rent-a-car) i [rent a car u Nišu](/oglasi/usluge/rent-a-car/nis), a ko razmišlja o kupovini, neka pogleda [polovne automobile u Novom Sadu](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/novi-sad).', text_en = 'Car rental in Novi Sad for a business trip, an outing or a replacement while your car is being serviced: small city cars, saloons, estates, minibuses for bigger groups and vans for moving. Agencies offer pick-up in the city, and some also deliver to your address or to Belgrade airport.

Before signing, read what the insurance covers and how much the excess is, because basic and full cover differ considerably. Ask how much the deposit is, whether mileage is limited and how the fuel is returned. A trip abroad requires the agency''s permission and a green card. Inspect the vehicle at pick-up and photograph existing damage. Book earlier during festivals and holidays. Check the minimum driver age and the driving experience required. Agencies can publish their offer with prices per day for free. The offer in other cities is on the pages [car rental](/oglasi/usluge/rent-a-car) and [car rental in Niš](/oglasi/usluge/rent-a-car/nis), and anyone thinking about buying should see [used cars in Novi Sad](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/novi-sad).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'car-rental') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Novi Sad') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Polovni nameštaj u Novom Sadu: ugaone garniture i kauči, kreveti i dušeci, ormari, radni stolovi i stolice, kuhinje, trpezarijski kompleti, police i dečji nameštaj. U gradu sa mnogo studenata i podstanara nameštaj često menja vlasnika.

Najviše se nudi krajem juna i u septembru, kada se stanovi prazne i ponovo useljavaju: tada se dobre stvari mogu naći veoma povoljno, ponekad i besplatno uz preuzimanje. Pre dolaska tražite dimenzije i pitajte na kom je spratu stan i ima li lift, jer iznošenje ume da bude teže od prevoza. Proverite da li se komad rastavlja. Tapacirani nameštaj pregledajte zbog mirisa i fleka, a pločasti na ivicama i spojevima. Za veće komade dogovorite kombi unapred. Prodavcima savetujemo da nameštaj slikaju pri dnevnom svetlu i navedu naselje. Po vrstama pogledajte [ugaone garniture](/oglasi/namestaj/garniture/ugaone-garniture) i [bračne krevete](/oglasi/namestaj/kreveti-i-duseci/kreveti), celu ponudu u rubrici [polovni nameštaj](/oglasi/namestaj), a prevoz u rubrici [selidbe i prevoz](/oglasi/usluge/selidbe-i-prevoz).', text_en = 'Used furniture in Novi Sad: corner sofas and sofa beds, beds and mattresses, wardrobes, desks and chairs, kitchens, dining sets, shelves and children''s furniture. In a city with many students and tenants, furniture often changes hands.

Most is offered at the end of June and in September, when flats are emptied and occupied again: good things can then be found very cheaply, sometimes even free for collection. Before you come, ask for the dimensions and which floor the flat is on and whether there is a lift, because carrying out can be harder than the transport. Check whether the piece comes apart. Inspect upholstered furniture for smells and stains, and board furniture at the edges and joints. For bigger pieces, arrange a van in advance. We advise sellers to photograph furniture in daylight and state the neighbourhood. By type, see [corner sofas](/oglasi/namestaj/garniture/ugaone-garniture) and [double beds](/oglasi/namestaj/kreveti-i-duseci/kreveti), the whole offer in [used furniture](/oglasi/namestaj), and transport in [removals and transport](/oglasi/usluge/selidbe-i-prevoz).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'furniture') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Novi Sad') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Oglasi za posao u Novom Sadu: programeri i podrška u IT firmama, trgovci, konobari i kuvari, vozači i dostavljači, građevinski radnici, radnici u proizvodnji, administracija, nastavnici i negovateljice. Grad je jedan od najvećih centara softverske industrije u zemlji, ali najviše oglasa i dalje stiže iz trgovine i ugostiteljstva.

Fabrike i logistički centri nalaze se u radnim zonama na obodu grada i u susednim opštinama, pa pitajte za organizovan prevoz. U sezoni festivala i sajmova raste potreba za privremenim radnicima u ugostiteljstvu i obezbeđenju. Mnoge firme traže znanje engleskog, a uz granicu su na ceni i mađarski i nemački. Pre razgovora proverite poslodavca i ne pristajte na rad bez prijave. U prijavi navedite kada možete da počnete. Poslove za studente izdvaja stranica [studentski i honorarni poslovi u Novom Sadu](/oglasi/posao/studentski-poslovi/novi-sad), rad na daljinu stranica [posao od kuće](/oglasi/posao/rad-od-kuce), veće tržište stranica [oglasi za posao u Beogradu](/oglasi/posao/beograd), a susedni grad stranica [oglasi za posao u Zrenjaninu](/oglasi/posao/zrenjanin).', text_en = 'Job ads in Novi Sad: developers and support staff in IT companies, sales staff, waiters and cooks, drivers and couriers, construction workers, production workers, administration, teachers and carers. The city is one of the biggest centres of the software industry in the country, but most ads still come from retail and hospitality.

Factories and logistics centres are in the business zones on the edge of the city and in neighbouring municipalities, so ask about organised transport. In the season of festivals and fairs, the need for temporary staff in hospitality and security grows. Many companies want English, and near the border Hungarian and German are valued too. Before an interview, check the employer and do not agree to work without registration. In your application, say when you can start. Jobs for students are on the page [student and part-time jobs in Novi Sad](/oglasi/posao/studentski-poslovi/novi-sad), remote work on the page [work from home](/oglasi/posao/rad-od-kuce), a bigger market on the page [jobs in Belgrade](/oglasi/posao/beograd), and the neighbouring city on the page [jobs in Zrenjanin](/oglasi/posao/zrenjanin).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'jobs') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Novi Sad') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Studentski i honorarni poslovi u Novom Sadu: rad u kafićima i restoranima, promocije, hostese na sajmu, rad na festivalima, dostava biciklom, pomoć u magacinu, anketiranje, čuvanje dece i davanje časova. Grad pun studenata ima i mnogo poslodavaca koji računaju baš na njih.

Sajamske manifestacije i letnji festivali donose kratke, dobro plaćene angažmane, za koje se prijave otvaraju nedeljama ranije. Za rad preko zadruge potrebni su članstvo i indeks ili potvrda o studiranju. Pitajte da li se plaća po satu ili po učinku i kada stiže isplata. Poslovi u večernjim smenama lakše se uklapaju sa predavanjima, ali dogovorite slobodne dane za kolokvijume. Znanje stranih jezika otvara vrata korisničkoj podršci, gde je satnica viša. Bicikl je u ovom gradu dovoljno prevozno sredstvo za većinu poslova. Stalna radna mesta nudi stranica [oglasi za posao u Novom Sadu](/oglasi/posao/novi-sad), krov nad glavom [izdavanje soba u Novom Sadu](/oglasi/nekretnine/sobe/izdavanje/novi-sad), a ponudu iz drugih gradova stranica [studentski i honorarni poslovi](/oglasi/posao/studentski-poslovi).', text_en = 'Student and part-time jobs in Novi Sad: work in cafés and restaurants, promotions, hostesses at the fair, festival work, delivery by bike, warehouse help, surveys, babysitting and giving lessons. A city full of students also has many employers who count on exactly them.

Trade fairs and summer festivals bring short, well-paid engagements, for which applications open weeks in advance. Work through a cooperative requires membership and a student record book or a certificate of enrolment. Ask whether you are paid by the hour or by results and when the money arrives. Evening shifts fit in with lectures more easily, but agree days off for mid-term tests. Foreign languages open the door to customer support, where the hourly rate is higher. In this city a bike is transport enough for most jobs. Permanent positions are on the page [jobs in Novi Sad](/oglasi/posao/novi-sad), a roof over your head under [rooms to rent in Novi Sad](/oglasi/nekretnine/sobe/izdavanje/novi-sad), and the offer from other cities on the page [student and part-time jobs](/oglasi/posao/studentski-poslovi).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'student-jobs') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Novi Sad') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Oglasi iz Niša, najvećeg grada na jugu Srbije: stanovi i kuće, poslovi, automobili, tehnika, nameštaj, usluge i ponude iz okolnih mesta. Kao univerzitetski i trgovački centar, Niš okuplja kupce i prodavce iz celog regiona.

Cene su ovde niže nego u Beogradu i Novom Sadu, pa mnogi dolaze i iz drugih gradova po automobil ili nameštaj. Dogovorite susret na poznatom mestu, na primer kod Tvrđave ili u nekom od tržnih centara, i robu proverite pre plaćanja. U oglasu navedite deo grada, kao što su Medijana, Pantelej ili Palilula, da bi vas kupci lakše našli. Ko prodaje, neka doda više fotografija i jasnu cenu, jer se takvi oglasi otvaraju najčešće. Najtraženije su stranice [nekretnine u Nišu](/oglasi/nekretnine/nis), [oglasi za posao u Nišu](/oglasi/posao/nis) i [polovni automobili u Nišu](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/nis), a studentima je najvažnija stranica [izdavanje stanova u Nišu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/nis).', text_en = 'Ads from Niš, the biggest city in the south of Serbia: flats and houses, jobs, cars, electronics, furniture, services and offers from the surrounding towns. As a university and trading centre, Niš brings together buyers and sellers from the whole region.

Prices here are lower than in Belgrade and Novi Sad, so many people come from other cities for a car or furniture too. Arrange to meet at a well-known place, for example by the Fortress or in one of the shopping centres, and check the goods before paying. State the part of the city in your ad, such as Medijana, Pantelej or Palilula, so that buyers find you more easily. Sellers should add several photos and a clear price, because such ads are opened most often. The most sought-after pages are [real estate in Niš](/oglasi/nekretnine/nis), [jobs in Niš](/oglasi/posao/nis) and [used cars in Niš](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/nis), and for students the most important page is [flats to rent in Niš](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/nis).' WHERE category_id IS NULL AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Niš') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Nekretnine u Nišu: stanovi u centru i na Bulevaru Nemanjića, kuće u Pantelejskoj i Palilulskoj opštini, placevi na obodu grada, lokali u pešačkoj zoni i vikendice u Niškoj Banji i okolnim selima. Kvadrat je ovde pristupačniji nego u gradovima na severu, što privlači i kupce iz inostranstva.

Grad leži u kotlini uz Nišavu, pa su leta vrela: orijentacija stana, izolacija i klima nisu sitnice. Medijana je najtraženija za stanovanje zbog bulevara, škola i parkova, dok su naselja ka Niškoj Banji mirnija i zelenija. Pre kupovine proverite uknjiženost i da li zgrada ima upravnika i uredno održavanje. U starijim zgradama pitajte za grejanje, jer nisu sve na toplani. Dijaspora često kupuje na daljinu, pa je punomoćje kod advokata česta praksa. Ponudu suzite na [prodaju stanova u Nišu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/nis), [izdavanje stanova u Nišu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/nis) ili [prodaju kuća u Nišu](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/nis), a savete za kupce daje rubrika [nekretnine](/oglasi/nekretnine).', text_en = 'Real estate in Niš: flats in the centre and on Bulevar Nemanjića, houses in the municipalities of Pantelej and Palilula, plots on the edge of the city, shops in the pedestrian zone and cottages in Niška Banja and the surrounding villages. A square metre is more affordable here than in the cities to the north, which attracts buyers from abroad too.

The city lies in a basin on the Nišava, so summers are scorching: the orientation of a flat, the insulation and air conditioning are not trifles. Medijana is the most wanted for living because of the boulevard, the schools and the parks, while the neighbourhoods towards Niška Banja are quieter and greener. Before buying, check the registration and whether the building has a manager and proper upkeep. In older buildings, ask about heating, because not all are on the district heating network. The diaspora often buys from a distance, so a power of attorney with a lawyer is common practice. Narrow the offer to [flats for sale in Niš](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/nis), [flats to rent in Niš](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/nis) or [houses for sale in Niš](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/nis), and advice for buyers is in [real estate](/oglasi/nekretnine).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'real-estate') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Niš') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja stanova u Nišu: garsonjere i jednosobni stanovi za izdavanje studentima, dvosobni i trosobni stanovi na Bulevaru Nemanjića i u centru, stanovi u novim zgradama u Durlanu, Panteleju i kod Čaira i povoljniji stanovi u starijim blokovima.

Bulevar Nemanjića je žila kucavica grada i stanovi uz njega drže cenu, ali proverite buku i parking. Novogradnje je mnogo i u ulicama sa porodičnim kućama, gde se na mestu jedne kuće diže zgrada: pogledajte širinu ulice i gde će stanari parkirati. Zbog letnjih vrućina izbegavajte stanove pod ravnim krovom bez dobre izolacije. Pitajte da li je zgrada priključena na toplanu ili se greje na struju i gas. Kod investitora tražite dozvole i reference prethodnih zgrada. Stan blizu fakulteta ili kliničkog centra lako se izdaje. Kuće sa dvorištem nudi stranica [prodaja kuća u Nišu](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/nis), tržište zakupa stranica [izdavanje stanova u Nišu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/nis), a poređenje sa drugim gradom stranica [prodaja stanova u Kragujevcu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/kragujevac).', text_en = 'Flats for sale in Niš: studios and one-bedroom flats for letting to students, two- and three-bedroom flats on Bulevar Nemanjića and in the centre, flats in new buildings in Durlan, Pantelej and by Čair, and cheaper flats in older blocks.

Bulevar Nemanjića is the city''s main artery and flats along it hold their price, but check the noise and the parking. There is a lot of new development in streets of family houses too, where a block goes up in place of a single house: look at the width of the street and where residents will park. Because of the summer heat, avoid flats under a flat roof without good insulation. Ask whether the building is connected to district heating or heated by electricity and gas. From a developer, ask for the permits and references from earlier buildings. A flat near the faculties or the clinical centre lets easily. Houses with a garden are on the page [houses for sale in Niš](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/nis), the rental market on the page [flats to rent in Niš](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/nis), and a comparison with another city on the page [flats for sale in Kragujevac](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/kragujevac).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Niš') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Izdavanje stanova u Nišu: garsonjere i jednosobni stanovi blizu fakulteta, dvosobni stanovi za cimere i porodice, namešteni stanovi za lekare na specijalizaciji i zaposlene u fabrikama i prazni stanovi za duži zakup.

Fakulteti su raspoređeni po gradu, pa stan birajte prema svom: tehnički fakulteti su kod Crvenog krsta, medicinski kod kliničkog centra, a ostali bliže centru. Kirije su niže nego u većim gradovima, ali se najbolji stanovi izdaju već tokom leta. Pitajte čime se stan greje i koliki su zimski računi, a zbog leta proverite da li ima klimu. Dogovorite da li se kirija plaća i tokom raspusta. Proverite i gradski prevoz do fakulteta ili posla. Depozit i stanje stvari neka budu upisani u ugovor. Jeftiniji smeštaj traži se u rubrici [sobe za izdavanje](/oglasi/nekretnine/sobe), zarada uz studije na stranici [studentski poslovi u Nišu](/oglasi/posao/studentski-poslovi/nis), kraći boravak na stranici [stan na dan u Nišu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/na-dan/nis), a kupovina na stranici [prodaja stanova u Nišu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/nis).', text_en = 'Flats to rent in Niš: studios and one-bedroom flats near the faculties, two-bedroom flats for flatmates and families, furnished flats for doctors in specialist training and for factory employees, and unfurnished flats for a longer lease.

The faculties are spread around the city, so choose a flat according to yours: the technical faculties are at Crveni Krst, the medical faculty by the clinical centre, and the others closer to the centre. Rents are lower than in the bigger cities, but the best flats are let during the summer already. Ask how the flat is heated and how high the winter bills are, and because of the summers check that it has air conditioning. Agree whether rent is paid during the holidays too. Check the public transport to the faculty or to work as well. The deposit and the condition of the contents should be written into the contract. Cheaper accommodation is in [rooms to rent](/oglasi/nekretnine/sobe), earnings alongside studies on the page [student jobs in Niš](/oglasi/posao/studentski-poslovi/nis), a shorter stay on the page [flats by the day in Niš](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/na-dan/nis), and buying on the page [flats for sale in Niš](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/nis).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'rent' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Niš') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Stan na dan u Nišu za putnike na proputovanju ka moru, poslovne goste, pratioce pacijenata kliničkog centra i posetioce festivala: apartmani u centru kod Tvrđave i pešačke zone, stanovi na Bulevaru Nemanjića i smeštaj u blizini aerodroma i autobuske stanice.

Niš je na raskrsnici puteva ka Bugarskoj, Grčkoj i Severnoj Makedoniji, pa mnogi ovde samo prenoće: takvim gostima je najvažniji siguran parking i mogućnost kasnog dolaska. Domaćinu javite okvirno vreme, jer se ključ često predaje lično. Leti proverite klimu, a ako dolazite avionom, pitajte koliko je stan udaljen od aerodroma. Za večernji izlazak birajte smeštaj blizu Kazandžijskog sokačeta i keja. Tokom džez festivala u Tvrđavi i sajmova rezervišite ranije. Račun tražite ako putujete službeno. Vozilo za dalje nudi stranica [rent a car u Nišu](/oglasi/usluge/rent-a-car/nis), duži boravak stranica [izdavanje stanova u Nišu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/nis), a smeštaj u prestonici stranica [stan na dan u Beogradu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/na-dan/beograd).', text_en = 'A flat by the day in Niš for travellers passing through on the way to the sea, business guests, people accompanying patients of the clinical centre and festival visitors: apartments in the centre by the Fortress and the pedestrian zone, flats on Bulevar Nemanjića and places near the airport and the bus station.

Niš is at the crossroads of the routes to Bulgaria, Greece and North Macedonia, so many people just spend a night here: for such guests secure parking and the option of a late arrival matter most. Let the host know your approximate time, because the key is often handed over in person. In summer check the air conditioning, and if you are arriving by plane ask how far the flat is from the airport. For an evening out, choose a place near Kazandžijsko Sokače and the riverside. Book earlier during the jazz festival in the Fortress and during fairs. Ask for an invoice if you are travelling on business. A vehicle for the onward journey is on the page [car rental in Niš](/oglasi/usluge/rent-a-car/nis), a longer stay on the page [flats to rent in Niš](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/nis), and accommodation in the capital on the page [flats by the day in Belgrade](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/na-dan/beograd).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'daily' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Niš') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja kuća u Nišu: porodične kuće sa dvorištem u Panteleju, Durlanu i Palilulskoj rampi, kuće u prigradskim naseljima Brzi Brod, Donja Vrežina i Pasi Poljana, spratne kuće sa više stanova i kuće u Niškoj Banji.

Mnoge niške kuće zidane su u etapama, sprat po sprat, kako je porodica rasla, pa proverite da li je svaki nivo ucrtan i uknjižen. Kuće sa dva ili tri odvojena stana pogodne su za više generacija ili izdavanje. Pogledajte krov, fasadu i izolaciju, jer se kuća leti pregreva, a zimi skupo greje. Pitajte čime se greje i da li je gas doveden do ulice. U naseljima na padinama iznad grada proverite prilaz zimi i pritisak vode. Dvorište sa bunarom i voćem ovde je česta i cenjena pogodnost. Proverite i udaljenost škole i autobuske linije. Stanove nudi stranica [prodaja stanova u Nišu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/nis), celu ponudu stranica [nekretnine u Nišu](/oglasi/nekretnine/nis), opšte savete stranica [prodaja kuća](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja), a sličan grad stranica [prodaja kuća u Kragujevcu](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/kragujevac).', text_en = 'Houses for sale in Niš: family houses with a garden in Pantelej, Durlan and Palilulska Rampa, houses in the suburbs of Brzi Brod, Donja Vrežina and Pasi Poljana, multi-storey houses with several flats and houses in Niška Banja.

Many houses in Niš were built in stages, floor by floor, as the family grew, so check that every level is drawn in and registered. Houses with two or three separate flats suit several generations or letting. Look at the roof, the facade and the insulation, because a house overheats in summer and is costly to heat in winter. Ask how it is heated and whether gas has been brought to the street. In neighbourhoods on the slopes above the city, check the access in winter and the water pressure. A garden with a well and fruit trees is a common and valued asset here. Check the distance to the school and the bus line too. Flats are on the page [flats for sale in Niš](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/nis), the whole offer on the page [real estate in Niš](/oglasi/nekretnine/nis), general advice on the page [houses for sale](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja), and a similar city on the page [houses for sale in Kragujevac](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/kragujevac).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'houses') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Niš') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Polovni automobili u Nišu: pristupačni gradski automobili, dizeli za duge relacije, vozila sa ugrađenim gasom, kombiji i terenci. Kupci dolaze iz celog juga Srbije, pa se ovde dobro prodaje sve što je pouzdano i jeftino za održavanje.

Na jugu se mnogo vozi na gas, pa kod takvih vozila tražite atest, proverite datum rezervoara i da li je uređaj upisan u saobraćajnu dozvolu. Pitajte gde je automobil servisiran i tražite račune. Vozila koja su dugo vožena po lošijim putevima imaju istrošeniji trap, pa poslušajte prednji kraj na probnoj vožnji. Leti proverite klimu, jer je bez nje vožnja u niškoj kotlini mučenje. Automobile iz uvoza proverite po broju šasije pre nego što krenete na put da ih vidite. Dogovorite pregled kod majstora po svom izboru. Delove za popravku nudi rubrika [auto delovi](/oglasi/vozila/auto-delovi), sve marke rubrika [polovni automobili](/oglasi/vozila/automobili), veću ponudu stranica [automobili u Beogradu](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/beograd), a privremeno rešenje stranica [rent a car u Nišu](/oglasi/usluge/rent-a-car/nis).', text_en = 'Used cars in Niš: affordable city cars, diesels for long distances, cars converted to gas, vans and off-roaders. Buyers come from all over the south of Serbia, so anything reliable and cheap to maintain sells well here.

In the south many cars run on gas, so with such vehicles ask for the certificate, check the date of the tank and whether the system is entered in the registration document. Ask where the car was serviced and ask for invoices. Vehicles driven for a long time on poorer roads have more worn suspension, so listen to the front end on the test drive. In summer check the air conditioning, because without it driving in the Niš basin is a torment. Check imported cars by chassis number before you travel to see them. Arrange an inspection by a mechanic of your own choice. Parts for repairs are in [car parts](/oglasi/vozila/auto-delovi), all makes in [used cars](/oglasi/vozila/automobili), a bigger offer on the page [cars in Belgrade](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/beograd), and a temporary solution on the page [car rental in Niš](/oglasi/usluge/rent-a-car/nis).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'cars') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Niš') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Rent a car u Nišu traže putnici koji sleću na niški aerodrom, naši ljudi iz inostranstva tokom odmora, poslovni gosti i oni koji nastavljaju put ka jugu: u ponudi su mali automobili, porodični karavani, kombi vozila i automobili sa automatskim menjačem.

Mnoge agencije predaju vozilo na aerodromu Konstantin Veliki ili na adresi u gradu, pa pri rezervaciji navedite broj leta i vreme dolaska. Ako planirate put u Bugarsku, Grčku ili Severnu Makedoniju, to recite unapred: potrebni su dozvola agencije i zeleni karton, a neke agencije naplaćuju prelazak granice. Leti i oko praznika, kada stiže dijaspora, vozila se rezervišu nedeljama ranije. Proverite šta pokriva osiguranje, koliki je depozit i da li se plaća karticom ili gotovinom. Vozilo vratite sa istom količinom goriva. Pitajte za dečje sedište ako putujete sa decom. Ponudu u drugim gradovima daju stranice [rent a car](/oglasi/usluge/rent-a-car) i [rent a car u Novom Sadu](/oglasi/usluge/rent-a-car/novi-sad), a kupovinu stranica [polovni automobili u Nišu](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/nis).', text_en = 'Car rental in Niš is sought by travellers landing at Niš airport, Serbs from abroad during their holidays, business guests and those continuing south: on offer are small cars, family estates, minibuses and cars with an automatic gearbox.

Many agencies hand over the vehicle at Constantine the Great Airport or at an address in the city, so give your flight number and arrival time when booking. If you plan a trip to Bulgaria, Greece or North Macedonia, say so in advance: the agency''s permission and a green card are needed, and some agencies charge for crossing the border. In summer and around the holidays, when the diaspora arrives, vehicles are booked weeks ahead. Check what the insurance covers, how much the deposit is and whether you pay by card or in cash. Return the vehicle with the same amount of fuel. Ask for a child seat if you are travelling with children. The offer in other cities is on the pages [car rental](/oglasi/usluge/rent-a-car) and [car rental in Novi Sad](/oglasi/usluge/rent-a-car/novi-sad), and buying on the page [used cars in Niš](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/nis).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'car-rental') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Niš') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Oglasi za posao u Nišu: radnici u fabrikama auto-delova i elektronike, trgovci, konobari i kuvari, vozači, građevinski radnici, medicinske sestre, programeri i operateri u kontakt centrima. Grad je industrijski i univerzitetski centar juga, sa sve više stranih kompanija i IT firmi.

Fabrike rade u smenama i najčešće organizuju prevoz iz grada i okolnih mesta: pitajte za smene, topli obrok i trajanje ugovora. Kontakt centri traže strane jezike, a programerske firme često nude praksu studentima završnih godina. Uporedite ponuđenu platu sa troškovima života, koji su ovde niži nego u prestonici. Ne pristajte na rad bez prijave i ne plaćajte nikakve „troškove obrade“ prijave. Pitajte kada je isplata i da li je deo zarade promenljiv. Poslove uz studije izdvaja stranica [studentski i honorarni poslovi u Nišu](/oglasi/posao/studentski-poslovi/nis), ponude iz regiona stranice [oglasi za posao u Leskovcu](/oglasi/posao/leskovac) i [oglasi za posao u Prokuplju](/oglasi/posao/prokuplje), a rad u drugim zemljama rubrika [posao u inostranstvu](/oglasi/posao/posao-u-inostranstvu).', text_en = 'Job ads in Niš: workers in car-parts and electronics factories, sales staff, waiters and cooks, drivers, construction workers, nurses, developers and contact-centre operators. The city is the industrial and university centre of the south, with more and more foreign companies and IT firms.

The factories work in shifts and usually organise transport from the city and the surrounding towns: ask about the shifts, the meal allowance and the length of the contract. Contact centres want foreign languages, and software companies often offer internships to final-year students. Compare the pay offered with the cost of living, which is lower here than in the capital. Do not agree to work without registration and do not pay any "processing costs" for an application. Ask when pay day is and whether part of the pay is variable. Jobs alongside studies are on the page [student and part-time jobs in Niš](/oglasi/posao/studentski-poslovi/nis), offers from the region on the pages [jobs in Leskovac](/oglasi/posao/leskovac) and [jobs in Prokuplje](/oglasi/posao/prokuplje), and work in other countries in [jobs abroad](/oglasi/posao/posao-u-inostranstvu).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'jobs') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Niš') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Studentski i honorarni poslovi u Nišu: rad u kafićima i restoranima, promocije u tržnim centrima, rad u kontakt centrima, pomoć u magacinima, dostava, anketiranje, davanje časova i sezonski poslovi tokom leta i festivala.

Niš je studentski grad u kome se od honorarnog posla može pokriti dobar deo troškova, jer su kirije i hrana jeftiniji nego na severu. Kontakt centri nude rad u skraćenim smenama, što odgovara studentima viših godina koji znaju jezike. Preko leta mnogi odlaze na sezonski rad na more ili u inostranstvo, pa se prijave za te programe otvaraju još zimi. Dogovorite satnicu, raspored i način isplate pre prvog radnog dana. Posao preko zadruge donosi uredne papire i osiguranje za slučaj povrede. Ne ostavljajte indeks ni dokumenta kao zalog. Stalne poslove nudi stranica [oglasi za posao u Nišu](/oglasi/posao/nis), smeštaj stranica [izdavanje stanova u Nišu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/nis), ponudu iz cele zemlje stranica [studentski i honorarni poslovi](/oglasi/posao/studentski-poslovi), a zaradu od znanja rubrika [privatni časovi i kursevi](/oglasi/usluge/casovi-i-kursevi).', text_en = 'Student and part-time jobs in Niš: work in cafés and restaurants, promotions in shopping centres, contact-centre work, warehouse help, delivery, surveys, giving lessons and seasonal jobs in summer and during festivals.

Niš is a student city where part-time work can cover a good share of your costs, because rent and food are cheaper than in the north. Contact centres offer shorter shifts, which suits students in the later years who speak languages. Over the summer many go for seasonal work at the seaside or abroad, and applications for those programmes open in winter. Agree the hourly rate, the rota and the method of payment before your first working day. Work through a cooperative brings proper papers and insurance in case of injury. Do not leave your student record book or documents as a pledge. Permanent jobs are on the page [jobs in Niš](/oglasi/posao/nis), accommodation on the page [flats to rent in Niš](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/nis), the offer from the whole country on the page [student and part-time jobs](/oglasi/posao/studentski-poslovi), and earnings from what you know in [private lessons and courses](/oglasi/usluge/casovi-i-kursevi).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'student-jobs') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Niš') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Oglasi iz Kragujevca, središta Šumadije: stanovi i kuće, poslovi, automobili i delovi, nameštaj, tehnika, poljoprivredna oprema i usluge. Grad automobilske industrije i univerziteta ima živo tržište, na koje dolaze i kupci iz okolnih šumadijskih mesta.

Kragujevac je dovoljno mali da se do svakog prodavca stigne za četvrt sata, pa nema razloga da robu ne pogledate pre kupovine. Ponuda automobila i delova ovde je bogatija nego u gradovima slične veličine, zahvaljujući fabrici i majstorima koji su uz nju stasali. U oglasu navedite naselje, na primer Aerodrom, Erdogliju ili Bubanj. Jasna cena i nekoliko dobrih fotografija ubrzavaju prodaju. Uključite obaveštenja za sačuvanu pretragu ako čekate određenu ponudu. Najposećenije su stranice [nekretnine u Kragujevcu](/oglasi/nekretnine/kragujevac), [oglasi za posao u Kragujevcu](/oglasi/posao/kragujevac), [polovni automobili u Kragujevcu](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/kragujevac) i [polovni nameštaj u Kragujevcu](/oglasi/namestaj/kragujevac).', text_en = 'Ads from Kragujevac, the heart of Šumadija: flats and houses, jobs, cars and parts, furniture, electronics, farm equipment and services. The city of the car industry and a university has a lively market, which draws buyers from the surrounding towns of Šumadija too.

Kragujevac is small enough to reach any seller in a quarter of an hour, so there is no reason not to see the goods before buying. The offer of cars and parts here is richer than in cities of similar size, thanks to the factory and the mechanics who grew up alongside it. State the neighbourhood in your ad, for example Aerodrom, Erdoglija or Bubanj. A clear price and a few good photos speed up a sale. Switch on alerts for a saved search if you are waiting for a particular offer. The most visited pages are [real estate in Kragujevac](/oglasi/nekretnine/kragujevac), [jobs in Kragujevac](/oglasi/posao/kragujevac), [used cars in Kragujevac](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/kragujevac) and [used furniture in Kragujevac](/oglasi/namestaj/kragujevac).' WHERE category_id IS NULL AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Kragujevac') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Nekretnine u Kragujevcu: stanovi u centru i u naseljima Aerodrom, Erdoglija i Bubanj, porodične kuće u Stanovu, Vinogradima i Ilićevu, placevi na obodu grada, lokali i poslovni prostor. Cene su umerene, a ponuda novogradnje raste iz godine u godinu.

Grad je na brežuljcima, pa se naselja razlikuju po nagibu ulica, pogledu i udaljenosti od centra. Aerodrom je najveće stambeno naselje sa zgradama, školama i tržnim centrima, a Erdoglija i Bubanj su bliže centru i parkovima. Ko traži kuću sa dvorištem, gleda mirnije krajeve prema Šumaricama i obodu grada. Proverite gradski prevoz, jer nisu svi krajevi podjednako povezani. U starijim zgradama pitajte za grejanje i stanje krova, a kod novih za dozvole i parking. Ponudu suzite na [prodaju stanova](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/kragujevac), [izdavanje stanova](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/kragujevac), [prodaju kuća](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/kragujevac) ili [placeve](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/kragujevac), a cele kuće u zakup nudi stranica [izdavanje kuća u Kragujevcu](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/izdavanje/kragujevac).', text_en = 'Real estate in Kragujevac: flats in the centre and in the neighbourhoods of Aerodrom, Erdoglija and Bubanj, family houses in Stanovo, Vinogradi and Ilićevo, plots on the edge of the city, shops and commercial space. Prices are moderate, and the offer of new development grows from year to year.

The city lies on low hills, so the neighbourhoods differ in the slope of the streets, the view and the distance from the centre. Aerodrom is the biggest residential area, with blocks of flats, schools and shopping centres, while Erdoglija and Bubanj are closer to the centre and the parks. Those looking for a house with a garden look at the quieter areas towards Šumarice and the edge of the city. Check the public transport, because not all areas are equally well connected. In older buildings, ask about the heating and the state of the roof, and with new ones about the permits and the parking. Narrow the offer to [flats for sale](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/kragujevac), [flats to rent](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/kragujevac), [houses for sale](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/kragujevac) or [plots](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/kragujevac), and whole houses to let are on the page [houses to rent in Kragujevac](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/izdavanje/kragujevac).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'real-estate') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Kragujevac') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja stanova u Kragujevcu: jednosobni i dvosobni stanovi u naselju Aerodrom, stanovi u centru i oko Velikog parka, novogradnja u Erdogliji, Bubnju i na Maloj vagi i povoljniji stanovi u starijim zgradama građenim za radnike fabrike.

Naselje Aerodrom ima sve na jednom mestu i tu se stanovi najbrže prodaju, ali uporedite zgrade po starosti i održavanju. Stanovi u centru su skuplji, a parking je teži. Kod novogradnje u ulicama sa kućama pogledajte širinu prilaza i broj parking mesta. Pitajte da li je zgrada na daljinskom grejanju i kako se ono obračunava. U zgradama na padini proverite prizemlje i suteren zbog vlage. Mali stanovi blizu fakulteta i kliničkog centra traženi su za izdavanje. Proverite uknjiženost i da li na stanu ima tereta. Kuće nudi stranica [prodaja kuća u Kragujevcu](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/kragujevac), zakup stranica [izdavanje stanova u Kragujevcu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/kragujevac), a poređenje sa jugom stranica [prodaja stanova u Nišu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/nis).', text_en = 'Flats for sale in Kragujevac: one- and two-bedroom flats in the Aerodrom neighbourhood, flats in the centre and around the Great Park, new developments in Erdoglija, Bubanj and Mala Vaga, and cheaper flats in older buildings built for the factory''s workers.

Aerodrom has everything in one place and flats sell fastest there, but compare the buildings by age and upkeep. Flats in the centre are dearer and parking is harder. With new developments in streets of houses, look at the width of the access and the number of parking spaces. Ask whether the building is on district heating and how it is charged. In buildings on a slope, check the ground floor and the basement for damp. Small flats near the faculties and the clinical centre are in demand for letting. Check the registration and whether there are encumbrances on the flat. Houses are on the page [houses for sale in Kragujevac](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/kragujevac), rentals on the page [flats to rent in Kragujevac](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/kragujevac), and a comparison with the south on the page [flats for sale in Niš](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/nis).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Kragujevac') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Izdavanje stanova u Kragujevcu: garsonjere i jednosobni stanovi za studente, dvosobni stanovi za porodice i cimere, namešteni stanovi za stručnjake koji dolaze zbog posla u fabrikama i prazni stanovi za dugoročan zakup.

Studenti traže stan blizu svog fakulteta, a oni su raspoređeni po više delova grada, pa najpre pogledajte mapu. Naselje Aerodrom ima najviše ponuda i dobru vezu sa centrom. Stranci i inženjeri na privremenom radu traže potpuno opremljene stanove sa parkingom i internetom, pa vlasnici takvih stanova to treba da istaknu u oglasu. Pitajte kako se plaća grejanje i da li zimi stiže velik račun za struju. Dogovorite otkazni rok i šta se dešava sa depozitom. Proverite da li je dozvoljeno držanje ljubimaca. Stan pogledajte i uveče, zbog buke i parkiranja. Ko traži dvorište, ima stranicu [izdavanje kuća u Kragujevcu](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/izdavanje/kragujevac), za nekoliko noći tu je [stan na dan u Kragujevcu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/na-dan/kragujevac), a za trajno rešenje [prodaja stanova u Kragujevcu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/kragujevac).', text_en = 'Flats to rent in Kragujevac: studios and one-bedroom flats for students, two-bedroom flats for families and flatmates, furnished flats for specialists who come to work in the factories and unfurnished flats for a long-term lease.

Students look for a flat near their faculty, and the faculties are spread over several parts of the city, so look at the map first. Aerodrom has the most offers and a good connection to the centre. Foreigners and engineers on temporary assignments look for fully equipped flats with parking and internet, so owners of such flats should point that out in the ad. Ask how heating is paid and whether a big electricity bill arrives in winter. Agree the notice period and what happens to the deposit. Check whether pets are allowed. View the flat in the evening too, for the noise and the parking. Those who want a garden have the page [houses to rent in Kragujevac](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/izdavanje/kragujevac), for a few nights there are [flats by the day in Kragujevac](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/na-dan/kragujevac), and for a permanent solution [flats for sale in Kragujevac](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/kragujevac).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'rent' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Kragujevac') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Stan na dan u Kragujevcu za poslovne goste, posetioce kliničkog centra, roditelje studenata i sve koji dolaze na kratko: apartmani u centru, stanovi u naselju Aerodrom i smeštaj u blizini fakulteta i industrijske zone.

Poslovni gosti koji dolaze u fabrike često ostaju po nekoliko nedelja, pa pitajte za popust na duži boravak i da li se izdaje račun na firmu. Pratiocima pacijenata važna je blizina kliničkog centra, a onima koji dolaze na proslave i mature blizina centra. Proverite parking, grejanje i klimu i da li stan ima opremljenu kuhinju. Najavite vreme dolaska, a ključ i uslove odjave dogovorite unapred. Ako dolazite sa decom, pitajte za dodatni ležaj. Vikendom vredi obići spomen-park Šumarice i gradski akvarijum. Duži boravak pokriva stranica [izdavanje stanova u Kragujevcu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/kragujevac), opšte savete daje stranica [stan na dan](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/na-dan), a smeštaj u banji nadomak Šumadije stranica [smeštaj u Vrnjačkoj Banji](/oglasi/odmor/banje/vrnjacka-banja).', text_en = 'A flat by the day in Kragujevac for business guests, visitors to the clinical centre, students'' parents and everyone coming for a short time: apartments in the centre, flats in Aerodrom and places near the faculties and the industrial zone.

Business guests coming to the factories often stay for several weeks, so ask about a discount for a longer stay and whether an invoice is issued to the company. For people accompanying patients, closeness to the clinical centre matters, and for those coming to celebrations and proms, closeness to the centre. Check the parking, the heating and the air conditioning and whether the flat has an equipped kitchen. Announce your arrival time, and agree the key and the check-out terms in advance. If you are coming with children, ask about an extra bed. At the weekend the Šumarice memorial park and the city aquarium are worth a visit. A longer stay is covered by the page [flats to rent in Kragujevac](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/kragujevac), general advice is on the page [flats by the day](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/na-dan), and accommodation in a spa close to Šumadija on the page [accommodation in Vrnjačka Banja](/oglasi/odmor/banje/vrnjacka-banja).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'daily' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Kragujevac') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja kuća u Kragujevcu: porodične kuće u Stanovu, Vinogradima, Ilićevu i Bresnici, starije kuće u širem centru, nove kuće na obodu grada i seoska domaćinstva u okolnim šumadijskim selima sa voćnjacima i okućnicom.

Grad je na brdima, pa svaka kuća ima svoju priču sa terenom: proverite odvodnjavanje dvorišta, potporne zidove i ima li pukotina koje ukazuju na sleganje. Pitajte da li je do ulice doveden gas i ima li kanalizacije, jer se naselja na obodu još priključuju. Kuće građene pre nekoliko decenija često nemaju izolaciju, pa u cenu uračunajte fasadu i stolariju. Seoska domaćinstva privlače one koji žele baštu i voće, ali proverite put, vodu i udaljenost škole. Uporedite uknjiženu površinu sa stvarnom. Plac sa pogledom ovde se posebno ceni. Parcele za gradnju nudi stranica [placevi u Kragujevcu](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/kragujevac), stanove stranica [prodaja stanova u Kragujevcu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/kragujevac), zakup stranica [izdavanje kuća u Kragujevcu](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/izdavanje/kragujevac), a susedni kraj stranica [kuće u Gornjem Milanovcu](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/gornji-milanovac).', text_en = 'Houses for sale in Kragujevac: family houses in Stanovo, Vinogradi, Ilićevo and Bresnica, older houses near the centre, new houses on the edge of the city and village homesteads in the surrounding villages of Šumadija with orchards and a yard.

The city is on hills, so every house has its own story with the ground: check the drainage of the garden, the retaining walls and whether there are cracks that point to settlement. Ask whether gas has been brought to the street and whether there is sewerage, because the neighbourhoods on the edge are still being connected. Houses built a few decades ago often have no insulation, so include a facade and joinery in the price. Village homesteads attract those who want a garden and fruit, but check the road, the water and the distance to the school. Compare the registered area with the real one. A plot with a view is especially prized here. Parcels for building are on the page [plots in Kragujevac](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/kragujevac), flats on the page [flats for sale in Kragujevac](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/kragujevac), rentals on the page [houses to rent in Kragujevac](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/izdavanje/kragujevac), and the neighbouring area on the page [houses in Gornji Milanovac](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/gornji-milanovac).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'houses') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Kragujevac') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Izdavanje kuća u Kragujevcu: cele porodične kuće sa dvorištem, spratovi kuća sa odvojenim ulazom, kuće za smeštaj radnika i kuće pogodne za kancelarije, ordinacije ili vrtiće. Traže ih porodice sa decom i ljubimcima, ali i firme koje dovode radnike na duže vreme.

Firme obično traže više soba, parking za nekoliko vozila i račun, pa vlasnici treba da navedu koliko ležajeva kuća ima i da li izdaju pravnim licima. Porodicama je važno dvorište, blizina škole i mirna ulica. Pre useljenja dogovorite ko održava dvorište, ko plaća odvoz smeća i sitne popravke i kako se greje. Proverite kotao ili peć pre zime i pitajte koliko se ogreva troši. Zapišite stanje brojila i nameštaja. Ako se kuća koristi za delatnost, proverite da li namena to dozvoljava. Manji prostor nudi [izdavanje stanova u Kragujevcu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/kragujevac), kupovinu stranica [prodaja kuća u Kragujevcu](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/kragujevac), a savete za zakupce stranica [izdavanje kuća](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/izdavanje).', text_en = 'Houses to rent in Kragujevac: whole family houses with a garden, floors of houses with a separate entrance, houses for accommodating workers and houses suitable for offices, surgeries or nurseries. They are sought by families with children and pets, but also by companies bringing in workers for a longer time.

Companies usually want several rooms, parking for a few vehicles and an invoice, so owners should say how many beds the house has and whether they let to legal entities. For families, the garden, a school nearby and a quiet street matter. Before moving in, agree who looks after the garden, who pays for rubbish collection and small repairs and how the house is heated. Check the boiler or stove before winter and ask how much fuel is used. Write down the meter readings and the condition of the furniture. If the house is used for a business, check whether its designated use allows that. [Flats to rent in Kragujevac](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/kragujevac) offer a smaller space, buying is on the page [houses for sale in Kragujevac](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/kragujevac), and advice for tenants on the page [houses to rent](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/izdavanje).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'houses') AND deal = 'rent' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Kragujevac') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja placeva i zemljišta u Kragujevcu: građevinske parcele u naseljima na obodu grada, placevi za kuću u Ždraljici, Korićanima i Grošnici, zemljište za hale uz obilaznicu i industrijsku zonu, voćnjaci, livade i njive u šumadijskim selima.

Brdovit teren daje lepe poglede, ali poskupljuje gradnju: na nagnutom placu računajte na iskop, potporne zidove i duži prilaz. Pre kupovine u gradskoj upravi zatražite informaciju o lokaciji i proverite da li je parcela građevinska. Pitajte dokle su stigli vodovod, kanalizacija i gas, jer se mreža na obodu grada još širi. Proverite pristupni put i da li je upisan kao javni. Kod voćnjaka i njiva važni su klasa zemljišta i pristup mehanizacijom. Šumadija je voćarski kraj, pa se parcele sa zasadom šljive i jabuke posebno traže. Savete o gradnji daje stranica [građevinski placevi](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/gradjevinski-placevi), gotove objekte stranica [prodaja kuća u Kragujevcu](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/kragujevac), ponudu iz cele zemlje stranica [prodaja placeva](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja), a susedni kraj stranica [placevi u Čačku](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/cacak).', text_en = 'Plots and land for sale in Kragujevac: building parcels in the neighbourhoods on the edge of the city, plots for a house in Ždraljica, Korićani and Grošnica, land for warehouses along the bypass and the industrial zone, orchards, meadows and fields in the villages of Šumadija.

Hilly ground gives fine views but makes building dearer: on a sloping plot, allow for excavation, retaining walls and a longer access. Before buying, ask the city administration for the location information and check that the parcel is building land. Ask how far the water mains, sewerage and gas have reached, because the network on the edge of the city is still being extended. Check the access road and whether it is registered as public. With orchards and fields, the class of land and access for machinery matter. Šumadija is fruit-growing country, so parcels planted with plum and apple are especially sought after. Advice on building is on the page [building plots](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/gradjevinski-placevi), finished buildings on the page [houses for sale in Kragujevac](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/kragujevac), the offer from the whole country on the page [land for sale](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja), and the neighbouring area on the page [plots in Čačak](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/cacak).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'land') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Kragujevac') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Polovni automobili u Kragujevcu, gradu u kome se automobili prave decenijama: domaći modeli iz kragujevačke fabrike, italijanski automobili iste tehnike, popularne nemačke i francuske marke i dostavna vozila. Ovde gotovo svaka ulica ima majstora koji zna te automobile napamet.

To je prednost i za kupca: pregled kod iskusnog mehaničara lako se dogovara, a delovi za domaće i italijanske modele nalaze se brzo i jeftino. Kod starijih domaćih automobila najpre pogledajte limariju, a kod novijih modela pitajte za servisnu istoriju u ovlašćenom servisu. Proverite ko je bio prvi vlasnik, jer je deo vozila služio u firmama i taksi službama. Tražite probnu vožnju uzbrdo, kakvih u gradu ne manjka, da čujete motor i kvačilo pod opterećenjem. Po markama pogledajte stranice [Fiat](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/fiat) i [Zastava](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/zastava), delove u rubrici [auto delovi](/oglasi/vozila/auto-delovi), a veću ponudu na stranici [polovni automobili u Beogradu](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/beograd).', text_en = 'Used cars in Kragujevac, the city where cars have been made for decades: Serbian models from the Kragujevac factory, Italian cars with the same technology, popular German and French makes and delivery vehicles. Here almost every street has a mechanic who knows those cars by heart.

That is an advantage for the buyer too: an inspection by an experienced mechanic is easy to arrange, and parts for the local and Italian models are found quickly and cheaply. With older local cars, look at the bodywork first, and with newer models ask about the service history at an authorised workshop. Check who the first owner was, because some of the vehicles served in companies and taxi firms. Ask for a test drive uphill, of which the city has no shortage, to hear the engine and the clutch under load. By make, see the pages [Fiat](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/fiat) and [Zastava](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/zastava), parts in [car parts](/oglasi/vozila/auto-delovi), and a bigger offer on the page [used cars in Belgrade](/oglasi/vozila/automobili/beograd).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'cars') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Kragujevac') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Polovni nameštaj u Kragujevcu: garniture i kauči, kreveti, ormari, kuhinjski elementi, trpezarijski stolovi i stolice, komode, police, kancelarijski i dečji nameštaj. Oglase postavljaju porodice koje se sele ili renoviraju, studenti i firme koje menjaju opremu.

Šumadija ima dugu tradiciju stolarskih radionica, pa se među polovnim komadima nađe i nameštaj od punog drveta, pravljen po meri: takav komad vredi više i lako se osvežava brušenjem i lakiranjem. Pre nego što dođete, tražite mere i fotografije sa svih strana. Proverite fioke, šarke i klizače, a kod kuhinja radnu ploču oko sudopere, gde voda najpre napravi štetu. Dogovorite ko rastavlja i iznosi nameštaj. Za prevoz po gradu dovoljan je manji kombi. Firmama se isplati kupovina kancelarijskog nameštaja u kompletu. Celu ponudu daje rubrika [polovni nameštaj](/oglasi/namestaj), garderobne komade rubrika [ormari i plakari](/oglasi/namestaj/ormari-i-komode), kuhinje rubrika [polovne kuhinje](/oglasi/namestaj/kuhinje), a prevoz rubrika [selidbe i prevoz](/oglasi/usluge/selidbe-i-prevoz).', text_en = 'Used furniture in Kragujevac: sofas and sofa beds, beds, wardrobes, kitchen units, dining tables and chairs, chests of drawers, shelves, office and children''s furniture. Ads are posted by families who are moving or renovating, by students and by companies replacing their equipment.

Šumadija has a long tradition of joinery workshops, so among second-hand pieces you also find solid-wood furniture made to measure: such a piece is worth more and is easily refreshed by sanding and varnishing. Before you come, ask for the measurements and photos from all sides. Check the drawers, hinges and runners, and on kitchens the worktop around the sink, where water does damage first. Agree who dismantles and carries out the furniture. A small van is enough for transport within the city. For companies it pays to buy office furniture as a set. The whole offer is in [used furniture](/oglasi/namestaj), storage pieces in [wardrobes](/oglasi/namestaj/ormari-i-komode), kitchens in [used kitchens](/oglasi/namestaj/kuhinje), and transport in [removals and transport](/oglasi/usluge/selidbe-i-prevoz).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'furniture') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Kragujevac') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Oglasi za posao u Kragujevcu: radnici u automobilskoj industriji i kod dobavljača delova, zavarivači, bravari, električari, vozači, trgovci, konobari, medicinsko osoblje, programeri i administracija. Industrija je i dalje kičma grada, a uz nju rastu IT sektor i usluge.

Fabrike i njihovi kooperanti traže radnike za rad u smenama, često uz obuku na radnom mestu, pa prethodno iskustvo nije uvek uslov. Pitajte da li je ugovor na određeno vreme, ima li prevoza i toplog obroka i kako se plaća noćni rad. Zanatlije sa sertifikatom, na primer zavarivači, mogu da biraju između više poslodavaca. Univerzitet i klinički centar zapošljavaju stručni kadar, a trgovina i ugostiteljstvo stalno traže ljude. Proverite poslodavca pre nego što date otkaz na starom poslu. Ponude iz Šumadije i Pomoravlja daju stranice [oglasi za posao u Jagodini](/oglasi/posao/jagodina) i [oglasi za posao u Kraljevu](/oglasi/posao/kraljevo), poslove u pogonima rubrika [posao u proizvodnji](/oglasi/posao/proizvodnja-i-magacin), a sve struke rubrika [oglasi za posao](/oglasi/posao).', text_en = 'Job ads in Kragujevac: workers in the car industry and at parts suppliers, welders, metalworkers, electricians, drivers, sales staff, waiters, medical staff, developers and administration. Industry is still the backbone of the city, with the IT sector and services growing alongside it.

The factories and their subcontractors look for workers for shift work, often with on-the-job training, so previous experience is not always required. Ask whether the contract is fixed-term, whether there is transport and a meal allowance and how night work is paid. Certified tradesmen, welders for example, can choose between several employers. The university and the clinical centre employ professional staff, and retail and hospitality are always looking for people. Check the employer before you hand in your notice at the old job. Offers from Šumadija and Pomoravlje are on the pages [jobs in Jagodina](/oglasi/posao/jagodina) and [jobs in Kraljevo](/oglasi/posao/kraljevo), plant jobs in [production jobs](/oglasi/posao/proizvodnja-i-magacin), and all trades in [job ads](/oglasi/posao).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'jobs') AND deal IS NULL AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Kragujevac') AND district_id IS NULL AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja stanova na Novom Beogradu: stanovi u blokovima sa mnogo zelenila i parkinga, stanovi u soliterima sa pogledom na reke, novogradnja u poslovnoj zoni i manji stanovi blizu Studentskog grada. Široki bulevari, ravan teren i blizina poslovnih centara čine ovaj deo grada najtraženijim.

Blokovi se razlikuju više nego što izgleda: jedni su uz reku i šetalište, drugi uz autoput ili prugu, pa proverite buku u vreme špica. Stanovi iz sedamdesetih i osamdesetih imaju dobre rasporede i daljinsko grejanje, ali pitajte da li su liftovi i fasada obnavljani. U novim kompleksima uporedite mesečne troškove održavanja, jer umeju da budu visoki. Garaža nije nužna svuda, ali oko poslovnih zgrada parkiranje je teško. Mirniji deo opštine nudi stranica [stanovi na Bežanijskoj kosi](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/bezanijska-kosa), zakup stranica [izdavanje stanova na Novom Beogradu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/novi-beograd), susedni kraj stranica [stanovi u Zemunu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/zemun), a ceo grad stranica [prodaja stanova u Beogradu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd).', text_en = 'Flats for sale in New Belgrade: flats in the blocks with plenty of greenery and parking, flats in tower blocks with a view of the rivers, new developments in the business zone and smaller flats near the Student City. Wide boulevards, flat ground and closeness to the business centres make this the most sought-after part of the city.

The blocks differ more than it seems: some are by the river and the promenade, others by the motorway or the railway, so check the noise at rush hour. Flats from the seventies and eighties have good layouts and district heating, but ask whether the lifts and the facade have been renewed. In the new complexes, compare the monthly maintenance charges, because they can be high. A garage is not needed everywhere, but parking is hard around the office buildings. A quieter part of the municipality is on the page [flats in Bežanijska Kosa](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/bezanijska-kosa), rentals on the page [flats to rent in New Belgrade](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/novi-beograd), the neighbouring area on the page [flats in Zemun](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/zemun), and the whole city on the page [flats for sale in Belgrade](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id = (SELECT d.id FROM districts d JOIN cities ci ON ci.id = d.city_id WHERE d.latn = 'Novi Beograd' AND ci.latn = 'Beograd') AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Izdavanje stanova na Novom Beogradu traže zaposleni u poslovnim centrima, studenti, porodice i stranci na radu u Beogradu: u ponudi su garsonjere u blokovima, dvosobni i trosobni stanovi i potpuno opremljeni stanovi u novim kompleksima sa recepcijom i garažom.

Ko radi u poslovnoj zoni, može da stanuje na nekoliko minuta hoda od kancelarije i tako izbegne mostove, na kojima se gubi najviše vremena. Pitajte da li u kiriju ulaze troškovi održavanja zgrade i grejanje, jer u novim kompleksima oni čine primetan deo mesečnog izdatka. Proverite da li se uz stan dobija parking mesto. Stanovi na višim spratovima solitera imaju pogled, ali zavise od lifta. Blizina tramvaja i autobusa ka centru važna je onima bez automobila. Porodice gledaju udaljenost vrtića i škole unutar bloka. Slične stanove preko granice opštine nudi [izdavanje stanova u Zemunu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/zemun), mirniji kraj [izdavanje stanova na Bežanijskoj kosi](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/bezanijska-kosa), a kupovinu stranica [prodaja stanova na Novom Beogradu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/novi-beograd).', text_en = 'Flats to rent in New Belgrade are sought by people working in the business centres, students, families and foreigners working in Belgrade: on offer are studios in the blocks, two- and three-bedroom flats and fully equipped flats in new complexes with a reception and a garage.

Those who work in the business zone can live a few minutes'' walk from the office and so avoid the bridges, where most time is lost. Ask whether building maintenance and heating are included in the rent, because in the new complexes they make up a noticeable part of the monthly outlay. Check whether a parking space comes with the flat. Flats on the higher floors of tower blocks have a view but depend on the lift. Being near a tram and a bus to the centre matters to those without a car. Families look at how far the nursery and school are within the block. Similar flats across the municipal boundary come with [flats to rent in Zemun](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/zemun), a quieter area with [flats to rent in Bežanijska Kosa](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/bezanijska-kosa), and buying is on the page [flats for sale in New Belgrade](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/novi-beograd).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'rent' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id = (SELECT d.id FROM districts d JOIN cities ci ON ci.id = d.city_id WHERE d.latn = 'Novi Beograd' AND ci.latn = 'Beograd') AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja stanova na Bežanijskoj kosi, mirnijem delu Novog Beograda na uzvišenju iznad blokova: stanovi u manjim zgradama sa nekoliko spratova, stanovi u nizovima sa terasama i novija gradnja u ulicama sa porodičnim kućama.

Kraj biraju porodice, jer ima vrtiće, škole, dom zdravlja i veliku bolnicu, a saobraćaj je mirniji nego na bulevarima. Zgrade su niže, pa mnogi stanovi nemaju lift: proverite sprat ako imate malu decu ili starije ukućane. Autoput i aerodrom su blizu, što je dobro za one koji često putuju, ali poslušajte da li se u stanu čuju avioni i saobraćaj. Pitajte kako se zgrada greje i gde se parkira. Kod novih zgrada u uskim ulicama pogledajte prilaz i garažu. Zakup u istom kraju nudi stranica [izdavanje stanova na Bežanijskoj kosi](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/bezanijska-kosa), susedno naselje stranica [stanovi na Ledinama](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/ledine), a širu ponudu opštine stranica [stanovi na Novom Beogradu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/novi-beograd).', text_en = 'Flats for sale in Bežanijska Kosa, the quieter part of New Belgrade on the rise above the blocks: flats in smaller buildings of a few storeys, flats in terraces with balconies and newer construction in streets of family houses.

The area is chosen by families, because it has nurseries, schools, a health centre and a big hospital, and the traffic is calmer than on the boulevards. The buildings are lower, so many flats have no lift: check the floor if you have small children or elderly people in the household. The motorway and the airport are close, which is good for frequent travellers, but listen whether aircraft and traffic can be heard in the flat. Ask how the building is heated and where people park. With new buildings in narrow streets, look at the access and the garage. Rentals in the same area are on the page [flats to rent in Bežanijska Kosa](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/bezanijska-kosa), the neighbouring settlement on the page [flats in Ledine](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/ledine), and the wider offer of the municipality on the page [flats in New Belgrade](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/novi-beograd).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id = (SELECT d.id FROM districts d JOIN cities ci ON ci.id = d.city_id WHERE d.latn = 'Bežanijska kosa' AND ci.latn = 'Beograd') AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Izdavanje stanova na Bežanijskoj kosi: jednosobni i dvosobni stanovi u manjim zgradama, stanovi sa velikim terasama, spratovi u porodičnim kućama i noviji stanovi sa garažom. Kraj je zelen i tih, a opet blizu poslovnog dela Novog Beograda.

Zakupci su najčešće porodice i zaposleni u okolnim firmama i bolnici, pa su stanovi uglavnom namešteni za duži boravak. Pitajte da li je grejanje centralno ili na struju i koliko iznose računi u januaru. Do centra grada se ide autobusom, pa proverite koliko je stanica udaljena i koliko vožnja traje ujutru. Sprat u kući znači dvorište i mir, ali dogovorite korišćenje dvorišta i parkinga sa vlasnikom. Pogledajte i gde su najbliži market i pijaca. Stan obiđite predveče, kada se komšiluk vrati s posla. Više ponuda u ravnom delu opštine daje stranica [izdavanje stanova na Novom Beogradu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/novi-beograd), kupovinu stranica [stanovi na Bežanijskoj kosi](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/bezanijska-kosa), a ceo grad stranica [izdavanje stanova u Beogradu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd).', text_en = 'Flats to rent in Bežanijska Kosa: one- and two-bedroom flats in smaller buildings, flats with big balconies, floors of family houses and newer flats with a garage. The area is green and quiet, yet close to the business part of New Belgrade.

Tenants are mostly families and people working in the nearby companies and the hospital, so the flats are generally furnished for a longer stay. Ask whether the heating is central or electric and how much the bills come to in January. You get to the city centre by bus, so check how far the stop is and how long the ride takes in the morning. A floor in a house means a garden and peace, but agree the use of the garden and the parking with the owner. See where the nearest supermarket and market are too. Visit the flat in the early evening, when the neighbours are back from work. More offers in the flat part of the municipality are on the page [flats to rent in New Belgrade](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/novi-beograd), buying on the page [flats in Bežanijska Kosa](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/bezanijska-kosa), and the whole city on the page [flats to rent in Belgrade](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'rent' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id = (SELECT d.id FROM districts d JOIN cities ci ON ci.id = d.city_id WHERE d.latn = 'Bežanijska kosa' AND ci.latn = 'Beograd') AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja stanova na Ledinama, naselju na zapadnom obodu Novog Beograda: stanovi u novim manjim zgradama, dupleksi, stanovi u prizemlju sa baštom i spratovi u kućama. Ovde se dobija više kvadrata za isti novac nego u blokovima.

Naselje je nastajalo postepeno, od porodičnih kuća, pa se ulice razlikuju po širini, trotoarima i kanalizaciji: prođite ga peške pre nego što se odlučite. Kod novogradnje tražite građevinsku i upotrebnu dozvolu i proverite da li je stan uknjižen. Pitajte čime se zgrada greje, jer toplana ne pokriva ceo kraj, a toplotne pumpe i gas menjaju račune. Aerodrom je blizu, pa poslušajte koliko se čuju avioni. Proverite autobuske linije ka Novom Beogradu i centru i koliko im treba u špicu. Škola i vrtić u naselju olakšavaju život sa decom. Kraj sa više sadržaja nudi stranica [stanovi na Bežanijskoj kosi](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/bezanijska-kosa), celu opštinu stranica [stanovi na Novom Beogradu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/novi-beograd), a opšte savete stranica [prodaja stanova](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja).', text_en = 'Flats for sale in Ledine, the settlement on the western edge of New Belgrade: flats in small new buildings, duplexes, ground-floor flats with a garden and floors of houses. Here you get more square metres for the same money than in the blocks.

The settlement grew gradually out of family houses, so the streets differ in width, pavements and sewerage: walk through it before you decide. With a new development, ask for the building and occupancy permits and check that the flat is registered. Ask how the building is heated, because district heating does not cover the whole area, and heat pumps and gas change the bills. The airport is near, so listen to how loud the aircraft are. Check the bus lines to New Belgrade and the centre and how long they take at rush hour. A school and a nursery in the settlement make life with children easier. An area with more amenities is on the page [flats in Bežanijska Kosa](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/bezanijska-kosa), the whole municipality on the page [flats in New Belgrade](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/novi-beograd), and general advice on the page [flats for sale](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id = (SELECT d.id FROM districts d JOIN cities ci ON ci.id = d.city_id WHERE d.latn = 'Ledine' AND ci.latn = 'Beograd') AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja stanova u Zemunu: stanovi u starom jezgru nadomak keja i Gardoša, stanovi u zgradama Gornjeg grada, soliteri i blokovi prema Novom Beogradu i nova naselja na obodu opštine. Zemun ima sopstveni centar, pijacu i šetalište uz Dunav, pa mnogi stanovnici retko prelaze u ostatak grada.

Staro jezgro je pod zaštitom, sa niskim kućama i uskim ulicama: stanovi su posebni, ali proverite vlagu, instalacije i šta se sme prepravljati. U Gornjem gradu i na Novoj Galenici zgrade su novije, sa više parkinga. Pitajte da li zgrada ima toplanu i lift i kako se održava. Cena zavisi od udaljenosti od keja i od linija prevoza ka centru. Na obodu opštine proverite dozvole novih zgrada. Kuće nudi stranica [kuće u Zemunu](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/beograd/zemun), novija naselja stranice [stanovi na Altini](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/altina) i [u Batajnici](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/batajnica), zakup stranica [izdavanje stanova u Zemunu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/zemun), a susedni kraj stranica [stanovi na Novom Beogradu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/novi-beograd).', text_en = 'Flats for sale in Zemun: flats in the old core close to the quay and Gardoš, flats in the buildings of Gornji Grad, tower blocks and estates towards New Belgrade and new settlements on the edge of the municipality. Zemun has its own centre, market and promenade along the Danube, so many residents rarely cross into the rest of the city.

The old core is protected, with low houses and narrow streets: the flats are special, but check for damp, the installations and what may be altered. In Gornji Grad and Nova Galenika the buildings are newer, with more parking. Ask whether the building has district heating and a lift and how it is maintained. The price depends on the distance from the quay and from the transport lines to the centre. On the edge of the municipality, check the permits of new buildings. Houses are on the page [houses in Zemun](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/beograd/zemun), newer settlements on the pages [flats in Altina](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/altina) and [in Batajnica](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/batajnica), rentals on the page [flats to rent in Zemun](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/zemun), and the neighbouring area on the page [flats in New Belgrade](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/novi-beograd).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id = (SELECT d.id FROM districts d JOIN cities ci ON ci.id = d.city_id WHERE d.latn = 'Zemun' AND ci.latn = 'Beograd') AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Izdavanje stanova u Zemunu: garsonjere i jednosobni stanovi u centru, stanovi u Gornjem gradu, porodični stanovi u blokovima prema Novom Beogradu i povoljniji stanovi u naseljima dalje od Dunava. Kej, pijaca i kafane uz reku daju ovom kraju atmosferu malog grada.

Zakupci su studenti poljoprivrednog i drugih fakulteta, zaposleni u zemunskim firmama i porodice koje žele mirniji kraj uz dobru vezu sa Novim Beogradom. U starim kućama u jezgru pitajte za grejanje i vlagu, jer debeli zidovi i prizemlja umeju da budu hladni. Proverite koje linije voze do vašeg posla ili fakulteta i koliko traje vožnja u špicu. Parkiranje u centru Zemuna je zonirano, pa pitajte za dvorište ili garažu. Dogovorite ko plaća održavanje zgrade. Kraće boravke nudi stranica [stan na dan u Zemunu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/na-dan/beograd/zemun), ponudu preko puta stranica [izdavanje stanova na Novom Beogradu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/novi-beograd), obod opštine stranica [izdavanje stanova u Batajnici](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/batajnica), a kupovinu stranica [stanovi u Zemunu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/zemun).', text_en = 'Flats to rent in Zemun: studios and one-bedroom flats in the centre, flats in Gornji Grad, family flats in the estates towards New Belgrade and cheaper flats in the settlements further from the Danube. The quay, the market and the riverside taverns give this area the feel of a small town.

Tenants are students of the agriculture faculty and others, people working in Zemun''s companies and families who want a quieter area with a good link to New Belgrade. In old houses in the core, ask about heating and damp, because thick walls and ground floors can be cold. Check which lines run to your work or faculty and how long the ride takes at rush hour. Parking in the centre of Zemun is zoned, so ask about a courtyard or a garage. Agree who pays for the upkeep of the building. Shorter stays are on the page [flats by the day in Zemun](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/na-dan/beograd/zemun), the offer across the way on the page [flats to rent in New Belgrade](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/novi-beograd), the edge of the municipality on the page [flats to rent in Batajnica](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/batajnica), and buying on the page [flats in Zemun](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/zemun).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'rent' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id = (SELECT d.id FROM districts d JOIN cities ci ON ci.id = d.city_id WHERE d.latn = 'Zemun' AND ci.latn = 'Beograd') AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja kuća u Zemunu: stare gradske kuće u jezgru i na Gardošu, porodične kuće u Gornjem gradu, novije kuće na Altini, u Zemun polju i Batajnici i kuće sa velikim placevima prema Ugrinovcima. Malo koji deo Beograda nudi ovakav raspon, od spomenika kulture do novogradnje.

Kuća u starom jezgru je pod režimom zaštite: fasada, visina i krov ne mogu se menjati po želji, pa pre kupovine pitajte šta zavod za zaštitu dozvoljava. Proverite vlagu u zidovima, podrum i stanje krovne konstrukcije. Lagumi ispod starog Zemuna poznati su po sleganju tla, zato pogledajte ima li pukotina. U novijim naseljima proverite kanalizaciju, asfalt i da li je kuća legalizovana sa svim dogradnjama. Plac u širem centru često vredi više od objekta. Pitajte za gas i parking u dvorištu. Stanove nudi stranica [stanovi u Zemunu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/zemun), obod opštine stranica [kuće u Batajnici](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/beograd/batajnica), parcele stranica [placevi u Batajnici](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/beograd/batajnica), a ceo grad stranica [prodaja kuća u Beogradu](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/beograd).', text_en = 'Houses for sale in Zemun: old town houses in the core and on Gardoš, family houses in Gornji Grad, newer houses in Altina, Zemun Polje and Batajnica and houses with big plots towards Ugrinovci. Few parts of Belgrade offer such a range, from listed buildings to new construction.

A house in the old core is under a protection regime: the facade, the height and the roof cannot be changed at will, so before buying ask what the heritage institute allows. Check for damp in the walls, the cellar and the state of the roof structure. The underground passages beneath old Zemun are known for ground subsidence, so look for cracks. In the newer settlements, check the sewerage, the tarmac and whether the house is legalised with all its extensions. A plot near the centre is often worth more than the building. Ask about gas and parking in the yard. Flats are on the page [flats in Zemun](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/zemun), the edge of the municipality on the page [houses in Batajnica](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/beograd/batajnica), parcels on the page [plots in Batajnica](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja/beograd/batajnica), and the whole city on the page [houses for sale in Belgrade](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/beograd).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'houses') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id = (SELECT d.id FROM districts d JOIN cities ci ON ci.id = d.city_id WHERE d.latn = 'Zemun' AND ci.latn = 'Beograd') AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja stanova na Altini, naselju u Zemunu koje se poslednjih godina ubrzano gradi: stanovi u novim zgradama sa nekoliko spratova, dupleksi u potkrovlju, stanovi sa dvorištem u prizemlju i stanovi u kućama sa više jedinica. Kupci su uglavnom mlade porodice koje traže nov stan po nižoj ceni.

Pošto je naselje raslo brže od infrastrukture, papiri su ovde na prvom mestu: tražite građevinsku i upotrebnu dozvolu i proverite da li je stan uknjižen kao posebna jedinica. Pitajte da li je zgrada priključena na kanalizaciju i gas ili se oslanja na septičku jamu i struju. Pogledajte ulicu posle kiše i proverite gde se parkira. Vrtići i škole su opterećeni, pa se raspitajte o mestima. Autobus do Zemuna i Novog Beograda vozi redovno, ali u špicu sporo. Uporedite više zgrada istog investitora. Stariji deo opštine nudi stranica [stanovi u Zemunu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/zemun), zakup stranica [izdavanje stanova na Altini](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/altina), a naselje dalje ka severu stranica [stanovi u Batajnici](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/batajnica).', text_en = 'Flats for sale in Altina, the settlement in Zemun that has been built up rapidly in recent years: flats in new buildings of a few storeys, attic duplexes, ground-floor flats with a garden and flats in houses with several units. The buyers are mostly young families looking for a new flat at a lower price.

As the settlement grew faster than its infrastructure, the papers come first here: ask for the building and occupancy permits and check that the flat is registered as a separate unit. Ask whether the building is connected to sewerage and gas or relies on a septic tank and electricity. Look at the street after rain and check where people park. Nurseries and schools are under pressure, so ask about places. The bus to Zemun and New Belgrade runs regularly but slowly at rush hour. Compare several buildings by the same developer. The older part of the municipality is on the page [flats in Zemun](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/zemun), rentals on the page [flats to rent in Altina](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/altina), and the settlement further north on the page [flats in Batajnica](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/batajnica).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id = (SELECT d.id FROM districts d JOIN cities ci ON ci.id = d.city_id WHERE d.latn = 'Altina' AND ci.latn = 'Beograd') AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja stanova u Batajnici, velikom naselju na severozapadnom kraju Zemuna: stanovi u novim manjim zgradama, stanovi u starijim zgradama u centru naselja i spratovi u porodičnim kućama. Cene su među nižima u gradu, pa je ovo čest izbor za prvi stan.

Najveća prednost naselja je gradska železnica, kojom se do centra stiže bez gužve: proverite koliko je stan udaljen od stanice, jer to znatno utiče na svakodnevicu i na vrednost. U blizini je vojni aerodrom, pa poslušajte buku tokom dana. Kod novogradnje proverite dozvole, uknjiženost i priključak na kanalizaciju, koja ne pokriva sve ulice. Pitajte za grejanje, jer daljinskog nema i najčešće se greje na struju ili gas. Naselje ima škole, pijacu i dom zdravlja. Kuće sa dvorištem nudi stranica [kuće u Batajnici](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/beograd/batajnica), zakup stranica [izdavanje stanova u Batajnici](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/batajnica), bliži kraj stranica [stanovi na Altini](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/altina), a opštinu stranica [stanovi u Zemunu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/zemun).', text_en = 'Flats for sale in Batajnica, the large settlement at the north-western end of Zemun: flats in small new buildings, flats in older buildings in the centre of the settlement and floors of family houses. Prices are among the lowest in the city, so this is a frequent choice for a first flat.

The settlement''s biggest advantage is the urban railway, which gets you to the centre without traffic jams: check how far the flat is from the station, because that affects everyday life and the value considerably. A military airfield is nearby, so listen to the noise during the day. With a new development, check the permits, the registration and the connection to the sewer, which does not cover every street. Ask about heating, because there is no district heating and it is mostly electric or gas. The settlement has schools, a market and a health centre. Houses with a garden are on the page [houses in Batajnica](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/beograd/batajnica), rentals on the page [flats to rent in Batajnica](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/batajnica), a closer area on the page [flats in Altina](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/altina), and the municipality on the page [flats in Zemun](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/zemun).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id = (SELECT d.id FROM districts d JOIN cities ci ON ci.id = d.city_id WHERE d.latn = 'Batajnica' AND ci.latn = 'Beograd') AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Izdavanje stanova u Batajnici: jednosobni i dvosobni stanovi u novijim zgradama, stanovi u kućama sa odvojenim ulazom i garsonjere blizu železničke stanice. Kirije su niže nego u ostatku Zemuna, što privlači mlade parove i radnike iz obližnjih industrijskih zona.

Presudno je kako stižete na posao. Voz do Novog Beograda i centra vozi po redu vožnje i ne zavisi od gužvi, pa pogledajte polaske i udaljenost stanice. Ko radi u magacinima i fabrikama duž autoputa, obično ima organizovan prevoz ili ide automobilom. Kod stana u kući dogovorite parking, korišćenje dvorišta i odvojena brojila. Pitajte čime se greje i da li je stan topao, jer su mnoge kuće bez dobre izolacije. Proverite i brzinu interneta u toj ulici. Stan pogledajte preko dana, zbog aviona sa obližnjeg aerodroma. Više ponuda bliže gradu daje stranica [izdavanje stanova u Zemunu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/zemun), kupovinu stranica [stanovi u Batajnici](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/batajnica), a poslove u pogonima stranica [posao u proizvodnji u Beogradu](/oglasi/posao/proizvodnja-i-magacin/beograd).', text_en = 'Flats to rent in Batajnica: one- and two-bedroom flats in newer buildings, flats in houses with a separate entrance and studios near the railway station. Rents are lower than in the rest of Zemun, which attracts young couples and workers from the nearby industrial zones.

How you get to work is decisive. The train to New Belgrade and the centre runs to a timetable and does not depend on traffic, so look at the departures and the distance to the station. Those who work in the warehouses and factories along the motorway usually have organised transport or go by car. With a flat in a house, agree the parking, the use of the garden and separate meters. Ask how it is heated and whether the flat is warm, because many houses lack good insulation. Check the internet speed in that street too. View the flat during the day, because of the aircraft from the nearby airfield. More offers closer to the city are on the page [flats to rent in Zemun](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/zemun), buying on the page [flats in Batajnica](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/batajnica), and plant jobs on the page [production jobs in Belgrade](/oglasi/posao/proizvodnja-i-magacin/beograd).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'rent' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id = (SELECT d.id FROM districts d JOIN cities ci ON ci.id = d.city_id WHERE d.latn = 'Batajnica' AND ci.latn = 'Beograd') AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja stanova na Starom gradu, u samom središtu Beograda: salonski stanovi sa visokim plafonima, stanovi u zgradama između dva rata, manji stanovi pogodni za izdavanje turistima i retka novogradnja u bočnim ulicama. Knez Mihailova, Trg republike i Kalemegdan su na nekoliko minuta hoda.

Ovde se kupuje adresa, a zgrade su stare, pa je pregled važniji nego igde. Pitajte kada su menjane vertikale i elektroinstalacije, u kakvom je stanju krov i da li je lift obnovljen. Mnoge zgrade su pod zaštitom, što ograničava zamenu stolarije i radove na fasadi. Visoki plafoni znače i veće račune za grejanje. Parking je zoniran i garaža je retkost, pa je garažno mesto posebna vrednost. Ako planirate izdavanje na dan, proverite kućni red i stav stanara. Buku noćnog života poslušajte petkom uveče. Deo opštine uz Dunav izdvaja stranica [stanovi na Dorćolu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/dorcol), susedni kraj stranica [stanovi na Vračaru](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/vracar), zakup stranica [izdavanje stanova na Starom gradu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/stari-grad), a ceo grad stranica [prodaja stanova u Beogradu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd).', text_en = 'Flats for sale in Stari Grad, in the very heart of Belgrade: grand flats with high ceilings, flats in inter-war buildings, smaller flats suitable for letting to tourists and rare new developments in the side streets. Knez Mihailova Street, Republic Square and Kalemegdan are a few minutes'' walk away.

Here you buy the address, and the buildings are old, so an inspection matters more than anywhere. Ask when the risers and the wiring were replaced, what state the roof is in and whether the lift has been renewed. Many buildings are protected, which limits the replacement of joinery and work on the facade. High ceilings mean higher heating bills too. Parking is zoned and a garage is a rarity, so a garage space is a value in itself. If you plan to let by the day, check the house rules and the attitude of the residents. Listen to the noise of the nightlife on a Friday evening. The part of the municipality by the Danube is on the page [flats in Dorćol](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/dorcol), the neighbouring area on the page [flats in Vračar](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/vracar), rentals on the page [flats to rent in Stari Grad](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/stari-grad), and the whole city on the page [flats for sale in Belgrade](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id = (SELECT d.id FROM districts d JOIN cities ci ON ci.id = d.city_id WHERE d.latn = 'Stari grad' AND ci.latn = 'Beograd') AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja stanova na Dorćolu, jednom od najstarijih beogradskih krajeva, između centra i Dunava: stanovi u predratnim zgradama gornjeg Dorćola, stanovi u posleratnim zgradama i mnogo novogradnje u donjem delu, prema reci i sportskom centru.

Gornji Dorćol je uz samu pešačku zonu i Kalemegdan, sa starim zgradama i gustim saobraćajem. Donji Dorćol je ravniji, mirniji i bliži keju, a nekadašnja industrijska zona pretvara se u stambene komplekse: tu proverite ko je investitor i kada se završavaju okolni radovi. U starim zgradama pitajte za krov, instalacije i lift, a u prizemljima i suterenima za vlagu. Kafići u pojedinim ulicama rade do kasno, pa orijentacija prema dvorištu vredi više. Parkiranje je zonirano. Biciklistička staza uz Dunav i blizina tvrđave velika su pogodnost. Ostatak opštine nudi stranica [stanovi na Starom gradu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/stari-grad), zakup stranica [izdavanje stanova na Dorćolu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/dorcol), a kraj niz reku stranica [stanovi na Karaburmi](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/karaburma).', text_en = 'Flats for sale in Dorćol, one of Belgrade''s oldest quarters, between the centre and the Danube: flats in pre-war buildings in upper Dorćol, flats in post-war buildings and a lot of new development in the lower part, towards the river and the sports centre.

Upper Dorćol is right by the pedestrian zone and Kalemegdan, with old buildings and dense traffic. Lower Dorćol is flatter, quieter and closer to the quay, and the former industrial zone is turning into residential complexes: there, check who the developer is and when the surrounding works finish. In old buildings, ask about the roof, the installations and the lift, and on ground floors and in basements about damp. Cafés in some streets stay open late, so facing the courtyard is worth more. Parking is zoned. The cycle path along the Danube and the closeness of the fortress are a great asset. The rest of the municipality is on the page [flats in Stari Grad](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/stari-grad), rentals on the page [flats to rent in Dorćol](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/dorcol), and the area downstream on the page [flats in Karaburma](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/karaburma).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id = (SELECT d.id FROM districts d JOIN cities ci ON ci.id = d.city_id WHERE d.latn = 'Dorćol' AND ci.latn = 'Beograd') AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja stanova na Vračaru, najmanjoj i jednoj od najskupljih beogradskih opština: stanovi u predratnim vilama i zgradama, stanovi iz druge polovine prošlog veka i luksuzna novogradnja u tihim ulicama oko Hrama Svetog Save, Kalenić pijace i Neimara.

Kraj se ceni zbog toga što je sve na dohvat ruke, uz mirne ulice sa drvoredima. Cena po kvadratu je visoka, pa se pažljivo gleda svaka stavka: sprat, lift, orijentacija, terasa i parking. Nove zgrade niču na mestu starih kuća, zato proverite šta se gradi u susedstvu i hoće li vam zakloniti svetlo. U starijim zgradama pitajte za instalacije i krov. Garažno mesto se često prodaje posebno i značajno diže ukupnu cenu. Mali stanovi se lako izdaju, a veliki porodični retko dolaze na tržište. Zakup nudi stranica [izdavanje stanova na Vračaru](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/vracar), susedne krajeve stranice [stanovi na Voždovcu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/vozdovac) i [na Zvezdari](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/zvezdara), a centar stranica [stanovi na Starom gradu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/stari-grad).', text_en = 'Flats for sale in Vračar, the smallest and one of the most expensive municipalities of Belgrade: flats in pre-war villas and buildings, flats from the second half of the last century and luxury new developments in the quiet streets around the Church of Saint Sava, Kalenić market and Neimar.

The area is valued because everything is within reach, along quiet tree-lined streets. The price per square metre is high, so every item is looked at carefully: the floor, the lift, the orientation, the balcony and the parking. New buildings rise in place of old houses, so check what is being built next door and whether it will block your light. In older buildings, ask about the installations and the roof. A garage space is often sold separately and raises the total price considerably. Small flats let easily, and big family ones rarely come onto the market. Rentals are on the page [flats to rent in Vračar](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/vracar), neighbouring areas on the pages [flats in Voždovac](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/vozdovac) and [in Zvezdara](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/zvezdara), and the centre on the page [flats in Stari Grad](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/stari-grad).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id = (SELECT d.id FROM districts d JOIN cities ci ON ci.id = d.city_id WHERE d.latn = 'Vračar' AND ci.latn = 'Beograd') AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Izdavanje stanova na Vračaru: garsonjere i jednosobni stanovi u starijim zgradama, renovirani stanovi sa visokim plafonima, luksuzni stanovi u novim zgradama i stanovi u vilama sa baštom. Kirije su među najvišima u gradu, ali se za njih dobija život bez automobila.

Sve je blizu: centar, pijaca, park, biblioteka, restorani i nekoliko linija prevoza. Zakupci su mladi stručnjaci, stranci i studenti iz imućnijih porodica, pa se dobri stanovi izdaju brzo. Pitajte da li je stan na toplani ili na struju, jer u starim zgradama sa visokim plafonima grejanje ume da iznenadi. Proverite da li zgrada ima lift i kako se zagreva voda. Parkiranje je u zoni sa ograničenim vremenom, pa bez garaže automobil postaje teret. Ulice oko Slavije i glavnih bulevara su bučne, dok su one ka Neimaru tihe. Kupovinu nudi stranica [stanovi na Vračaru](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/vracar), povoljniji susedni kraj stranice [izdavanje stanova na Voždovcu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/vozdovac) i [na Zvezdari](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/zvezdara), a centar stranica [izdavanje stanova na Savskom vencu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/savski-venac).', text_en = 'Flats to rent in Vračar: studios and one-bedroom flats in older buildings, renovated flats with high ceilings, luxury flats in new buildings and flats in villas with a garden. Rents are among the highest in the city, but what you get for them is a life without a car.

Everything is close: the centre, the market, the park, the library, restaurants and several transport lines. Tenants are young professionals, foreigners and students from better-off families, so good flats are let quickly. Ask whether the flat is on district heating or electric, because in old buildings with high ceilings the heating can be a surprise. Check whether the building has a lift and how the water is heated. Parking is in a time-limited zone, so without a garage a car becomes a burden. The streets around Slavija and the main boulevards are noisy, while those towards Neimar are quiet. Buying is on the page [flats in Vračar](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/vracar), cheaper neighbouring areas on the pages [flats to rent in Voždovac](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/vozdovac) and [in Zvezdara](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/zvezdara), and the centre on the page [flats to rent in Savski Venac](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/savski-venac).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'rent' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id = (SELECT d.id FROM districts d JOIN cities ci ON ci.id = d.city_id WHERE d.latn = 'Vračar' AND ci.latn = 'Beograd') AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja stanova na Zvezdari: stanovi duž Bulevara kralja Aleksandra, stanovi u mirnim ulicama oko Zvezdarske šume, zgrade kod Đerma i Cvetkove pijace i novogradnja na mestu starih kuća. Opština se pruža od šireg centra do oboda grada, pa su razlike u ceni velike.

Deo uz bulevar ima tramvaj, pijace i blizinu tehničkih fakulteta, pa se manji stanovi lako izdaju studentima. Ulice uz šumu su tiše i zelenije, ali strmije i sa manje prevoza. Nove zgrade su često u uskim ulicama: proverite garažu, prilaz i koliko ih se još gradi u komšiluku. U starijim zgradama pitajte za lift, krov i grejanje. Na padinama pogledajte prizemlja i suterene zbog vlage. Bolnica i dom zdravlja su u opštini, što starijim kupcima znači mnogo. Veliko naselje u istoj opštini izdvaja stranica [stanovi u Mirijevu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/mirijevo), kraj uz autoput stranica [stanovi na Konjarniku](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/konjarnik), zakup stranica [izdavanje stanova na Zvezdari](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/zvezdara), a skuplji sused stranica [stanovi na Vračaru](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/vracar).', text_en = 'Flats for sale in Zvezdara: flats along Bulevar Kralja Aleksandra, flats in the quiet streets around Zvezdara Forest, buildings near Đeram and Cvetko''s market and new developments in place of old houses. The municipality stretches from near the centre to the edge of the city, so the differences in price are large.

The part along the boulevard has the tram, the markets and the technical faculties nearby, so smaller flats let easily to students. The streets by the forest are quieter and greener, but steeper and with less public transport. New buildings are often in narrow streets: check the garage, the access and how many more are being built in the neighbourhood. In older buildings, ask about the lift, the roof and the heating. On the slopes, look at ground floors and basements for damp. A hospital and a health centre are in the municipality, which means a lot to older buyers. The big settlement in the same municipality is on the page [flats in Mirijevo](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/mirijevo), the area by the motorway on the page [flats in Konjarnik](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/konjarnik), rentals on the page [flats to rent in Zvezdara](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/zvezdara), and the dearer neighbour on the page [flats in Vračar](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/vracar).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id = (SELECT d.id FROM districts d JOIN cities ci ON ci.id = d.city_id WHERE d.latn = 'Zvezdara' AND ci.latn = 'Beograd') AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Izdavanje stanova na Zvezdari: garsonjere i jednosobni stanovi blizu Bulevara kralja Aleksandra, dvosobni stanovi u novijim zgradama, stanovi u kućama u bočnim ulicama i veći stanovi za porodice. Tramvaj niz bulevar za kratko vreme vodi do Vukovog spomenika i centra.

Studenti elektrotehnike, građevine, mašinstva i drugih fakulteta u blizini čine veliki deo zakupaca, pa se stanovi uz bulevar traže već početkom leta. Stanovi dalje od tramvaja su jeftiniji, ali proverite autobuske linije i koliko je uspon do stana. Pitajte da li je grejanje daljinsko ili na struju. U novim zgradama dogovorite da li garažno mesto ulazi u cenu. Kraj oko pijaca je živ danju, a uveče miran. Zvezdarska šuma je lepa pogodnost za šetnju i trčanje. Povoljniji stanovi dalje od centra su na stranici [izdavanje stanova u Mirijevu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/mirijevo), stanovi uz autoput na stranici [izdavanje stanova na Konjarniku](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/konjarnik), a kupovina na stranici [stanovi na Zvezdari](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/zvezdara).', text_en = 'Flats to rent in Zvezdara: studios and one-bedroom flats near Bulevar Kralja Aleksandra, two-bedroom flats in newer buildings, flats in houses in the side streets and bigger flats for families. The tram down the boulevard gets you to Vukov Spomenik and the centre in a short time.

Students of electrical, civil and mechanical engineering and other faculties nearby make up a large share of the tenants, so flats along the boulevard are in demand from the start of summer. Flats further from the tram are cheaper, but check the bus lines and how much of a climb it is to the flat. Ask whether the heating is district or electric. In new buildings, agree whether a garage space is included in the price. The area around the markets is lively by day and calm in the evening. Zvezdara Forest is a fine asset for walking and running. Cheaper flats further from the centre are on the page [flats to rent in Mirijevo](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/mirijevo), flats by the motorway on the page [flats to rent in Konjarnik](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/konjarnik), and buying on the page [flats in Zvezdara](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/zvezdara).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'rent' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id = (SELECT d.id FROM districts d JOIN cities ci ON ci.id = d.city_id WHERE d.latn = 'Zvezdara' AND ci.latn = 'Beograd') AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja stanova u Mirijevu, velikom naselju na brdima Zvezdare: stanovi u zgradama iz osamdesetih i devedesetih, mnogo novogradnje u novijim delovima naselja i stanovi u kućama starog Mirijeva. Traže ga porodice zbog nižih cena, škola, vrtića i parkova.

Naselje je na padinama, pa pogled i osunčanost zavise od položaja zgrade, ali isto važi i za uspon od stanice do ulaza. Glavna veza sa gradom je jedan bulevar, na kome se ujutru stvaraju kolone: probajte put do posla u vreme kada biste zaista išli. Kod novih zgrada tražite upotrebnu dozvolu i proverite garažu. Na strmim parcelama pitajte kako su rešeni temelji i odvodnjavanje. Starije zgrade imaju daljinsko grejanje, nove često toplotne pumpe ili gas. Unutar naselja ima marketa, pijaca i dom zdravlja. Zakup nudi stranica [izdavanje stanova u Mirijevu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/mirijevo), ostatak opštine stranica [stanovi na Zvezdari](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/zvezdara), kraj ka Dunavu stranica [stanovi na Karaburmi](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/karaburma), a prigradsko naselje stranica [stanovi u Malom Mokrom Lugu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/mali-mokri-lug).', text_en = 'Flats for sale in Mirijevo, the large settlement on the hills of Zvezdara: flats in buildings from the eighties and nineties, a lot of new development in the newer parts of the settlement and flats in the houses of old Mirijevo. Families seek it out for the lower prices, schools, nurseries and parks.

The settlement is on slopes, so the view and the sunlight depend on the position of the building, but so does the climb from the stop to the entrance. The main link with the city is a single boulevard, where queues form in the morning: try the trip to work at the time you would really be going. With new buildings, ask for the occupancy permit and check the garage. On steep parcels, ask how the foundations and drainage were dealt with. Older buildings have district heating; new ones often have heat pumps or gas. Within the settlement there are supermarkets, a market and a health centre. Rentals are on the page [flats to rent in Mirijevo](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/mirijevo), the rest of the municipality on the page [flats in Zvezdara](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/zvezdara), the area towards the Danube on the page [flats in Karaburma](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/karaburma), and a suburban settlement on the page [flats in Mali Mokri Lug](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/mali-mokri-lug).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id = (SELECT d.id FROM districts d JOIN cities ci ON ci.id = d.city_id WHERE d.latn = 'Mirijevo' AND ci.latn = 'Beograd') AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Izdavanje stanova u Mirijevu: garsonjere i jednosobni stanovi u novim zgradama, dvosobni stanovi u starijim blokovima, stanovi u kućama i veći stanovi za porodice sa decom. Za istu kiriju ovde se dobija veći i noviji stan nego bliže centru.

To se plaća vremenom u prevozu, pa pre potpisivanja ugovora proverite autobuske linije do svog posla ili fakulteta i koliko traju u jutarnjem špicu. Stanovi blizu glavnog bulevara imaju bolju vezu, dok su oni u gornjim delovima naselja mirniji i sa lepšim pogledom. Pitajte da li zgrada ima lift, kako se greje i da li je parking mesto uključeno. Porodicama su važni vrtić i škola u susedstvu, a ima ih više. Novi stanovi su često potpuno opremljeni, ali proverite da li uređaji imaju garanciju i ko plaća popravke. Kupovinu u istom naselju nudi stranica [stanovi u Mirijevu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/mirijevo), stanove bliže centru stranica [izdavanje stanova na Zvezdari](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/zvezdara), a susedni kraj stranica [izdavanje stanova na Karaburmi](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/karaburma).', text_en = 'Flats to rent in Mirijevo: studios and one-bedroom flats in new buildings, two-bedroom flats in older blocks, flats in houses and bigger flats for families with children. For the same rent you get a bigger and newer flat here than closer to the centre.

You pay for that with time on public transport, so before signing a contract check the bus lines to your work or faculty and how long they take in the morning rush. Flats near the main boulevard are better connected, while those in the upper parts of the settlement are quieter and have a nicer view. Ask whether the building has a lift, how it is heated and whether a parking space is included. For families, a nursery and a school in the neighbourhood matter, and there are several. New flats are often fully equipped, but check whether the appliances are under warranty and who pays for repairs. Buying in the same settlement is on the page [flats in Mirijevo](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/mirijevo), flats closer to the centre on the page [flats to rent in Zvezdara](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/zvezdara), and the neighbouring area on the page [flats to rent in Karaburma](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/karaburma).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'rent' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id = (SELECT d.id FROM districts d JOIN cities ci ON ci.id = d.city_id WHERE d.latn = 'Mirijevo' AND ci.latn = 'Beograd') AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja stanova na Konjarniku, naselju uz autoput na granici Zvezdare i Voždovca: stanovi u dugim lamelama i soliterima iz šezdesetih i sedamdesetih, stanovi u nižim zgradama u unutrašnjosti naselja i novija gradnja uz Ustaničku ulicu.

Položaj je glavni adut: tramvaj i autobusi vode pravo u centar, a izlaz na autoput je odmah tu. Zbog toga je važno na koju stranu stan gleda, jer se uz autoput i glavne ulice čuje saobraćaj: otvorite prozor pre nego što bilo šta odlučite. Zgrade su starije, pa pitajte da li je rađena fasada, u kakvom su stanju liftovi i kada su menjane cevi. Stanovi imaju daljinsko grejanje i pregledne rasporede. Parking je oko solitera tesan. U naselju su pijaca, sportski centar i škole. Zakup nudi stranica [izdavanje stanova na Konjarniku](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/konjarnik), kraj preko autoputa stranica [stanovi na Medakoviću](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/medakovic), a okolne opštine stranice [stanovi na Zvezdari](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/zvezdara) i [na Voždovcu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/vozdovac).', text_en = 'Flats for sale in Konjarnik, the settlement by the motorway on the boundary of Zvezdara and Voždovac: flats in long slab blocks and towers from the sixties and seventies, flats in lower buildings inside the settlement and newer construction along Ustanička Street.

Location is the main trump card: trams and buses go straight to the centre, and the motorway slip road is right there. That is why it matters which way the flat faces, because traffic can be heard along the motorway and the main streets: open the window before you decide anything. The buildings are older, so ask whether the facade has been redone, what state the lifts are in and when the pipes were replaced. The flats have district heating and clear layouts. Parking around the towers is tight. The settlement has a market, a sports centre and schools. Rentals are on the page [flats to rent in Konjarnik](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/konjarnik), the area across the motorway on the page [flats in Medaković](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/medakovic), and the surrounding municipalities on the pages [flats in Zvezdara](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/zvezdara) and [in Voždovac](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/vozdovac).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id = (SELECT d.id FROM districts d JOIN cities ci ON ci.id = d.city_id WHERE d.latn = 'Konjarnik' AND ci.latn = 'Beograd') AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja stanova na Karaburmi, naselju u opštini Palilula između Zvezdare i Dunava: stanovi u radničkim zgradama iz pedesetih i šezdesetih, soliteri uz glavne ulice i mnogo novogradnje u ulicama sa kućama. Blizina centra uz umerene cene čini kraj traženim kod mladih kupaca.

Stare zgrade imaju manje stanove sa niskim troškovima, ali često nemaju lift, pa proverite sprat. Deo naselja je na padini ka Dunavu, gde je tlo mestimično nestabilno: kod novih zgrada pitajte za geomehanički elaborat i pogledajte ima li pukotina na susednim kućama. Novogradnja je gusta, pa proverite parking i razmak do susedne zgrade. Gradski prevoz je dobar, a do centra se stiže brzo. Pijaca, škole i dom zdravlja su u naselju. Stanovi sa pogledom na reku vrede više, ali proverite šta se planira ispred njih. Zakup nudi stranica [izdavanje stanova na Karaburmi](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/karaburma), opštinu stranica [stanovi na Paliluli](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/palilula), susedno brdo stranica [stanovi u Mirijevu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/mirijevo), a centar stranica [stanovi na Dorćolu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/dorcol).', text_en = 'Flats for sale in Karaburma, the settlement in the municipality of Palilula between Zvezdara and the Danube: flats in workers'' buildings from the fifties and sixties, tower blocks along the main streets and a lot of new development in streets of houses. Closeness to the centre at moderate prices makes the area popular with young buyers.

The old buildings have smaller flats with low costs, but often no lift, so check the floor. Part of the settlement is on the slope towards the Danube, where the ground is unstable in places: with new buildings, ask for the geotechnical report and see whether there are cracks in the neighbouring houses. New development is dense, so check the parking and the distance to the next building. Public transport is good and the centre is reached quickly. A market, schools and a health centre are in the settlement. Flats with a river view are worth more, but check what is planned in front of them. Rentals are on the page [flats to rent in Karaburma](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/karaburma), the municipality on the page [flats in Palilula](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/palilula), the neighbouring hill on the page [flats in Mirijevo](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/mirijevo), and the centre on the page [flats in Dorćol](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/dorcol).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id = (SELECT d.id FROM districts d JOIN cities ci ON ci.id = d.city_id WHERE d.latn = 'Karaburma' AND ci.latn = 'Beograd') AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Izdavanje stanova na Karaburmi: garsonjere i manji stanovi u starijim zgradama, novi jednosobni i dvosobni stanovi u ulicama sa kućama, stanovi u soliterima i spratovi u kućama. Kirije su niže nego u centru, a do njega ima svega nekoliko stanica.

Studenti i mladi zaposleni biraju ovaj kraj jer nudi razuman odnos cene i udaljenosti. U starim zgradama pitajte za sprat i lift, stanje kupatila i čime se zagreva voda. Novi stanovi su bolje izolovani, ali proverite parking, koga u gusto izgrađenim ulicama nema dovoljno. Raspitajte se koje linije voze noću, ako radite u smenama. Dunavski kej i sportski tereni blizu su za šetnju i rekreaciju. Dogovorite da li računi glase na vas ili na vlasnika i kako se plaćaju. Stan pogledajte i kad pada kiša, zbog prilaza i oluka. Kupovinu nudi stranica [stanovi na Karaburmi](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/karaburma), ostatak opštine stranica [izdavanje stanova na Paliluli](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/palilula), a naselje na brdu stranica [izdavanje stanova u Mirijevu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/mirijevo).', text_en = 'Flats to rent in Karaburma: studios and smaller flats in older buildings, new one- and two-bedroom flats in streets of houses, flats in tower blocks and floors of houses. Rents are lower than in the centre, which is only a few stops away.

Students and young professionals choose this area because it offers a sensible balance of price and distance. In old buildings, ask about the floor and the lift, the state of the bathroom and how the water is heated. New flats are better insulated, but check the parking, of which there is not enough in the densely built streets. Find out which lines run at night if you work shifts. The Danube quay and the sports grounds are close by for walking and recreation. Agree whether the bills are in your name or the owner''s and how they are paid. View the flat when it is raining too, because of the approach and the gutters. Buying is on the page [flats in Karaburma](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/karaburma), the rest of the municipality on the page [flats to rent in Palilula](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/palilula), and the settlement on the hill on the page [flats to rent in Mirijevo](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/mirijevo).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'rent' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id = (SELECT d.id FROM districts d JOIN cities ci ON ci.id = d.city_id WHERE d.latn = 'Karaburma' AND ci.latn = 'Beograd') AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja stanova u Borči, naselju na levoj obali Dunava: stanovi u novim manjim zgradama, stanovi u starijim zgradama iz vremena izgradnje naselja i spratovi u porodičnim kućama. Cene su znatno niže nego preko reke, pa ovde kupuju oni kojima je važna kvadratura.

Most koji vodi ka Zemunu i Novom Beogradu skratio je put do tog dela grada, dok se ka centru ide Pančevačkim mostom, gde su gužve svakodnevne: proverite koji vam pravac treba. Teren je nizak i ravan, sa visokim podzemnim vodama, pa izbegavajte suterene i pitajte kako je izolovano prizemlje. Kanalizacija nije stigla u sve ulice, a asfalt i trotoari se razlikuju od ulice do ulice. Kod novogradnje su dozvole i uknjiženost na prvom mestu. Pitajte za grejanje i izolaciju. Kuće sa dvorištem nudi stranica [kuće u Borči](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/beograd/borca), susedna naselja stranice [stanovi u Krnjači](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/krnjaca) i [u Kotežu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/kotez), a zakup stranica [izdavanje stanova u Borči](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/borca).', text_en = 'Flats for sale in Borča, the settlement on the left bank of the Danube: flats in small new buildings, flats in older buildings from the time the settlement was built and floors of family houses. Prices are far lower than across the river, so the buyers here are those for whom floor area matters.

The bridge leading to Zemun and New Belgrade has shortened the trip to that part of the city, while the centre is reached by the Pančevo Bridge, where jams are a daily matter: check which direction you need. The ground is low and flat, with high groundwater, so avoid basements and ask how the ground floor is insulated. Sewerage has not reached every street, and tarmac and pavements differ from street to street. With a new development, the permits and registration come first. Ask about heating and insulation. Houses with a garden are on the page [houses in Borča](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/beograd/borca), neighbouring settlements on the pages [flats in Krnjača](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/krnjaca) and [in Kotež](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/kotez), and rentals on the page [flats to rent in Borča](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/borca).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id = (SELECT d.id FROM districts d JOIN cities ci ON ci.id = d.city_id WHERE d.latn = 'Borča' AND ci.latn = 'Beograd') AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja stanova u Krnjači, naselju odmah preko Pančevačkog mosta: stanovi u novim zgradama sa nekoliko spratova, stanovi u kućama i manji stanovi u starijim objektima uz glavni put. Od svih naselja na levoj obali Dunava ovo je najbliže centru.

Ta blizina vredi onoliko koliko je most prohodan, pa put do posla probajte u jutarnjem špicu. Naselje je između reke, pruge i industrijske zone, zato obiđite okolinu zgrade i poslušajte kamione i vozove. Tlo je nisko, pa pitajte za podzemne vode i kako se zgrada ponaša posle velikih kiša. Proverite kanalizaciju, jer deo ulica koristi septičke jame. Kod novih zgrada tražite sve dozvole i proverite investitora. Do škole i doma zdravlja nije svuda blizu, što je važno porodicama. Niska cena kvadrata ostavlja prostor za opremanje, ali računajte i na troškove grejanja. Veće susedno naselje nudi stranica [stanovi u Borči](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/borca), mirniji kraj stranica [stanovi u Kotežu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/kotez), a opštinu stranica [stanovi na Paliluli](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/palilula).', text_en = 'Flats for sale in Krnjača, the settlement right across the Pančevo Bridge: flats in new buildings of a few storeys, flats in houses and smaller flats in older buildings along the main road. Of all the settlements on the left bank of the Danube, this one is closest to the centre.

That closeness is worth as much as the bridge is passable, so try the trip to work in the morning rush. The settlement lies between the river, the railway and an industrial zone, so walk around the building and listen for lorries and trains. The ground is low, so ask about groundwater and how the building behaves after heavy rain. Check the sewerage, because some streets use septic tanks. With new buildings, ask for all the permits and check the developer. A school and a health centre are not close everywhere, which matters to families. The low price per square metre leaves room for furnishing, but allow for heating costs too. The bigger neighbouring settlement is on the page [flats in Borča](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/borca), a quieter area on the page [flats in Kotež](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/kotez), and the municipality on the page [flats in Palilula](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/palilula).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id = (SELECT d.id FROM districts d JOIN cities ci ON ci.id = d.city_id WHERE d.latn = 'Krnjača' AND ci.latn = 'Beograd') AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja stanova u Kaluđerici, velikom naselju na istočnom obodu Beograda, u opštini Grocka: stanovi u novim manjim zgradama, stanovi u kućama sa više jedinica i dupleksi u potkrovlju. Kvadrat je ovde znatno jeftiniji nego u susednim gradskim naseljima.

Kaluđerica je najvećim delom nastala bez planova, pa je legalnost prvo što se proverava: tražite list nepokretnosti, proverite da li je zgrada ozakonjena i da li je stan upisan kao posebna jedinica. Banke ne odobravaju kredit za neuknjižen stan. Ulice su uske i strme, a kanalizacija se još gradi, pa pitajte kako je rešen odvod. Autobusi voze ka Zvezdari i centru, a autoput je blizu, ali se u špicu putuje dugo. Pogledajte gde se parkira i kako se ulica održava zimi. Naselje ima škole, vrtiće i sve prodavnice. Stanove bliže gradu nude stranice [stanovi u Malom Mokrom Lugu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/mali-mokri-lug) i [u Mirijevu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/mirijevo), ostatak opštine stranica [stanovi u Grockoj](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/grocka), a kuće stranica [kuće u Grockoj](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/grocka).', text_en = 'Flats for sale in Kaluđerica, the large settlement on the eastern edge of Belgrade, in the municipality of Grocka: flats in small new buildings, flats in houses with several units and attic duplexes. A square metre here is far cheaper than in the neighbouring city settlements.

Kaluđerica grew for the most part without plans, so legality is the first thing to check: ask for the land registry extract, check that the building has been legalised and that the flat is entered as a separate unit. Banks do not grant a loan for an unregistered flat. The streets are narrow and steep, and the sewerage is still being built, so ask how the drainage is dealt with. Buses run to Zvezdara and the centre and the motorway is near, but at rush hour the trip is long. See where people park and how the street is kept passable in winter. The settlement has schools, nurseries and every kind of shop. Flats closer to the city are on the pages [flats in Mali Mokri Lug](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/mali-mokri-lug) and [in Mirijevo](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/mirijevo), the rest of the municipality on the page [flats in Grocka](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/grocka), and houses on the page [houses in Grocka](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/grocka).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id = (SELECT d.id FROM districts d JOIN cities ci ON ci.id = d.city_id WHERE d.latn = 'Kaluđerica' AND ci.latn = 'Beograd') AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja stanova na Voždovcu: stanovi oko Autokomande i Dušanovca, stanovi u naseljima Braće Jerković i Medaković, mirne ulice sa manjim zgradama ispod Banjice i nova gradnja na obodu opštine. Voždovac se pruža od šireg centra do podnožja Avale.

Deo bliže centru ima tramvaj, pijace i fakultete, pa se mali stanovi lako izdaju. Naselja na brdu su porodična, sa školama i parkovima, ali zavise od autobusa. Blizina autoputa skraćuje put automobilom, a uz njega proverite buku. Nove zgrade su česte u ulicama sa kućama: pogledajte garažu, širinu ulice i šta se gradi pored. U starijim zgradama pitajte za lift, krov i održavanje. Stanovi sa daljinskim grejanjem imaju predvidljivije račune. Zakup nudi stranica [izdavanje stanova na Voždovcu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/vozdovac), pojedine krajeve stranice [stanovi na Banjici](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/banjica), [na Medakoviću](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/medakovic) i [u Kumodražu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/kumodraz), a skupljeg suseda stranica [stanovi na Vračaru](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/vracar).', text_en = 'Flats for sale in Voždovac: flats around Autokomanda and Dušanovac, flats in the settlements of Braće Jerković and Medaković, quiet streets with smaller buildings below Banjica and new construction on the edge of the municipality. Voždovac stretches from near the centre to the foot of Avala.

The part closer to the centre has the tram, markets and faculties, so small flats let easily. The settlements on the hill are family areas with schools and parks, but they depend on buses. Being near the motorway shortens a car journey, though check the noise alongside it. New buildings are common in streets of houses: look at the garage, the width of the street and what is being built next door. In older buildings, ask about the lift, the roof and the upkeep. Flats with district heating have more predictable bills. Rentals are on the page [flats to rent in Voždovac](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/vozdovac), individual areas on the pages [flats in Banjica](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/banjica), [in Medaković](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/medakovic) and [in Kumodraž](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/kumodraz), and the dearer neighbour on the page [flats in Vračar](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/vracar).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id = (SELECT d.id FROM districts d JOIN cities ci ON ci.id = d.city_id WHERE d.latn = 'Voždovac' AND ci.latn = 'Beograd') AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Izdavanje stanova na Voždovcu: garsonjere i jednosobni stanovi blizu fakulteta, dvosobni stanovi u naseljima na brdu, stanovi u kućama u mirnim ulicama i noviji stanovi sa garažom. Opština je velika, pa se pod istim imenom nude i stanovi blizu centra i oni znatno dalje.

U blizini su fakulteti organizacionih nauka i saobraćaja, pa studenti traže stanove na pešačkoj udaljenosti i uz tramvajsku prugu. Zaposleni koji idu automobilom cene brz izlaz na autoput. Pre nego što se odlučite, pogledajte na mapi tačan položaj stana i proverite linije prevoza. Pitajte kako se stan greje i koliki su računi zimi. U kućama dogovorite korišćenje dvorišta i parking. Proverite da li u blizini ima marketa i pijace, jer naselja na brdu nisu podjednako opremljena. Kupovinu nudi stranica [stanovi na Voždovcu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/vozdovac), pojedine krajeve stranica [izdavanje stanova u Kumodražu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/kumodraz), kraj uz autoput stranica [izdavanje stanova na Konjarniku](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/konjarnik), a centar stranica [izdavanje stanova na Vračaru](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/vracar).', text_en = 'Flats to rent in Voždovac: studios and one-bedroom flats near the faculties, two-bedroom flats in the settlements on the hill, flats in houses in quiet streets and newer flats with a garage. The municipality is large, so flats both close to the centre and a good deal further out are offered under the same name.

The faculties of organisational sciences and of transport are nearby, so students look for flats within walking distance and along the tram line. People who commute by car value the quick access to the motorway. Before you decide, look at the exact position of the flat on the map and check the transport lines. Ask how the flat is heated and how high the bills are in winter. In houses, agree the use of the garden and the parking. Check whether there is a supermarket and a market nearby, because the settlements on the hill are not equally well served. Buying is on the page [flats in Voždovac](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/vozdovac), individual areas on the page [flats to rent in Kumodraž](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/kumodraz), the area by the motorway on the page [flats to rent in Konjarnik](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/konjarnik), and the centre on the page [flats to rent in Vračar](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/vracar).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'rent' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id = (SELECT d.id FROM districts d JOIN cities ci ON ci.id = d.city_id WHERE d.latn = 'Voždovac' AND ci.latn = 'Beograd') AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja stanova na Banjici, naselju na brdu između Voždovca i Dedinja: stanovi u dugim zgradama i soliterima građenim sedamdesetih, stanovi u manjim zgradama starog dela naselja i retka nova gradnja. Okruženo je šumom, sa sportskim centrom i velikom bolnicom u blizini.

Naselje je planski građeno, sa školom, vrtićima, pijacom i mnogo zelenila između zgrada, pa ga biraju porodice. Stanovi su prostrani i dobro raspoređeni za svoje godište, a daljinsko grejanje je standard. Pošto su zgrade stare pola veka, pitajte za liftove, fasadu, krov i vertikale i da li stambena zajednica uredno funkcioniše. Trolejbus i tramvaj povezuju kraj sa centrom, a autoput je blizu. Pogledajte na koju stranu stan gleda: ka šumi je mirno, ka bulevaru bučnije. Parkinga ima više nego u centru. Stanovi sa terasom i pogledom na šumu najbrže nalaze kupca. Celu opštinu nudi stranica [stanovi na Voždovcu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/vozdovac), elitni susedni kraj stranica [stanovi na Dedinju](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/dedinje), a naselje preko šume stranica [stanovi u Rakovici](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/rakovica).', text_en = 'Flats for sale in Banjica, the settlement on the hill between Voždovac and Dedinje: flats in long slab blocks and towers built in the seventies, flats in smaller buildings in the old part of the settlement and rare new construction. It is surrounded by forest, with a sports centre and a big hospital nearby.

The settlement was built to a plan, with a school, nurseries, a market and plenty of greenery between the buildings, so families choose it. The flats are roomy and well laid out for their age, and district heating is standard. As the buildings are half a century old, ask about the lifts, the facade, the roof and the risers and whether the residents'' association functions properly. A trolleybus and a tram connect the area with the centre, and the motorway is close. See which way the flat faces: towards the forest it is quiet, towards the boulevard noisier. There is more parking than in the centre. Flats with a balcony and a forest view find a buyer fastest. The whole municipality is on the page [flats in Voždovac](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/vozdovac), the elite neighbouring area on the page [flats in Dedinje](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/dedinje), and the settlement across the forest on the page [flats in Rakovica](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/rakovica).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id = (SELECT d.id FROM districts d JOIN cities ci ON ci.id = d.city_id WHERE d.latn = 'Banjica' AND ci.latn = 'Beograd') AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja stanova u Rakovici, opštini na jugu Beograda nastaloj oko fabrika: stanovi u radničkim zgradama, soliteri i blokovi na Vidikovcu, Miljakovcu, Kanarevom i Labudovom brdu i novogradnja u ulicama oko starog jezgra. Cene su umerene, a zelenila ima na svakom koraku.

Naselja su na brdima i svako je mala celina sa svojom pijacom i školom, okružena šumama Košutnjaka i Miljakovca. Vozom se sa stanice u Rakovici brzo stiže do centra, što je prednost koju mnogi kupci previde. Nekadašnje fabričke zone menjaju namenu, pa proverite šta se planira u blizini stana. U starijim zgradama pitajte za lift, fasadu i grejanje. Kod novogradnje na padini proverite temelje, garažu i dozvole. Putevi ka centru vode kroz nekoliko uskih grla, pa probajte vožnju u špicu. Zakup nudi stranica [izdavanje stanova u Rakovici](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/rakovica), pojedina naselja stranice [stanovi na Vidikovcu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/vidikovac), [na Kanarevom brdu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/kanarevo-brdo) i [na Labudovom brdu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/labudovo-brdo), a obod opštine stranica [stanovi u Resniku](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/resnik).', text_en = 'Flats for sale in Rakovica, the municipality in the south of Belgrade that grew up around factories: flats in workers'' buildings, towers and estates in Vidikovac, Miljakovac, Kanarevo Brdo and Labudovo Brdo and new developments in the streets around the old core. Prices are moderate, and there is greenery at every step.

The settlements are on hills and each is a small whole with its own market and school, surrounded by the forests of Košutnjak and Miljakovac. The train from Rakovica station gets to the centre quickly, an advantage many buyers overlook. The former factory zones are changing use, so check what is planned near the flat. In older buildings, ask about the lift, the facade and the heating. With a new development on a slope, check the foundations, the garage and the permits. The roads to the centre pass through several bottlenecks, so try the drive at rush hour. Rentals are on the page [flats to rent in Rakovica](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/rakovica), individual settlements on the pages [flats in Vidikovac](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/vidikovac), [in Kanarevo Brdo](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/kanarevo-brdo) and [in Labudovo Brdo](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/labudovo-brdo), and the edge of the municipality on the page [flats in Resnik](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/resnik).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id = (SELECT d.id FROM districts d JOIN cities ci ON ci.id = d.city_id WHERE d.latn = 'Rakovica' AND ci.latn = 'Beograd') AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Izdavanje stanova u Rakovici: garsonjere i jednosobni stanovi u starijim zgradama, dvosobni stanovi u soliterima, noviji stanovi u manjim zgradama i spratovi u kućama. Kirije su pristupačnije nego u opštinama bliže centru, a kraj je miran i zelen.

Zakupci su mlade porodice i zaposleni koji ne moraju svakog dana u centar, kao i oni koji koriste voz. Proverite koliko je stan udaljen od železničke stanice ili od autobuske okretnice, jer brdovit teren čini da kratka razdaljina na mapi bude dug hod uzbrdo. Pitajte da li je grejanje daljinsko i koliki su troškovi zgrade. U soliterima proverite rad liftova. Šume i staze za šetnju su na nekoliko minuta, što je retkost u gradu. Dogovorite depozit, otkazni rok i ko popravlja kućne aparate. Kupovinu nudi stranica [stanovi u Rakovici](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/rakovica), pojedina naselja stranice [izdavanje stanova na Vidikovcu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/vidikovac), [na Kanarevom brdu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/kanarevo-brdo) i [na Labudovom brdu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/labudovo-brdo), a susednu opštinu stranica [izdavanje stanova na Čukarici](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/cukarica).', text_en = 'Flats to rent in Rakovica: studios and one-bedroom flats in older buildings, two-bedroom flats in tower blocks, newer flats in smaller buildings and floors of houses. Rents are more affordable than in the municipalities closer to the centre, and the area is calm and green.

Tenants are young families and working people who do not have to go to the centre every day, as well as those who use the train. Check how far the flat is from the railway station or the bus terminus, because the hilly ground turns a short distance on the map into a long walk uphill. Ask whether the heating is district heating and what the building charges are. In tower blocks, check that the lifts work. Forests and walking paths are a few minutes away, which is rare in a city. Agree the deposit, the notice period and who repairs household appliances. Buying is on the page [flats in Rakovica](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/rakovica), individual settlements on the pages [flats to rent in Vidikovac](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/vidikovac), [in Kanarevo Brdo](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/kanarevo-brdo) and [in Labudovo Brdo](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/labudovo-brdo), and the neighbouring municipality on the page [flats to rent in Čukarica](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/cukarica).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'rent' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id = (SELECT d.id FROM districts d JOIN cities ci ON ci.id = d.city_id WHERE d.latn = 'Rakovica' AND ci.latn = 'Beograd') AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja stanova na Vidikovcu, naselju na uzvišenju u Rakovici, koje ime duguje pogledu na grad: stanovi u soliterima i dugim zgradama iz sedamdesetih i osamdesetih, stanovi u nižim zgradama i poneka nova zgrada na obodu naselja.

Naselje je zaokruženo i praktično: pijaca, tržni centar, škole, vrtići i velika okretnica autobusa na jednom mestu. Stanovi na višim spratovima imaju pogled koji se pamti, ali zavise od liftova, pa pitajte kada su menjani i koliko često staju. Zgrade su građene solidno, sa daljinskim grejanjem, a mnoge čekaju obnovu fasade. Košutnjak je odmah pored, što znači čist vazduh i staze za šetnju. Do centra se putuje autobusom preko Banovog brda ili kroz Rakovicu, pa proverite trajanje u špicu. Parking je uglavnom dovoljan. Kod kupovine pogledajte i stanje ulaza i krova. Zakup nudi stranica [izdavanje stanova na Vidikovcu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/vidikovac), opštinu stranica [stanovi u Rakovici](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/rakovica), a susedna naselja stranice [stanovi na Ceraku](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/cerak) i [na Labudovom brdu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/labudovo-brdo).', text_en = 'Flats for sale in Vidikovac, the settlement on a rise in Rakovica that owes its name to the view of the city: flats in tower blocks and long slab blocks from the seventies and eighties, flats in lower buildings and the odd new building on the edge of the settlement.

The settlement is self-contained and practical: a market, a shopping centre, schools, nurseries and a big bus terminus in one place. Flats on the higher floors have a view to remember, but they depend on the lifts, so ask when they were replaced and how often they break down. The buildings are solidly built, with district heating, and many are waiting for a facade renewal. Košutnjak is right alongside, which means clean air and walking paths. You travel to the centre by bus via Banovo Brdo or through Rakovica, so check how long it takes at rush hour. Parking is mostly sufficient. When buying, look at the state of the entrance and the roof too. Rentals are on the page [flats to rent in Vidikovac](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/vidikovac), the municipality on the page [flats in Rakovica](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/rakovica), and neighbouring settlements on the pages [flats in Cerak](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/cerak) and [in Labudovo Brdo](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/labudovo-brdo).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id = (SELECT d.id FROM districts d JOIN cities ci ON ci.id = d.city_id WHERE d.latn = 'Vidikovac' AND ci.latn = 'Beograd') AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Izdavanje stanova na Vidikovcu: garsonjere, jednosobni i dvosobni stanovi u soliterima i lamelama, sa pogledom na grad ili na Košutnjak. Naselje je mirno i dobro snabdeveno, pa odgovara porodicama, parovima i studentima koji ne žele gužvu centra.

Autobuska okretnica je srce naselja i sa nje polaze linije ka centru, Novom Beogradu i Banovom brdu: što ste joj bliže, lakše je bez automobila. Pitajte na kom je spratu stan i da li lift radi pouzdano. Daljinsko grejanje i troškovi zgrade obično glase na vlasnika, pa dogovorite šta ulazi u kiriju. Starije stanove pogledajte pažljivo zbog stolarije i kupatila. Viši spratovi su svetli i promajni, što leti prija, a zimi traži dobre prozore. Pijaca i tržni centar su na nekoliko minuta. Stan obiđite i vikendom, kada je naselje najživlje. Kupovinu nudi stranica [stanovi na Vidikovcu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/vidikovac), okolna naselja stranice [izdavanje stanova u Rakovici](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/rakovica) i [na Ceraku](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/cerak), a kraj bliže reci stranica [izdavanje stanova na Banovom brdu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/banovo-brdo).', text_en = 'Flats to rent in Vidikovac: studios and one- and two-bedroom flats in tower blocks and slab blocks, with a view of the city or of Košutnjak. The settlement is calm and well supplied, so it suits families, couples and students who do not want the bustle of the centre.

The bus terminus is the heart of the settlement, with lines leaving for the centre, New Belgrade and Banovo Brdo: the closer you are to it, the easier life is without a car. Ask which floor the flat is on and whether the lift is reliable. District heating and building charges are usually in the owner''s name, so agree what the rent includes. Look at older flats carefully for the joinery and the bathroom. Higher floors are bright and airy, which is pleasant in summer and calls for good windows in winter. A market and a shopping centre are a few minutes away. Visit the flat at the weekend too, when the settlement is liveliest. Buying is on the page [flats in Vidikovac](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/vidikovac), surrounding settlements on the pages [flats to rent in Rakovica](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/rakovica) and [in Cerak](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/cerak), and the area closer to the river on the page [flats to rent in Banovo Brdo](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/banovo-brdo).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'rent' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id = (SELECT d.id FROM districts d JOIN cities ci ON ci.id = d.city_id WHERE d.latn = 'Vidikovac' AND ci.latn = 'Beograd') AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja stanova na Čukarici, opštini koja se pruža od Ade Ciganlije do oboda grada: stanovi na Banovom brdu, u Žarkovu, na Ceraku i Julinom brdu, stanovi u Železniku i Sremčici i novogradnja u gotovo svakom od ovih krajeva.

Malo koja opština ima toliko različitih celina, pa se cene i stil života menjaju od naselja do naselja. Bliže reci i Košutnjaku su traženiji i skuplji stanovi, a ka obodu opštine dobija se više kvadrata za isti novac. Ada Ciganlija je velika prednost za porodice i sportiste. Proverite kako naselje stoji sa prevozom, jer se ka centru ide preko nekoliko opterećenih pravaca. U starijim zgradama pitajte za lift i grejanje, a kod novih za dozvole i garažu. Uporedite više naselja pre odluke. Po krajevima ponudu dele stranice [stanovi na Banovom brdu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/banovo-brdo), [u Žarkovu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/zarkovo), [na Ceraku](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/cerak) i [u Železniku](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/zeleznik), a zakup stranica [izdavanje stanova na Čukarici](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/cukarica).', text_en = 'Flats for sale in Čukarica, the municipality that stretches from Ada Ciganlija to the edge of the city: flats in Banovo Brdo, Žarkovo, Cerak and Julino Brdo, flats in Železnik and Sremčica and new developments in almost every one of these areas.

Few municipalities have so many different parts, so prices and the way of life change from one settlement to the next. Closer to the river and Košutnjak the flats are more sought after and dearer, while towards the edge of the municipality you get more square metres for the same money. Ada Ciganlija is a great advantage for families and sports people. Check how the settlement is served by transport, because the centre is reached along a few congested routes. In older buildings, ask about the lift and the heating, and with new ones about the permits and the garage. Compare several settlements before deciding. By area, the offer is split across the pages [flats in Banovo Brdo](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/banovo-brdo), [in Žarkovo](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/zarkovo), [in Cerak](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/cerak) and [in Železnik](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/zeleznik), and rentals are on the page [flats to rent in Čukarica](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/cukarica).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id = (SELECT d.id FROM districts d JOIN cities ci ON ci.id = d.city_id WHERE d.latn = 'Čukarica' AND ci.latn = 'Beograd') AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Izdavanje stanova na Čukarici: garsonjere i jednosobni stanovi na Banovom brdu, dvosobni stanovi u Žarkovu i na Ceraku, povoljniji stanovi u Železniku i stanovi u kućama u mirnim ulicama. Opština nudi sve, od gradske vreve do skoro prigradskog mira.

Najpre odlučite šta vam je važnije: blizina Ade i tramvaja ili niža kirija dalje od reke. Studenti šumarstva i sportskog fakulteta traže stanove oko Košutnjaka, a porodice naselja sa školama i parkovima. Pitajte koje linije voze ka centru i Novom Beogradu i koliko im treba ujutru. Proverite grejanje, jer nisu sva naselja na toplani. U stanovima u kućama dogovorite odvojena brojila i parking. Leti je kraj oko Ade pun kupača, pa je parkiranje teže. Pogledajte i gde su pijaca i dom zdravlja. Kupovinu nudi stranica [stanovi na Čukarici](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/cukarica), pojedine krajeve stranice [izdavanje stanova na Banovom brdu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/banovo-brdo), [u Žarkovu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/zarkovo) i [u Železniku](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/zeleznik), a susednu opštinu stranica [izdavanje stanova u Rakovici](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/rakovica).', text_en = 'Flats to rent in Čukarica: studios and one-bedroom flats in Banovo Brdo, two-bedroom flats in Žarkovo and Cerak, cheaper flats in Železnik and flats in houses in quiet streets. The municipality offers everything from city bustle to almost suburban peace.

First decide what matters more to you: being near Ada and the tram or a lower rent further from the river. Students of forestry and of the sports faculty look for flats around Košutnjak, and families for settlements with schools and parks. Ask which lines run to the centre and New Belgrade and how long they take in the morning. Check the heating, because not all the settlements are on district heating. With flats in houses, agree separate meters and the parking. In summer the area around Ada is full of bathers, so parking is harder. See where the market and the health centre are too. Buying is on the page [flats in Čukarica](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/cukarica), individual areas on the pages [flats to rent in Banovo Brdo](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/banovo-brdo), [in Žarkovo](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/zarkovo) and [in Železnik](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/zeleznik), and the neighbouring municipality on the page [flats to rent in Rakovica](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/rakovica).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'rent' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id = (SELECT d.id FROM districts d JOIN cities ci ON ci.id = d.city_id WHERE d.latn = 'Čukarica' AND ci.latn = 'Beograd') AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja stanova na Banovom brdu, najpoznatijem kraju Čukarice: stanovi u zgradama duž Požeške ulice, stanovi u mirnim ulicama ka Košutnjaku, predratne vile podeljene na stanove i brojna novogradnja. Između Ade Ciganlije i šume, kraj ima sve što je potrebno za život bez odlaska u centar.

Požeška je trgovačka ulica sa tramvajem, pijacom i bioskopom: stanovi uz nju su praktični, ali bučniji, dok ulice na padini ka Košutnjaku nude mir i zelenilo. Nove zgrade su često na mestu starih kuća, pa proverite garažu i širinu prilaza. Kod starijih zgrada raspitajte se o liftu, krovu i načinu grejanja. Blizina Ade diže cenu, naročito stanovima sa terasom. Parkiranje je u gornjem delu lakše nego oko pijace. Strme ulice zimi traže oprez, pa pogledajte prilaz zgradi. Zakup nudi stranica [izdavanje stanova na Banovom brdu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/banovo-brdo), susedne krajeve stranice [stanovi na Julinom brdu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/julino-brdo) i [u Žarkovu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/zarkovo), a opštinu stranica [stanovi na Čukarici](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/cukarica).', text_en = 'Flats for sale in Banovo Brdo, the best-known part of Čukarica: flats in the buildings along Požeška Street, flats in the quiet streets towards Košutnjak, pre-war villas divided into flats and numerous new developments. Between Ada Ciganlija and the forest, the area has everything you need to live without going to the centre.

Požeška is a shopping street with a tram, a market and a cinema: flats along it are practical but noisier, while the streets on the slope towards Košutnjak offer peace and greenery. New buildings are often in place of old houses, so check the garage and the width of the access. With older buildings, find out about the lift, the roof and the type of heating. Being near Ada raises the price, especially for flats with a balcony. Parking is easier in the upper part than around the market. Steep streets call for care in winter, so look at the approach to the building. Rentals are on the page [flats to rent in Banovo Brdo](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/banovo-brdo), neighbouring areas on the pages [flats in Julino Brdo](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/julino-brdo) and [in Žarkovo](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/zarkovo), and the municipality on the page [flats in Čukarica](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/cukarica).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id = (SELECT d.id FROM districts d JOIN cities ci ON ci.id = d.city_id WHERE d.latn = 'Banovo brdo' AND ci.latn = 'Beograd') AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Izdavanje stanova na Banovom brdu: garsonjere i jednosobni stanovi blizu Požeške, dvosobni stanovi u novim zgradama, stanovi u vilama sa baštom i spratovi u kućama ka Košutnjaku. Ada Ciganlija je na nekoliko minuta hoda, što leti menja svakodnevicu.

Kraj vole mladi zaposleni, sportisti i porodice, pa se dobri stanovi ne zadržavaju dugo u oglasima. Tramvaj vozi ka centru i Novom Beogradu, a autobusi pokrivaju ostale pravce: proverite koja vam je stanica najbliža. Pitajte da li je stan na daljinskom grejanju i da li ima klimu, jer su potkrovlja leti vrela. Uz Požešku se čuje saobraćaj do kasno, pa ako ste osetljivi na buku, tražite dvorišnu stranu. Parking oko pijace je teško naći. U kućama dogovorite korišćenje bašte. Blizina šume i jezera znači i više komaraca u letnjim večerima. Kupovinu nudi stranica [stanovi na Banovom brdu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/banovo-brdo), povoljnije susedstvo stranica [izdavanje stanova u Žarkovu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/zarkovo), a celu opštinu stranica [izdavanje stanova na Čukarici](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/cukarica).', text_en = 'Flats to rent in Banovo Brdo: studios and one-bedroom flats near Požeška Street, two-bedroom flats in new buildings, flats in villas with a garden and floors of houses towards Košutnjak. Ada Ciganlija is a few minutes'' walk away, which changes everyday life in summer.

Young professionals, sports people and families love the area, so good flats do not stay in the ads for long. The tram runs to the centre and New Belgrade and buses cover the other directions: check which stop is nearest to you. Ask whether the flat is on district heating and whether it has air conditioning, because attics are scorching in summer. Traffic can be heard along Požeška until late, so if you are sensitive to noise, ask for the courtyard side. Parking around the market is hard to find. In houses, agree the use of the garden. Being near the forest and the lake also means more mosquitoes on summer evenings. Buying is on the page [flats in Banovo Brdo](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/banovo-brdo), a cheaper neighbourhood on the page [flats to rent in Žarkovo](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/zarkovo), and the whole municipality on the page [flats to rent in Čukarica](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/cukarica).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'rent' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id = (SELECT d.id FROM districts d JOIN cities ci ON ci.id = d.city_id WHERE d.latn = 'Banovo brdo' AND ci.latn = 'Beograd') AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja stanova u Žarkovu, naselju na Čukarici iznad Banovog brda: stanovi u novim zgradama u ulicama sa kućama, stanovi u starijim zgradama uz glavnu ulicu, stanovi na Belim vodama i dupleksi u potkrovlju. Poslednjih godina ovo je jedno od najvećih gradilišta stambene novogradnje u gradu.

Novi stan po umerenoj ceni glavni je razlog dolaska, ali gradnja je gusta: proverite koliko se zgrada diže u istoj ulici, gde će se parkirati i da li ulica ima trotoar. Tražite upotrebnu dozvolu i uknjižen stan. Pitajte kako se zgrada greje, jer se uz toplanu koriste i gas i toplotne pumpe. Naselje ima škole, pijacu i tržni centar u blizini, a do Košutnjaka i Ade nije daleko. Ka centru se ide autobusom, uz gužve u špicu. Potkrovlja proverite zbog izolacije i visine. Zakup nudi stranica [izdavanje stanova u Žarkovu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/zarkovo), deo naselja stranica [stanovi na Belim vodama](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/bele-vode), a susedne krajeve stranice [stanovi na Banovom brdu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/banovo-brdo) i [na Ceraku](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/cerak).', text_en = 'Flats for sale in Žarkovo, the settlement in Čukarica above Banovo Brdo: flats in new buildings in streets of houses, flats in older buildings along the main street, flats in Bele Vode and attic duplexes. In recent years this has been one of the biggest sites of new housing in the city.

A new flat at a moderate price is the main reason for coming, but construction is dense: check how many buildings are going up in the same street, where people will park and whether the street has a pavement. Ask for the occupancy permit and a registered flat. Ask how the building is heated, because gas and heat pumps are used alongside district heating. The settlement has schools, a market and a shopping centre nearby, and Košutnjak and Ada are not far. You go to the centre by bus, with jams at rush hour. Check attics for insulation and height. Rentals are on the page [flats to rent in Žarkovo](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/zarkovo), part of the settlement on the page [flats in Bele Vode](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/bele-vode), and neighbouring areas on the pages [flats in Banovo Brdo](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/banovo-brdo) and [in Cerak](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/cerak).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id = (SELECT d.id FROM districts d JOIN cities ci ON ci.id = d.city_id WHERE d.latn = 'Žarkovo' AND ci.latn = 'Beograd') AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Izdavanje stanova u Žarkovu: novi jednosobni i dvosobni stanovi u manjim zgradama, stanovi u kućama sa odvojenim ulazom, garsonjere i veći stanovi za porodice. Većina stanova je novijeg datuma, pa su kupatila, stolarija i izolacija u dobrom stanju.

Zakupci su mladi parovi i porodice koji traže nov stan i miran kraj, a ne smeta im vožnja do centra. Pitajte da li je uz stan obezbeđeno parking mesto, jer su ulice uske i pune automobila. Proverite kako se greje i da li račun za grejanje stiže posebno. Autobusi vode ka Banovom brdu, centru i Novom Beogradu, pa pogledajte red vožnje i udaljenost stanice. Vrtić i škola u blizini olakšavaju jutra. Nove zgrade imaju lift, ali proverite da li je pušten u rad. Stan pogledajte danju, zbog buke okolnih gradilišta. Kupovinu nudi stranica [stanovi u Žarkovu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/zarkovo), deo naselja stranica [izdavanje stanova na Belim vodama](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/bele-vode), življi kraj stranica [izdavanje stanova na Banovom brdu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/banovo-brdo), a susedstvo stranica [izdavanje stanova na Ceraku](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/cerak).', text_en = 'Flats to rent in Žarkovo: new one- and two-bedroom flats in smaller buildings, flats in houses with a separate entrance, studios and bigger flats for families. Most of the flats are recent, so the bathrooms, joinery and insulation are in good condition.

Tenants are young couples and families who want a new flat and a quiet area and do not mind the ride to the centre. Ask whether a parking space is provided with the flat, because the streets are narrow and full of cars. Check how it is heated and whether the heating bill arrives separately. Buses go to Banovo Brdo, the centre and New Belgrade, so look at the timetable and the distance to the stop. A nursery and a school nearby make mornings easier. New buildings have a lift, but check that it has been put into service. View the flat by day, because of the noise from the surrounding building sites. Buying is on the page [flats in Žarkovo](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/zarkovo), part of the settlement on the page [flats to rent in Bele Vode](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/bele-vode), a livelier area on the page [flats to rent in Banovo Brdo](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/banovo-brdo), and the neighbourhood on the page [flats to rent in Cerak](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/cerak).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'rent' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id = (SELECT d.id FROM districts d JOIN cities ci ON ci.id = d.city_id WHERE d.latn = 'Žarkovo' AND ci.latn = 'Beograd') AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja stanova na Ceraku, naselju na Čukarici uz Košutnjak: stanovi u zgradama od crvene opeke u Cerak vinogradima, stanovi u okolnim blokovima i novija gradnja na obodu naselja. Cerak vinogradi su poznati po arhitekturi prilagođenoj čoveku i zaštićeni su kao kulturno dobro.

Zgrade su niske, sa mnogo zelenila, pešačkim stazama i dvorištima bez automobila, što porodice sa decom izuzetno cene. Zbog zaštite se spoljašnji izgled ne sme menjati, pa pitajte šta važi za zastakljivanje terasa i zamenu stolarije. Stanovi imaju funkcionalne rasporede i daljinsko grejanje. Zgrade su stare više decenija, zato proverite krov, ravne terase i instalacije. Većina nema lift, pa je sprat važan. Parking je na obodu blokova. Do centra se ide autobusom, uz presedanje ili direktne linije. Zakup nudi stranica [izdavanje stanova na Ceraku](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/cerak), susedna naselja stranice [stanovi na Vidikovcu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/vidikovac) i [u Žarkovu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/zarkovo), a opštinu stranica [stanovi na Čukarici](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/cukarica).', text_en = 'Flats for sale in Cerak, the settlement in Čukarica by Košutnjak: flats in the red-brick buildings of Cerak Vinogradi, flats in the surrounding estates and newer construction on the edge of the settlement. Cerak Vinogradi is known for its human-scale architecture and is protected as a cultural asset.

The buildings are low, with plenty of greenery, footpaths and car-free courtyards, which families with children value highly. Because of the protection, the outward appearance must not be changed, so ask what applies to glazing balconies and replacing joinery. The flats have functional layouts and district heating. The buildings are several decades old, so check the roof, the flat terraces and the installations. Most have no lift, so the floor matters. Parking is on the edge of the blocks. You go to the centre by bus, with a change or by direct lines. Rentals are on the page [flats to rent in Cerak](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/cerak), neighbouring settlements on the pages [flats in Vidikovac](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/vidikovac) and [in Žarkovo](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/zarkovo), and the municipality on the page [flats in Čukarica](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/cukarica).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id = (SELECT d.id FROM districts d JOIN cities ci ON ci.id = d.city_id WHERE d.latn = 'Cerak' AND ci.latn = 'Beograd') AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja stanova u Železniku, naselju na jugozapadu Čukarice podignutom uz fabriku mašina: stanovi u radničkim zgradama i soliterima, stanovi u novijim manjim zgradama i spratovi u porodičnim kućama. Ovde su cene među najnižima na teritoriji užeg grada.

Naselje je samostalna celina, sa pijacom, školama, domom zdravlja i sportskim objektima, pa se za svakodnevne potrebe ne mora nikuda. Mana je udaljenost: do centra se putuje autobusom i to ume da potraje, zato probajte put u špicu. Stare zgrade imaju daljinsko grejanje i niske troškove, ali pitajte za liftove, fasadu i krov. Nekadašnji industrijski krug menja namenu, pa proverite šta se planira u okolini. Kod novih zgrada tražite dozvole i uknjižen stan. Okolina je zelena, sa šumom u blizini. Zakup nudi stranica [izdavanje stanova u Železniku](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/zeleznik), prigradsko naselje dalje ka jugu stranica [stanovi u Sremčici](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/sremcica), kraj bliže gradu stranica [stanovi u Žarkovu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/zarkovo), a opštinu stranica [stanovi na Čukarici](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/cukarica).', text_en = 'Flats for sale in Železnik, the settlement in the south-west of Čukarica built alongside a machine factory: flats in workers'' buildings and tower blocks, flats in newer small buildings and floors of family houses. Prices here are among the lowest within the city proper.

The settlement is self-contained, with a market, schools, a health centre and sports facilities, so there is no need to go anywhere for everyday needs. The drawback is the distance: you travel to the centre by bus and it can take a while, so try the trip at rush hour. The old buildings have district heating and low costs, but ask about the lifts, the facade and the roof. The former industrial compound is changing use, so check what is planned in the surroundings. With new buildings, ask for the permits and a registered flat. The surroundings are green, with a forest nearby. Rentals are on the page [flats to rent in Železnik](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/beograd/zeleznik), the suburban settlement further south on the page [flats in Sremčica](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/sremcica), an area closer to the city on the page [flats in Žarkovo](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/zarkovo), and the municipality on the page [flats in Čukarica](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/cukarica).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id = (SELECT d.id FROM districts d JOIN cities ci ON ci.id = d.city_id WHERE d.latn = 'Železnik' AND ci.latn = 'Beograd') AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja stanova u Sremčici, prigradskom naselju na Čukarici, na brdima iznad Ibarske magistrale: stanovi u novim manjim zgradama, stanovi u kućama sa više jedinica i dupleksi sa pogledom. Naselje je prvenstveno od porodičnih kuća, pa stanova ima manje, ali su jeftini.

Ovde se dolazi zbog mira, vazduha i cene, a plaća se udaljenošću od grada. Autobus do Banovog brda i centra vozi redovno, ali put traje, pa je automobil gotovo neophodan. Proverite da li je zgrada legalna i stan uknjižen, jer je dobar deo naselja građen bez dozvola. Pitajte za kanalizaciju, koja ne pokriva sve ulice, i za vodosnabdevanje u letnjim mesecima. Grejanje je najčešće na struju, pelet ili gas. Naselje ima školu, vrtić, dom zdravlja i prodavnice. Zimi su strme ulice klizave, pa pogledajte prilaz. Kuće sa dvorištem nudi stranica [kuće u Sremčici](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/beograd/sremcica), bliže naselje sa zgradama stranica [stanovi u Železniku](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/zeleznik), a opštinu stranica [stanovi na Čukarici](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/cukarica).', text_en = 'Flats for sale in Sremčica, the suburban settlement in Čukarica on the hills above the Ibar highway: flats in small new buildings, flats in houses with several units and duplexes with a view. The settlement consists mainly of family houses, so there are fewer flats, but they are cheap.

People come here for peace, air and price, and pay with distance from the city. The bus to Banovo Brdo and the centre runs regularly but the trip takes time, so a car is almost essential. Check that the building is legal and the flat registered, because a good part of the settlement was built without permits. Ask about sewerage, which does not cover every street, and about the water supply in the summer months. Heating is mostly electric, pellet or gas. The settlement has a school, a nursery, a health centre and shops. In winter the steep streets are slippery, so look at the approach. Houses with a garden are on the page [houses in Sremčica](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/beograd/sremcica), a nearer settlement with blocks on the page [flats in Železnik](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/zeleznik), and the municipality on the page [flats in Čukarica](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/beograd/cukarica).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Beograd') AND district_id = (SELECT d.id FROM districts d JOIN cities ci ON ci.id = d.city_id WHERE d.latn = 'Sremčica' AND ci.latn = 'Beograd') AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE landings SET text_sr = 'Prodaja stanova u Petrovaradinu, delu Novog Sada na desnoj obali Dunava: stanovi u baroknom podgrađu ispod tvrđave, stanovi u manjim novim zgradama i spratovi u porodičnim kućama na padinama. Tvrđava, reka i obronci Fruške gore daju kraju izgled kakav nema nijedan drugi deo grada.

Podgrađe je zaštićena celina sa starim kućama: stanovi su jedinstveni, ali proverite vlagu, krov i šta zavod za zaštitu dozvoljava. U novijim delovima preovlađuju manje zgrade, pa pitajte za dozvole, parking i grejanje, koje je najčešće na gas. Do centra se prelazi mostom za nekoliko minuta, osim u špicu i tokom velikog festivala na tvrđavi, kada je kraj pun posetilaca. Pogledajte padinu i potporne zidove, jer je teren nagnut. Mir, pogled i blizina prirode privlače one koji rade od kuće. Zakup nudi stranica [izdavanje stanova u Petrovaradinu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/novi-sad/petrovaradin), kuće stranica [kuće u Petrovaradinu](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/novi-sad/petrovaradin), susedno naselje stranica [stanovi u Sremskoj Kamenici](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/novi-sad/sremska-kamenica), a ceo grad stranica [prodaja stanova u Novom Sadu](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/novi-sad).', text_en = 'Flats for sale in Petrovaradin, the part of Novi Sad on the right bank of the Danube: flats in the baroque lower town below the fortress, flats in small new buildings and floors of family houses on the slopes. The fortress, the river and the foothills of Fruška Gora give the area a look no other part of the city has.

The lower town is a protected ensemble of old houses: the flats are unique, but check for damp, the roof and what the heritage institute allows. In the newer parts smaller buildings prevail, so ask about the permits, the parking and the heating, which is mostly gas. You cross to the centre by bridge in a few minutes, except at rush hour and during the big festival at the fortress, when the area is full of visitors. Look at the slope and the retaining walls, because the ground is inclined. Peace, the view and closeness to nature attract those who work from home. Rentals are on the page [flats to rent in Petrovaradin](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje/novi-sad/petrovaradin), houses on the page [houses in Petrovaradin](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/novi-sad/petrovaradin), the neighbouring settlement on the page [flats in Sremska Kamenica](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/novi-sad/sremska-kamenica), and the whole city on the page [flats for sale in Novi Sad](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/prodaja/novi-sad).' WHERE category_id = (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'apartments') AND deal = 'sale' AND item_type IS NULL AND brand IS NULL AND city_id = (SELECT id FROM cities WHERE latn = 'Novi Sad') AND district_id = (SELECT d.id FROM districts d JOIN cities ci ON ci.id = d.city_id WHERE d.latn = 'Petrovaradin' AND ci.latn = 'Novi Sad') AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
SQL;
